  "Disable In Low Quality Mode": "在低画质模式下禁用",
  "Use Normals From Base Polygons": "使用基础多边形的法线",
  "When enabled, the normals of the final surface will use the normals from the base polygons of the overlay instead of the normals of the surface that the overlay is being projected onto.": "启用后, 最终表面的法线将采用叠加层基础多边形的法线, 而非叠加层所投射到的表面的法线. ",
  "Projection Distance": "投射距离",
  "Material Adjustment Params": "物料调整参数",
  "Project On Backfacing": "项目: 背面剔除",
  "Maximum projection angle": "最大投影角度",
  "Specifies the maximum angle difference between the overlay and triangles the overlay will project onto. Value can be between 0 and 180, where 0 means the overlay will only project onto surfaces facing the exact same direction as the overlay, and 180 will allow the overlay to project onto surfaces facing completely the opposite direction.": "用于指定叠加层与其要投影到的三角形之间的最大角度差. 该数值范围为 0 至 180: 当设为 0 时, 叠加层仅能投影到与自身朝向完全相同的表面; 而当设为 180 时, 则可投影到朝向完全相反的表面. ",
  "Projection Mode": "投影模式",
  "Only world geometry": "仅显示世界地形",
  "Only models": "仅限模型",
  "Target Objects": "目标对象",
  "Meshes To Overlays": "网格转覆盖层",
  "Mesh Vertices": "网格顶点",
  "1 vertex": "1个顶点",
  "%d vertices": "%d 个顶点",
  "Mesh Edges": "网格边缘",
  "1 edge": "1 条边",
  "%d edges (list)": "%d 条边(列表) (list)",
  "%d edges (loop)": "%d 条边(环形) (loop)",
  "%d edges (tree)": "%d 条边(树结构) (tree)",
  "%d edges": "%d 条边",
  "Mesh Faces": "网格面",
  "1 face": "1张人脸",
  "%d faces": "%d 个人脸",
  "1 object": "1个对象",
  "%d objects": "%d个对象",
  "Tile Grid": "瓷砖网格",
  "Ground": "地面",
  "Props": "属性",
  "Trees": "树木",
  "Plants": "植物",
  "Compile As Override": "编译方式覆盖",
  "Skybox Map 0": "天空盒贴图 0",
  "Skybox Map 1": "天空盒贴图 1",
  "Skybox Map 2": "天空盒贴图 2",
  "Skybox Map 3": "天空盒贴图3",
  "Grid Width": "网格宽度",
  "Grid Height": "网格高度",
  "Tile Set File 0": "瓦片集文件 0",
  "Tile Set File 1": "瓦片集文件1",
  "Tile Set File 2": "瓦片集文件 2",
  "Tile Set File 3": "瓦片集文件3",
  "Base Map": "基础地图",
  "UI Background": "界面背景",
  "3D Skybox": "3D天空盒",
  "Minigame": "小游戏",
  "Shared Environment": "共享环境",
  "Fixup Entity Names By Default": "默认修正实体名称",
  "Map Type": "地图类型",
  "%s (from '%s')": "%s(源自'%s')",
  "Generic": "通用",
  "Generic Internal": "通用内部类型",
  "Dota": "刀塔",
  "Citadel": "堡垒/要塞",
  "The gameinfo.gi file is missing or incomplete.": "gameinfo.gi 文件缺失或内容不完整. ",
  "The 'Hammer' settings section of gameinfo.gi was not found. No game entities will be available for creation.": "未找到 gameinfo.gi 文件中的'锤子'设置段落. 因此将无法创建任何游戏实体. ",
  "No game entities will be available for creation.": "将无法创建任何游戏实体. ",
  "Updating references to file: %s": "正在更新文件引用: %s",
  "Took %0.2f seconds to destroy existing data.": "销毁现有数据共耗时 %0.2f 秒. ",
  "Took %0.2f seconds to load or copy file data.": "加载或复制文件数据共耗时 %0.2f 秒. ",
  "Took %0.2f seconds to update %i references": "更新 %i 个引用共耗时 %0.2f 秒",
  "Copy of map file %s does not have a valid world. World element handle: %i": "地图文件 %s 的副本中不存在有效的世界数据. 世界元素句柄: %i",
  "Do not load vmf files in hammer, import to a vmap first!": "切勿直接在 Hammer 中加载 vmf 文件, 请先将其导入为 vmap 格式! ",
  "Warning: This vmap file was upconverted from an unspecified format. Talk to a programmer.": "警告: 此 vmap 文件是从未知格式转换而来的. 请咨询程序员. ",
  "Parameter '%s' corresponds to an entity target name, but is sent to input '%s' on '%s' which is not marked as being a target name. (FGD Error?)": "参数'%s'对应的是实体目标名称, 但它却被发送到了'%s'上的输入项'%s'中, 而该输入项并未被标记为目标名称. (属于FGD错误吗?)",
  "Instance": "实例",
  "Tint Color": "色调颜色",
  "If set, the contents of the prefab will not be included in visibility calculations.": "若设置此选项, 预制件的内容将不会被纳入可见性计算范围. ",
  "Instance %i": "实例 %i",
  "Instance (%i objects)": "实例(%i 个对象)",
  "Prefab": "预制体",
  "Map File": "地图文件",
  "Specifies the map file whose contents will be referenced by this prefab.": "指定地图文件, 此预制件将引用该文件中的内容. ",
  "Target Name": "目标名称",
  "Specifies the name by which the prefab can be referenced by entity i/o. The set of inputs the prefab has is defined by the map relays in the target map.": "指定预制体可被实体 I/O 引用的名称. 该预制体可使用的输入项则由目标地图中的中继映射表来定义. ",
  "Fixup entity names": "修正实体名称",
  "If enabled, any entity target names within the prefab will have a prefix applied to ensure they are unique. This prevents any issues with entities in two different prefabs having name collisions.": "启用后, 预制件中所有实体目标名称都会被添加前缀以确保其唯一性. 这样就能避免两个不同预制件中的实体出现名称冲突的问题. ",
  "Prefix with Target Name": "以目标名称作为前缀",
  "If this is enabled and name fixup is enabled, the prefix used for name fixup will be the prefab target name instead of the unique id. If the target name is empty then the prefab the unique id will still be used as the prefix. Note that if two prefabs use the same target name for their prefix it will be possible to have entities inside the prefabs end up with name collisions.": "如果此选项已启用且名称修正功能也处于启用状态, 则名称修正时使用的前缀将是预制件的目标名称而非唯一标识符. 若目标名称为空, 则仍会使用唯一标识符作为前缀. 需要注意的是, 如果两个预制件使用了相同的目标名称作为前缀, 则可能导致这两个预制件中的实体出现名称冲突. ",
  "Load if nested": "如果存在嵌套结构则加载",
  "If enabled the prefab will be loaded when it is the child of another prefab, if disabled, this prefab will not be loaded if it is the child of another prefab.": "启用后, 当该预制体是其他预制体的子级时也会被加载; 禁用后, 即使该预制体是其他预制体的子级也不会被加载. ",
  "Create Prefab Runtime Entity": "创建预制体运行时实体",
  "If enabled, there will be a point_prefab entity at runtime representing this prefab as an EntityIO target (requires Relays and a Target Name). Map Relay connections will not be baked, but will instead route through this entity.": "启用后, 运行时将生成一个 point_prefab 实体, 用于将该预制体作为 EntityIO 的目标对象(需配置 Relays 并指定目标名称). 此时地图中的 Relay 连接不会被预编译, 而是通过该实体进行路由. ",
  "Load at runtime": "运行时加载",
  "Loading prefab: %s": "正在加载预制体: %s",
  "Prefab: %s": "预制体: %s",
  "Prefab: %i": "预制体: %i",
  "Using worldspawn entity targetname of 'worldspawn' will not have entity name fixup and might produce confusing results!": "使用目标名称为'worldspawn'的 worldspawn 实体时, 系统不会对该实体名称进行修正处理, 这可能会导致出现令人困惑的结果! ",
  "Transform Contents": "转换内容",
  "Prefab (%s)": "预制体(%s)",
  "This prefab wants procedural relay connections, but it must have a Runtime Entity to enable this feature!": "此预制体需要程序化中继连接功能, 但必须配备运行时实体才能启用该功能! ",
  "The map properties of this prefab's map specify a targetname of '%s', which is a classname! Please change to avoid using a classname.": "此预制件地图的地图属性中指定的 targetname 为'%s', 而该值实际上是一个类名! 请予以修改, 避免使用类名. ",
  "This prefab wants procedural relay connections, but it must have a targetname to enable this feature!": "此预制件需要程序化中继连接, 但必须设置目标名称才能启用该功能! ",
  "%s(data)": "%s(数据)(data)",
  "No physics for this mesh": "此网格未设置物理属性",
  "Dependent on context, single convex if part of an entity, mesh if world geometry": "视上下文而定: 若属于某个实体则显示为单一凸面, 若属于世界几何体则显示为网格",
  "Single Convex Hull": "单个凸包",
  "Construct a single convex hull around the entire mesh": "在整个网格周围构建一个凸包",
  "Multiple Convex Hulls": "多个凸包",
  "Construct a convex hull for each connected group of faces in the mesh": "为网格中每个相互连接的面组分别构建凸包",
  "Construct a physics mesh (polysoup)": "生成物理网格(多边形集合) (polysoup)",
  "Mesh Name": "网格名称",
  "Smoothing Angle": "平滑角度",
  "Physics Type": "物理类型",
  "Collision Property Override": "碰撞属性覆盖",
  "If specified, provides the name of an entry in scripts/collision_properties.txt that specifies the collision group and interaction layers to use, rather than those specified in the material.": "若指定此参数, 则会使用 scripts/collision_properties.txt 中对应条目的名称来确定要使用的碰撞组和交互图层, 而非使用材质中设定的值. ",
  "Collision Group Override": "碰撞组覆盖设置",
  "Directly specifies the name of a collision group to assign to the mesh, replaces any group specified by the material or collision property.": "直接指定要分配给网格的碰撞组名称, 该名称会覆盖材质或碰撞属性中所设定的任何组名. ",
  "Additional Interacts As": "其他交互方式",
  "Specifies additional interaction layers to append to the set of Interacts As layers assigned to the mesh.": "指定要添加到已分配给网格的'Interacts As'图层集中的额外交互图层. ",
  "Additional Interacts With": "其他交互对象",
  "Specifies additional interaction layers to append to the set of Interacts With layers assigned to the mesh.": "指定要添加到该网格所关联的'可交互层'集合中的额外交互层. ",
  "Additional Interacts Exclude": "附加交互排除项",
  "Included Detail Layers": "已包含的详细图层",
  "The only detail layers this mesh belongs to": "该网格所属的唯一细节图层",
  "Missing Detail Layers": "缺少细节图层",
  "This mesh will not belong to these detail layers": "该网格将不会归属于这些细节图层",
  "Physics Simplification Override": "物理模拟简化设置",
  "Physics Simplification Error": "物理简化过程出现错误",
  "The two sets of selected edges do not contain the same number of edges: %i != %i": "两组选定的边数量不一致: %i 不等于 %i",
  "Cannot merge open edges from the same face": "无法合并同一面上的开放边",
  "Mesh (%d faces)": "网格(%d个面)",
  "Polygon Mesh Data Pool - level 1": "多边形网格数据池 - 第1级",
  "Polygon Mesh Data Pool - level 2": "多边形网格数据池 - 第2级",
  "Polygon Mesh Data Pool - level 3": "多边形网格数据池 - 第3级",
  "Polygon Mesh Data Pool - level 4": "多边形网格数据池 - 第4级",
  "Smart Prop": "智能道具",
  "Smart Prop File": "智能道具文件",
  "Specifies the smart prop which this object will instantiate": "指定此对象要实例化的智能组件",
  "Whole object tint color": "整个对象的着色颜色",
  "A tint color to apply to the entire smart prop. The evaluation of the smart prop receives this color and may use it directly or may modify it before assigning a tint to the individual parts of the smart prop.": "要应用于整个智能组件的色调颜色. 对智能组件进行评估时会获取该颜色, 评估过程既可以直接使用此颜色, 也可以在为智能组件的各个部分设置色调前对其进行修改. ",
  "Lock Evaluation": "锁定评估",
  "Disable updates from the specified smart prop file.": "禁用来自指定智能属性文件的更新. ",
  "Constrain To Prefab": "仅限制在预制体范围内",
  "If enabled and the smart prop is inside a prefab, the evaluation of the smart prop considers only the contents of the parent prefab, not anything outside the prefab. For example, if enabled, any traces performed by the smart prop will only hit other objects within the parent prefab.": "启用此选项后, 若智能属性位于预制件内部, 其评估过程仅会考虑父预制件中的内容, 而不会涉及预制件外部的任何对象. 例如, 启用后, 该智能属性生成的任何追踪操作都只会作用于父预制件内的其他对象. ",
  "Input Shapes": "输入形状",
  "Alpha of the fade, where 0 = fully transparent and 255 = fully opaque.": "淡入淡出的透明度值, 其中 0 表示完全透明, 255 表示完全不透明. ",
  "Render Properties": "渲染属性",
  "Cull Distance": "剔除距离",
  "Maximum distance at which individual parts of the prop will be visible. If 0 the setting on individual parts of the smart prop will be used.": "道具各组成部分保持可见的最大距离. 若设为0, 则使用智能道具各组成部分自身的设置. ",
  "Fade Start Distance": "渐隐起始距离",
  "Distance at which each part of the prop starts to fade. Only applies if Cull Distance > 0. Positive values are absolute values, while negative values are relative to the cull distance. For example Cull Distance = 100, Start Fade Distance = -30 means the object will start fading at 70 units away and will disappear when 100 units away.": "物体各部分开始逐渐淡出的距离. 仅当'剔除距离'大于0时才生效. 正值表示绝对距离, 负值则表示相对于剔除距离的数值. 例如: 若'剔除距离'为100, 而'开始淡出距离'为-30, 则物体会在距离100-30=70的位置开始淡出, 并在距离100的位置完全消失. ",
  "Select a an entity to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's bounding box center.": "请选择一个实体来指定光照采样的位置, 而非使用该实体的边界框中心. ",
  "Both Baked and Realtime": "烘焙模式与实时模式均可",
  "Baked Lighting Mode": "烘焙光照模式",
  "Should baked lighting be generated for this object. If default is selected, the choice is left to individual parts.": "是否为该对象生成烘焙光照?若选择默认值, 则由各个部件自行决定. ",
  "Lightprobed": "光线探测中",
  "Lightmapped": "光照贴图已应用",
  "Lightmap Scale Bias": "光照贴图比例偏移",
  "Increase or decrease the resolution of the lightmap applied to this object.": "增加或减少应用于该物体的光照贴图分辨率. ",
  "Scale down by 8": "缩小至原来的1/8",
  "Scale down by 4": "缩小为原来的1/4",
  "Scale down by 2": "按比例缩小为原来的1/2",
  "Default (no scale)": "默认(无缩放) (no scale)",
  "Scale up by 2": "放大至2倍",
  "Scale up by 4": "放大4倍",
  "Scale up by 8": "放大8倍",
  "Bake Lighting As If Double-Sided": "模拟双面材质进行光照烘焙",
  "Bake lighting as if this were double-sided geometry. Useful on geometry with pre-culled backfaces whose neighbors have lighting errors caused by saw-too-many-backfaces sample invalidation.": "模拟双面几何体来进行光照烘焙. 此选项适用于那些背面面片已被剔除、但其相邻面片因采样点无效而出现光照错误的几何体. ",
  "Allow models in the smart prop to emit lighting": "允许智能组件中的模型发射光线",
  "Emissive Boost": "发光增强",
  "Used to boost emissive lighting from models. Note that boosting emissive on smaller areas can create more lighting artifacts/noise.": "用于增强模型的自发光效果. 请注意, 在较小的区域内增强自发光效果可能会导致出现更多光照瑕疵或噪点. ",
  "Collisions": "碰撞检测",
  "Specifies how collision shapes are to generated.": "指定碰撞形状的生成方式. ",
  "Build Settings": "构建设置",
  "Not Solid": "非实心",
  "Use VPhysics": "使用 VPhysics",
  "Vis Occluder": "视觉遮挡物",
  "If true this geometry is used as an occluder for precomputed visibility": "如果为 true, 此几何体将被用作预计算可见性时的遮挡物",
  "Render To Cubemaps": "渲染为立方体贴图",
  "If true, this geometry renders into baked cube maps": "如果设为 true, 此几何体将被渲染到预烘焙的立方体贴图中",
  "Disable in low quality mode": "在低质量模式下禁用",
  "Do not render when using the lowest quality video settings. This object is a non-essential detail.": "使用最低画质设置时请勿渲染此对象. 该对象属于非必要细节. ",
  "Bake To World": "烘焙到世界坐标",
  "If true this geometry will be baked into the world geometry of the map so that the model is not referenced at runtime.": "如果设为 true, 此几何体将被整合进地图的世界几何结构中, 从而在运行时无需再引用该模型. ",
  "Disable Merging": "禁用合并",
  "If true this will not be merged with other geometry during map compile (reduces rendering efficiency).": "若设为 true, 在地图编译时该内容不会与其他几何图形合并(会降低渲染效率). ",
  "Render with Dynamic Objects": "渲染动态对象",
  "Render this object with other dynamic objects": "将此对象与其他动态对象一同渲染",
  "Smart Prop (%s)": "智能道具 (%s)",
  "Smart Prop evaluation currently locked. Un-check 'Lock Evaluation' in the object properties to enable updates for this smart prop.": "当前智能属性评估功能处于锁定状态. 请取消选中对象属性中的'锁定评估'选项, 即可恢复对该智能属性的更新. ",
  "Smart Prop cannot be updated because the smart prop definition file '%s' could not be found.": "无法更新智能属性, 因为找不到对应的智能属性定义文件'%s'. ",
  "Smart Prop update disabled because the definition file '%s' version has changed. Select 'Update To Current Version' in the object properties to re-evaluate using the new version.": "智能道具更新功能已被禁用, 因为定义文件'%s'的版本已发生变更. 请在对象属性中选择'更新至当前版本', 以便使用新版本重新进行评估. ",
  "Unnamed Group %i": "未命名组 %i",
  "Deformer": "变形器",
  "Base Size": "基础尺寸",
  "Specifies the size of the volume of space to be deformed.": "指定需要变形的空间体积大小. ",
  "Deformer %i": "变形器 %i",
  "Deformation Mode": "变形模式",
  "Deform Children": "变形子节点",
  "Group (%d objects)": "组(%d个对象)",
  "Image Plane": "图像平面",
  "Opacity": "透明度",
  "FileBrowse(Image)": "文件浏览(图片)(Image)",
  "ImagePlane (%s)": "图像平面 (%s)",
  "Index  Version  RefCount  Map File": "索引  版本  引用计数  映射文件",
  "%i tile set maps loaded": "已加载 %i 个瓦片集地图",
  "Unable to save %d bytes to %s": "无法将 %d 字节的内容保存到 %s",
  "Tile Mesh": "瓷砖网格",
  "Tile height scale": "瓦片高度缩放比例",
  "Tile Set File 4": "瓦片集文件 4",
  "Tile Set File 5": "瓦片集文件5",
  "Tile Set File 6": "瓦片集文件 6",
  "Tile Set File 7": "瓦片集文件 7",
  "Tile Set File 8": "瓦片集文件 8",
  "Tile Set File 9": "瓦片集文件 9",
  "Tile Set File 10": "瓦片集文件 10",
  "Tile Set File 11": "瓦片集文件 11",
  "Tile Set File 12": "瓦片集文件 12",
  "Tile Set File 13": "瓦片集文件 13",
  "Tile Set File 14": "瓦片集文件14",
  "Tile Set File 15": "瓦片集文件15",
  "Compiled Vis Data": "编译后的Vis数据",
  "Loading Nodes": "正在加载节点",
  "Loading clusters": "正在加载集群",
  "Cable": "线缆",
  "Material Name": "材料名称",
  "Number of Sides": "边数",
  "Spacing": "间距",
  "Flip Faces": "翻转面",
  "Texture Orientation": "纹理方向",
  "Horizontal (U along path)": "水平方向(U轴沿路径方向) (U along path)",
  "Vertical (V along path)": "垂直方向(沿路径为V方向) (V along path)",
  "Texture Scale": "纹理缩放",
  "Texture repeats around circumference": "纹理沿圆周方向重复",
  "Texture offset along path": "沿路径的纹理偏移量",
  "Texture offset around circumference": "纹理在圆周方向上的偏移量",
  "Collision enabled": "碰撞检测已启用",
  "BuildSolidRenderData(555):": "生成实体渲染数据(555): ",
  "Shaded": "阴影效果",
  "Translucent": "半透明",
  "Same Material": "相同材质",
  "Acoustic Material": "声学材料",
  "Default Material": "默认材质",
  "Random Material": "随机材质",
  "Geometry Shading": "几何着色",
  "Material Shading": "材质着色",
  "Steam Audio Data": "Steam音频数据",
  "Probe Type": "探针类型",
