  "Materials Probe": "材料探测器",
  "Render Probe Radius": "渲染探针半径",
  "Flag to choose whether to render influence radius of the probe.": "用于选择是否渲染探针的影响半径的标志. ",
  "Show Clustered Probes Only": "仅显示聚类后的探针",
  "Flag to choose whether to render the clustered probes.": "用于选择是否渲染聚类后的探针的标记. ",
  "Source Probe Index": "源探针索引",
  "Index for source probe when visualizing source dependent data. Editing disabled for listener-centric data like baked reverb.": "用于可视化依赖源数据时的源探头索引. 对于像预计算混响这类以监听器为中心的数据, 则无法进行编辑. ",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create reverb probe nodes!": "Steam Audio: 没有可用来创建混响探针节点的数据! ",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create pathing probe nodes!": "Steam Audio: 未提供任何数据, 无法创建路径探测节点! ",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create occlusion probe nodes!": "Steam Audio: 未提供任何数据, 无法创建遮挡探针节点! ",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create dimensions probe nodes!": "Steam Audio: 暂无数据可用于创建空间探针节点! ",
  "Steam Audio: No data set to create materials probe nodes!": "Steam Audio: 未提供任何数据, 无法创建材质探针节点! ",
  "Steam Audio Imported Probe Box": "Steam Audio导入的探针盒",
  "Band (Low)": "频段(低频) (Low)",
  "Property for low frequency band.": "低频段属性. ",
  "Band (Mid)": "频带(中频) (Mid)",
