  "Material 0": "材质 0",
  "Most active material around a probe.": "探针周围最活跃的物质. ",
  "Material 0 Weight": "材质0的重量",
  "Weight for the most active material around a probe.": "探头周围最活跃物质的权重值. ",
  "Material 1": "材料1",
  "2nd most active material around a probe.": "探针周围活跃度第二的材料. ",
  "Material 1 Weight": "材料1重量",
  "Weight for the 2nd most active material around a probe.": "探头周围第二活跃材质的权重值. ",
  "Material 2": "材料 2",
  "3rd most active material around a probe.": "探针周围活跃度排名第三的物质. ",
  "Material 2 Weight": "材质2重量",
  "Impulse Response for Ambisonic Channel 0.": "声像环绕声道0的脉冲响应. ",
  "Type of data stored inside the probe.": "探针内存储的数据类型. ",
  "Probe Index": "探针索引",
  "Index of the probe.": "探头索引. ",
  "Cluster Index": "集群索引",
  "Index of the cluster which the probe belongs to and looks up reverb from.": "探针所属的声学群组索引, 系统将据此查找混响参数. ",
  "Movable Reverb Index": "可移动混响索引",
  "Index of the movable volume within which the probe exists.": "探针所在的可移动卷的索引. ",
  "Probe Radius": "探测半径",
  "Influence radius of the probe.": "探测器的影响范围. ",
  "Reverb Times": "混响时间",
  "RT60 for low, mid, and high frequency bands for the probe.": "探头的低频、中频及高频频段的RT60值. ",
  "Reverb IR": "混响脉冲响应",
  "Reverb impulse response for the probe.": "探测器的混响脉冲响应. ",
  "Live Audition": "实时试听",
  "Updates the paramter of the active probe on the mix graph.": "更新混音图上当前选中探针的参数. ",
  "Reverb Scales": "混响缩放",
  "Reverb scale for low, mid, and high frequency bands for the probe.": "探针的低频、中频及高频频段的混响比例. ",
  "Pathing Ceofficients": "路径系数",
  "Pathing coefficients for 1st order Ambisonics.": "一阶Ambisonics的路径系数. ",
  "Pathing EQ": "路径规划均衡器",
  "Pathing EQ for low, mid, and high frequency bands.": "用于低频、中频和高频段的路径均衡调节. ",
  "Pathing Distance Ratio": "路径距离比例",
  "Ratio between shortest distance and pathing distance between the probes.": "探针之间的最短距离与路径距离的比值. ",
  "Pathing Direction": "路径方向",
  "Direction of the path reaching the probe.": "探针路径的走向. ",
  "Occlusion Value": "遮挡值",
  "Occlusion value between the source and selected probe.": "源点与所选探测点之间的遮挡值. ",
  "Occlusion Deviation": "遮挡偏差",
  "Occlusion path deviation between the source and selected probe.": "源点与所选探针之间的遮挡路径偏差. ",
  "Occlusion Path Ratio": "遮挡路径比例",
  "Occlusion path ratio of direct path over shortest path between the source and selected probe.": "源点到所选探测点之间, 实际路径长度与最短路径长度的比值. ",
  "Dimensions InOut Fraction": "尺寸 输入输出 比例",
  "Higher the fraction, more open the space around the probe.": "分数值越高, 探头周围的空间就越开阔. ",
  "Dimensions Size": "尺寸规格",
  "Estimated size of the space around the probe.": "探针周围空间的预估大小. ",
  "Outside Direction Field": "外部方向字段",
  "Ambisonics field of how to reach to nearby outside probes.": "关于如何对周边外部探针进行定位的声场技术说明. ",
  "Inside Small Direction Field": "小型方向场内部",
  "Ambisonics field of how to reach to nearby inside probes in small spaces.": "关于如何在狭小空间内将 Ambisonics 技术应用于近距离内部声场探测的相关说明. ",
  "Material Values": "材质属性值",
  "Set As Source": "设为源文件",
  "Set the probe as source.": "将探针设置为源. ",
  "Show Compressed IR": "显示压缩后的红外图像",
  "If checked, decompress and show compressed reverb IRs.": "勾选后, 将解压缩并显示经过压缩的混响脉冲响应数据. ",
  "Outside Distance: %0.2f": "外部距离: %0.2f",
  "Inside Distance: %0.2f": "内部距离: %0.2f",
  "Steam Audio Imported Probe": "Steam Audio导入的探针",
  "# OBJ file exported from Hammer": "# 由 Hammer 导出的 OBJ 文件",
  "Interpolation": "插值",
  "LINEAR": "线性",
  "B-Spline": "B样条",
  "Catmul-Rom": "卡特穆尔-罗姆插值法",
  "Lattice Control Point": "网格控制点",
  "Lattice Deformer": "晶格变形器",
  "Divisions (X)": "部门(X) (X)",
  "Divisions (Y)": "分部/部门 (年) (Y)",
  "Divisions (Z)": "部门列表 (Z)",
  "Y-Axis": "Y轴",
  "Z-Axis": "Z轴",
  "Simple Deformer": "简单变形工具",
  "Deformation Axis": "变形轴",
  "Specifies the local space axis which the deformer will bend around.": "指定变形器绕其弯曲的局部空间轴. ",
  "Bend Angle": "弯曲角度",
  "Specifies the angle of bend to apply in degrees. Range is [ -360, 360 ]. Negative values cause the bend to occur in the opposite direction.": "指定要应用的弯曲角度, 以度为单位. 取值范围为 [ -360, 360 ]. 负值则表示沿相反方向进行弯曲. ",
  "Bend Point": "折点",
  "0 to 1 value specifying the location on the local x-axis of the deformer around which the bend will occur. A value of 0 means the bend will occur around the minimum end of the deformer, a value of 1 means the bend will occur around the maximum end of the deformer, a value of 0.5 means the bend will occur at the center of the deformer volume.": "该值范围在0到1之间, 用于指定变形器上发生弯曲的位置在局部X轴上的坐标. 值为0时, 弯曲发生在变形器的最小端; 值为1时, 弯曲发生在变形器的最大端; 值为0.5时, 弯曲发生在变形器体积的中心. ",
  "Bend Radius": "弯曲半径",
  "Specifies the radius of the bend. When the value is 0, the radius is automatically calculated to preserve the length of the deformer volume for the specified angle. If an explict radius is specified then the inside edge of the bend will match this radius for all angle values, however this will result the the deformer changing the length of its contents.": "指定弯曲的半径. 当该值为 0 时, 系统会自动计算半径以确保变形器体积在指定角度下保持原有长度. 若手动指定了半径值, 则无论角度如何, 弯曲的内边缘都会与该半径一致, 但这样一来变形器会导致其内部内容的长度发生变化. ",
  "Specifies the target path which defines the deformation that is applied.": "指定目标路径, 用于定义所应用的变形效果. ",
  "Specifies the [ 0, 1 ] parameter along the path where the deformer will start.": "指定变形器开始作用的路径上的 [0, 1] 参数值. ",
  "Start": "开始",
  "Specifies the [ 0, 1 ] parameter along the path where the deformer will end.": "指定变形器终止位置在路径上的 [0, 1] 参数值. ",
  "Specifies allowed amount of error used when determining how many segments to use int he deformer. Represents a percentage of the length of the target path.": "用于指定在确定变形器所使用的分段数量时所允许的误差范围. 该值表示目标路径长度的百分比. ",
  "Curve Fit Error Tolerance": "曲线拟合误差容忍度",
  "Path Deformer": "路径变形器",
  "Unable to assign light (%s) <%i> [%s @ %.1f %.1f %.1f] a baked shadow index: has %i overlaps (%i without slots), no available shadow slots": "无法为光源 (%s) <%i> [%s @ %.1f %.1f %.1f] 分配烘焙阴影索引: 该光源有 %i个重叠对象(其中 %i个无可用插槽), 当前没有可分配的阴影插槽",
  "Assigned %d Light Shadow Slots, %i failed (max slot %i).": "已分配 %d 个光暗槽位, 其中 %i 个分配失败(最大槽位数为 %i). ",
