  "Only wrote %d (of %d) values when saving map!": "保存地图时仅写入了 %d 个值(总共应写入 %d 个)! ",
  "String value for CTransform only had %u components": "CTransform 的字符串值仅包含 %u 个组件",
  "Empty variable names are not allowed.": "不允许使用空的变量名. ",
  "The characters: %s are not allowed in a variable name.": "字符: %s 不允许出现在变量名中. ",
  "Workplane Marker": "工作平面标记",
  "Re-orient camera on activation": "激活时重新调整摄像头方向",
  "If enabled, double clicking on the marker will re-orient the camera in addition to setting the workplane.": "启用后, 双击标记不仅可设置工作平面, 还能重新调整摄像机方向. ",
  "The selected skybox map is not marked as a skybox map: <pre> %s </pre> In the skybox map, go to Map > Map Properties and set Map Type to '3D Skybox'": "所选的天空盒贴图并未被标记为天空盒贴图: <pre> %s </pre> 请在该贴图的编辑界面中, 依次进入'贴图'>'贴图属性', 然后将'贴图类型'设置为'3D天空盒'",
  "The selected map is not marked as a shared environment: <pre> %s </pre> In the shared map, go to Map > Map Properties and set Map Type to 'Shared Environment'": "所选地图未被标记为共享环境: <pre> %s </pre> 对于共享地图, 请依次进入'地图'>'地图属性', 然后将'地图类型'设置为'共享环境'",
