  "Failed to add filter for asset tag %s, unknown tag.": "无法为资源标签 %s添加过滤器, 该标签未知. ",
  "Cordon": "封锁隔离",
  "Cordon Name": "隔离带名称",
  "'!self' is not allowed by default on Prefabs. If you give this Prefab a name and use 'Create Prefab Runtime Entity', you could use !self": "默认情况下, 预制件中不允许使用'!self'. 如果您为该预制件指定名称并使用'创建预制件运行时实体'功能, 便可使用'!self'",
