  "Not %s": "不是 %s",
  "Invalid Parent": "无效的父级项",
  "The node requires its parent to be a specific node type and the current parent is not of that type.": "该节点要求其父节点必须为特定类型, 而当前的父节点并不符合该类型. ",
  "Entity class %s requires its parent to be of class %s": "实体类 %s 要求其父类必须是 %s 类",
  "Missing reference": "缺少引用",
  "This node references a file that does not exist.": "此节点引用的文件不存在. ",
  "Depenency on": "依赖项: ",
