  "%s missing asset %s": "缺少资源 %s: %s",
  "Duplicate Objects": "重复对象",
  "Multiple copies of the same object at the same location.": "同一位置存在多个相同的对象. ",
  "%d duplicate objects": "%d个重复对象",
  "Bounding Boxes": "边界框",
  "The bounds of the object are invalid.": "对象的边界设置无效. ",
  "Invalid bounding box": "无效的边界框",
  "No Player start": "无玩家开始",
  "There is no player start in the map. To add one, select the Entity tool, drag the crosshairs to the position you want the player to start at, and press ENTER.": "地图中未设置玩家起始点. 如需添加, 请选择'实体工具', 将十字线拖至希望玩家开始的位置, 然后按下回车键. ",
  "No player start.": "无玩家开始. ",
  "Invalid Target": "无效的目标",
  "The keyvalue holds the name of an entity that was not found in the map. Fixing this error will clear out the keyvalue in the selected entity.": "该键值存储的是某个实体的名称, 但该实体并未在地图中找到. 修复此错误后, 所选实体对应的键值将被清除. ",
  "Invalid target: key \"%s\" is set to value \"%s\".": "无效的目标: 键'%s'被设置为值'%s'. ",
  "Invalid Material": "无效的材料",
  "The mesh is using a material asset that is missing or invalid. You can fix this error with the Fix button, which will assign the current material to the mesh.": "该网格正在使用的材质资源缺失或无效. 点击'修复'按钮即可解决此问题, 该操作会将当前材质分配给网格. ",
  "Unused Keyvalues": "未使用的键值",
  "The entity contains keyvalues that are not used in its class. You can fix this error with the Fix button.": "该实体包含其所属类中未使用的键值对. 点击'修复'按钮即可解决此错误. ",
  "Unused keyvalue: \"%s\".": "未使用的键值对: '%s'. ",
  "Empty Entity": "空实体",
  "This entity class requires child nodes and does not have any. Fixing the error deletes the entity.": "此实体类需要子节点, 但目前没有任何子节点. 修复此错误将会删除该实体. ",
  "Proxy Target Cylce": "代理目标周期",
  "The proxy target is an ancestor of the proxy, forming a cycle.": "该代理目标实际上是代理本身的父级, 从而形成了循环. ",
  "Invalid Output": "输出无效",
  "The specified output connection of the entity is invalid and is not actually connecting to anything. Fixing this issue will delete the connection.": "所指定的实体输出连接无效, 实际上并未连接到任何目标. 修复此问题将会删除该连接. ",
  "Output connection \"%s\" to the input \"%s\" of entity \"%s\" is invalid.": "将输出连接'%s'关联到实体'%s'的输入'%s'的操作无效. ",
  "Override Value": "覆盖值",
