  "Offset Angles": "偏移角度",
  "Should the pin apply to the angles of this node. If disabled this node will only translate with the target node, its rotation will be unaffected by the rotation of node it is pinned to.": "该固定功能是否应适用于此节点的角度?若禁用此功能, 该节点将仅随目标节点平移, 其旋转角度不会受被固定节点旋转的影响. ",
  "Pin Angles": "固定角度",
  "If enabled, transforming this node will transform the target node such that the relative offset is maintained, essentially locking the transform of the two objects together regardless of which one is edited. Normally when this is disabled, moving this object will not affect the target node and will instead update the pin offset values.": "启用后, 对当前节点进行变换时, 目标节点也会随之变换, 从而保持两者间的相对偏移量. 这意味着无论编辑哪个节点, 两者的变换状态都会被锁定. 若未启用此选项, 移动当前对象则不会影响目标节点, 此时只会更新其偏移值. ",
