  "Selected edge set must form a line or loop, the selection cannot contain branching edges": "所选边集必须能构成一条直线或闭合环路, 且不能包含带有分支的边",
  "Closed edges must belong to the same face and their vertices must be connected by other edges": "闭合边必须属于同一个面, 且其顶点必须通过其他边相连",
  "Face was successfully added": "人脸已成功添加",
  "Face did not have enough at least 3 vertices.": "面部图形的顶点数量不足, 至少需要3个顶点. ",
  "Face specified an edge which already had two faces attached.": "面定义了某条边, 但该边上已有两个面相连. ",
  "Face specified a vertex which had edges attached, but none that were open.": "系统检测到指定的顶点上连接了多条边, 但不存在未闭合的边. ",
  "Face specified a vertex that had multiple open edges and did not connect to and existing edge.": "该面指定的顶点存在多条未闭合的边, 且这些边并未与任何现有边相连. ",
  "Face specified two edges that are connected by a vertex but have or more existing edges separating them.": "该面指定了两条边: 这两条边虽由一个顶点相连, 但其间还有一条或更多已有的边将其分隔开. ",
  "Allocation of the face failed (not a topology failure).": "面部分配失败(并非拓扑结构错误). ",
