  "Game Motion Smoothing": "游戏动态流畅度优化",
  "Cloth Sleep Enabled": "布料睡眠功能已启用",
  "Immovable Hint": "不可移动提示",
  "Cloth Per-Bone Constraint Scale": "布料逐骨骼约束缩放比例",
  "Enable Empty Model": "启用空模型",
  "Optimize for Keychains": "针对钥匙链进行优化",
  "Bone Cull Type": "骨骼剔除类型",
  "Primary Root Bone": "主根骨骼",
  "If the model has multiple root level bones, the primary root bone can be specified here, which will ensure the specified bone is the first bone in the skeleton.": "如果模型包含多个根级骨骼, 可在此指定主根骨骼, 这样就能保证该骨骼成为骨架中的第一个骨骼. ",
  "Bone '%s' is specified as the primary root bone, but is not a root level bone.": "骨骼'%s'虽被指定为主根骨骼, 但实际上并不属于根级骨骼. ",
  "Cannot string prefix from bone '%s' - no name remaining!": "无法从骨骼'%s'中提取前缀 - 名称已被清空! ",
  "Cannot strip prefix from bone '%s', bone '%s' already exists in the bind pose": "无法移除骨骼'%s'的前缀, 因为骨骼'%s'已存在于绑定姿势中",
  "Cannot strip prefix from bone '%s', bone '%s' already exists in the mesh": "无法移除骨骼'%s'的前缀, 因为名为'%s'的骨骼已存在于网格中",
  "WARNING: No 'models_ModelDocGameData' FGD was specified in the 'ModelDoc' section of gameinfo.gi.": "警告: 在 gameinfo.gi 文件的'ModelDoc'章节中未指定任何 'models_ModelDocGameData' FGD. ",
  "WARNING: Unable to load the FGD file '%s'.": "警告: 无法加载 FGD 文件'%s'. ",
  "%s is not a valid breakable piece name.": "%s 不是一个有效可破坏物品名称. ",
  "Failed to find a hit group ID for name %s": "无法找到名为 %s 的匹配组 ID",
  "%s: Missing hitgroup %s": "%s: 缺少命中组 %s",
  "%s on any hitboxes or physics bodies. This part won't be destructible by damage.": "在任何碰撞体或物理实体上应用 %s. 该部分不会因受到伤害而损坏. ",
  "%s on physics bodies (exists on hitboxes though). Destroying this part will still leave collision active.": "%s在物理实体上使用该功能时需注意(不过在碰撞框上同样适用). 即便销毁此部分内容, 碰撞检测依然会生效. ",
  "Duplicate hit group (%s) specified in destructible parts system data.  Please fix.": "在可破坏部件系统数据中指定了重复的击中组 (%s). 请予以修正. ",
  "Duplicate model key: %s": "重复的模型键: %s",
  "Mesh Filter Affects Duplicate Input Mesh Names, %s -> %s": "网格过滤器会影响重复的输入网格名称, %s 将变为 %s",
  "Child Mesh Mesh cannot be empty": "子网格不能为空",
  "Duplicate child mesh name": "子网格名称重复",
  "Unexpected skinning defined on mesh %s": "在网格 %s 上定义了意外的蒙皮设置",
  "Skinned": "已应用皮肤",
  "Unskinned": "未换肤",
  "Mixing skinned and unskinned meshes in model: %s meshes: %s": "在模型中混用了带蒙皮与不带蒙皮的网格: %s 个网格: %s",
  "%s: %d parts": "%s: 共 %d 个部件",
  "%s: Excluding %d parts": "%s: 已排除 %d 个部件",
  "Discards all skeleton information (bones and vertex skinning data) from the parent node": "将父节点中的所有骨骼信息(骨骼及顶点蒙皮数据)清除",
  "Bones": "骨骼",
  "List of bones": "骨骼列表",
  "Removes the named bone and any children from the parent node, any skinning weights are reassigned to the parent bone": "移除指定骨骼及其所有子骨骼与父节点的关联, 所有蒙皮权重将重新分配给父骨骼",
  "Internal Error (mismatched mesh and bindpose)": "内部错误(网格与绑定姿势不匹配) (mismatched mesh and bindpose)",
  "Removes the named bone but keeps all children and descendent bones. When the specified bone has skin weights, the weights will be transferred to the bone's parent.  In the case of skin weights and no parent bone, the skin weights will be distributed amongst the bone's children. If there are skin weights and no parent or child bones, then the mesh will have no bones and no skinning.": "删除指定骨骼, 但保留其所有子骨骼及后代骨骼. 若该骨骼关联了蒙皮权重, 这些权重将转移至其父骨骼上. 若存在蒙皮权重但无父骨骼, 则权重会分配给所有子骨骼. 如果既有蒙皮权重又不存在父骨骼或子骨骼, 那么该网格将没有任何骨骼与蒙皮信息. ",
  "Remove bones that are not present in this allow-list.": "移除不在此允许列表中的骨骼. ",
  "Removes all bones from the parent node that do not have any verticies skinned to them": "移除父节点中所有未被任何顶点绑定到的骨骼",
  "Renames all bone names to lowercase versions of themselves": "将所有骨骼名称转换为小写形式",
  "Bone '%s' already existed in the bind pose": "骨骼'%s'在绑定姿势中已存在",
  "Bone '%s' already existed in the mesh": "骨骼'%s'在网格中已存在",
  "Force the worldspace position of unweighted bones.": "强制设置无权重骨骼的世界空间位置. ",
  "Angle": "角度",
  "Target Bone": "目标骨骼",
  "New Parent Bone": "新建父骨骼",
  "Cannot find bone named '%s' in file: %s": "无法在文件 %s 中找到名为'%s'的骨骼",
  "Cannot find bone named '%s' in parent node's data": "无法在父节点的数据中找到名为'%s'的骨骼",
  "Cannot find parent bone named '%s' in file: %s": "无法在文件 %s 中找到名为'%s'的父骨骼",
  "Cannot find parent bone named '%s' in parent node's data.": "无法在父节点的数据中找到名为'%s'的父骨骼. ",
  "Realign the target bone in the bindpose and counteract the transformation later in the animation compiler": "在绑定姿势下重新调整目标骨骼的位置, 之后在动画编译器中抵消该变换即可",
  "Counteract Animation": "抵消动画",
  "Rename bones by replacing a given prefix.": "通过替换指定的前缀来重命名骨骼. ",
  "Prefix to Match": "匹配前缀",
  "Replacement": "替换",
  "Allow Non-Matching Bones": "允许骨骼不匹配",
  "Bone '%s' doesn't match required prefix '%s'": "骨骼'%s'不符合所需的前缀'%s'",
  "Bone '%s' cannot remove prefix '%s' - no name remaining!": "骨骼'%s'无法移除前缀'%s' - 这样就没有任何名称了! ",
  "Skin all the geometry in this mesh to a single bone.": "将此网格中的所有几何体绑定到同一根骨骼上. ",
  "Bone name": "骨骼名称",
  "Sets all elements in a vector (or float) stream to a single value": "将所有向量(或浮点数)流中的元素设置为同一个值",
  "Stream Name": "流名称",
  "Cannot override stream '%s' - unsupported type '%s'": "无法覆盖流'%s' - 不支持的类型'%s'",
  "Remove a data stream (position, uv, etc.) from a mesh by name": "按名称从网格中移除某个数据流(位置、UV等)",
  "Rename a data stream (position, uv, etc.) on a mesh - fails if the name is already present": "重命名网格上的数据流(位置、UV等) - 如果该名称已存在则操作失败",
  "From Name": "发件人姓名",
  "To Name": "目标名称",
  "Copy bone positions into vertex stream for use in foliage animation shader": "将骨骼位置复制到顶点流中, 供植被动画着色器使用",
  "Computes wrinkle map values for morphs": "计算变形所需的褶皱贴图数值",
  "Compress Scale": "压缩比例",
  "Stretch Scale": "拉伸缩放",
  "Spew Wrinkle Stats": "显示皱纹统计信息",
  "No Morph Data on mesh, cannot compute or modify wrinkle map data": "网格中无形变数据, 无法计算或修改皱纹贴图数据",
  "Overwriting existing wrinkle map data on mesh": "正在覆盖网格上现有的褶皱贴图数据",
  "Scales existing wrinkle map values on morphs": "调整变形体上现有皱纹贴图数值的缩放比例",
  "No Morph Data on mesh, cannot modify wrinkle map data": "网格上没有变形数据, 无法修改皱纹贴图数据",
  "Computes Bent Normals": "计算弯曲法线",
  "Two Sided (Foliage)": "双面(植被) (Foliage)",
  "Compute AO": "计算环境光遮蔽",
  "Simplification node.": "简化节点. ",
  "Simplify Params": "简化参数",
  "Target Triangle Percent": "目标三角区域百分比",
  "Maximum Error Percent": "最大误差百分比",
  "Attribute-Aware Simplification": "属性感知式简化",
  "Normal Attribute Simplification Weight": "普通属性简化权重",
  "UV Attribute Simplification Weight": "UV属性简化权重",
  "Joint Weight Attribute Simplification Weight": "联合权重属性简化权重",
  "Color Attribute Simplification Weight": "颜色属性简化权重",
  "Regularize Faces": "规范化面部特征",
  "Recompute Vertices": "重新计算顶点",
  "Prune pieces < error threshold": "修剪后的片段 < 错误阈值",
  "Remove Small Components": "移除小型组件",
  "Small Component Size Percent": "小型组件尺寸百分比",
  "Weld Vertices before simplifying": "简化前请先焊接顶点",
  "Weld Position Tolerance": "焊接位置公差",
  "CModelDocMeshModifier_Simplify: welded %i vertices": "CModelDocMeshModifier_Simplify: 已焊接 %i 个顶点",
  "Unknown vertex attribute to weight: %s": "无法识别的顶点属性权重: %s",
  "Mesh has %i > %i floats of attributes, unable to apply all weightings.": "该网格包含 %i 个属性浮点数值, 超过了 %i 的上限, 因此无法应用所有权重. ",
  "VertexLocks provided but not using a simplification method that honors them": "已提供顶点锁定信息, 但并未使用能遵循这些设置的简化方法",
  "Generates anchor bones based on the specified vertex attribute.  Each vertex with a non-zero value in the vertex attribute will be skinned to a generated anchor bone.  The generated anchor bones will all be parented to the specified root bone which will be created if it does not exist.": "根据指定的顶点属性生成锚点骨骼. 顶点属性值不为零的每个顶点都会被绑定到相应生成的锚点骨骼上. 所有生成的锚点骨骼都会以指定的根骨骼为父级; 若该根骨骼不存在, 则会自动创建. ",
  "Root Bone Name": "根骨骼名称",
  "The name of the bone which all generated anchor bones will be parented to.  If it doesn't exist it will be created with no parent.": "所有生成的锚点骨骼都将以该骨骼作为父级. 如果该骨骼不存在, 则会创建一个没有父级的骨骼. ",
  "Vertex Attribute": "顶点属性",
  "The vertex attribute on the mesh which will indicate which vertices get a generated anchor bone.  It's expected to be a float value per-vertex.  A value of 0 leaves the vertex unaffected.  A non-zero value means an anchor bone will be generated for that vertex and the vertex will be skinned to that anchor bone.": "该网格上的顶点属性用于指定哪些顶点需要生成锚点骨骼. 该属性应为每个顶点对应的一个浮点值. 值为0时表示该顶点不受任何影响; 值非零时则会为该顶点生成锚点骨骼, 并将该顶点绑定至该骨骼. ",
  "No root bone name specified": "未指定根骨骼名称",
  "No vertex attribute name specified": "未指定顶点属性名称",
  "Cannot Find \"%s\" Stream On Mesh": "无法在 Mesh 上找到名为'%s'的流",
  "Cannot Find \"%s\" Vertex Map On Mesh": "无法在网格上找到名为'%s'的顶点贴图",
  "Expected Float Data For Vertex Map \"%s\", Got %s": "期望顶点映射'%s'的数据类型为浮点数, 但实际得到的是 %s",
  "Anchor Bone \"%s\" Already Exists In Mesh": "锚点骨骼'%s'已在网格中存在",
  "Unexpected Index Adding \"%s\", Expected %d, Got %d": "意外的索引值: '%s', 预期值为 %d, 实际得到的值为 %d",
  "Couldn't Find Or Add \"%s\" Bone": "无法找到或添加 '%s' 骨骼",
  "Different Indices On Mesh vs Bind Pose For \"%s\" Bone": "'%s'骨骼在网格上的索引与绑定姿势中的索引不一致",
  "Different Indices On Mesh vs Bind Pose For \"%s\" Added Anchor Bone": "'%s'的锚点骨骼: 网格上的不同索引与绑定姿势不一致",
  "Only Shadows": "仅阴影",
  "Render mesh markup data": "渲染网格标记数据",
  "Material Search Path": "材料搜索路径",
  "Use Expensive Tangents": "使用昂贵的切线",
  "Use High Precision/Expensive Texcoords": "使用高精度/高成本的纹理坐标",
  "Use High Precision Blend Weights": "使用高精度混合权重",
  "Use for faces": "用于面部识别",
  "Calculate Per-Vertex Curvature": "计算逐顶点曲率",
  "Favor higher density in mesh UV density calculation": "在网格UV密度计算中优先选择较高的密度",
  "Skin Parented Transforms": "皮肤绑定变换",
  "Any meshes in the rendermesh file which have no skinning will skinned to their transform and that transform will be made into a bone.  Has no effect unless the model has animation": "渲染网格文件中所有未设置骨骼绑定的网格都会被绑定到其自身的变换节点上, 该节点也会被转换为骨骼. 只有当模型包含动画时此设置才会生效",
  "Use UV2 for Lightmap Charting": "使用UV2进行光照贴图划分",
  "Will use the second uv channel in the model to generate lightmap uvs.  This can help improve the quality of lightmap uvs by providing a better unwrap that has fewer shards and generates fewer charts.": "将使用模型中的第二个UV通道来生成光照贴图UV. 这样能获得更合理的UV展开效果, 减少碎块与图块数量, 从而提升光照贴图UV的质量. ",
  "Render Mode": "渲染模式",
  "Blend Weights Per Vertex": "逐顶点混合权重",
  "Specifies the maximum number of blend weights per vertex on this mesh": "指定此网格上每个顶点允许使用的最大混合权重数量",
  "Suppress Joint Weight Count Warnings": "禁用关节权重计数警告",
  "Suppress warnings regarding the joint weight count per vertex exceeding allowable maximums. Those meshes already get the renormalized largest weights up to the maximum count.": "忽略那些顶点上的关节权重数量超出允许上限的警告. 这些网格的权重值早已被重新归一化, 并控制在最大允许数量以内. ",
  "Close Outline at Hard Edges": "在硬边缘处闭合轮廓",
  "If using NPR Outlines, add additional triangles at hard edges so the mesh doesn't separate when pushed outwards along the normal": "若使用 NPR 轮廓技术, 请在硬边缘处添加额外的三角形, 这样沿法线方向向外推挤时网格才不会分离",
  "Unknown bone '%s'": "未知骨骼'%s'",
  "Parent Bone": "父骨骼",
  "For a ragdoll or other articulated physics: the bone this shape is rigidly linked with. (All shapes referencing the same bone are merged into a single body.)": "对于布娃娃或其他关节型物理对象: 此形状所严格绑定到的骨骼. (所有引用同一骨骼的形状都会被合并为单个实体. )",
  "Surface Property": "表面属性",
  "What material this object is made of. Used for mass calculations, impact effects, surface decals, sounds, etc.": "此物体由何种材料制成. 该信息用于质量计算、碰撞效果、表面贴图、音效等方面. ",
  "Collision Property": "碰撞属性",
  "Tool Material": "工具材质",
  "Hit Group": "命中组",
  "Pick the target bone:": "请选择目标骨骼: ",
  "Recenter On Parent Bone": "重置为父骨骼位置",
  "<font color='darkred'><strong>Off:</strong></font> Maintain the relative translation and rotation between the source file origin and the parent bone's bind pose.<br><font color='darkgreen'><strong>On:</strong></font> Realign the translation and rotation of the source file to match the parent bone exactly.<br><br><em>(NOTE: The 'Offset Origin' and 'Offset Angle' are applied in either case.)</em>": "<font color='darkred'><strong>关闭: </strong></font> 保持源文件原点与父骨骼绑定姿态之间的平移和旋转关系不变. <br><font color='darkgreen'><strong>开启: </strong></font> 重新调整源文件的平移与旋转值, 使其与父骨骼完全对齐. <br><br><em>(注意: '原点偏移'与'角度偏移'在任何情况下均会生效. )</em>",
  "Offset Angle": "偏移角度",
  "Input morph control for a specific delta": "输入特定增量值以进行形态控制",
  "Stereo": "立体声",
  "Stereo controls are compiled into right_<name> and left_<name> pairs.": "立体声控制功能被编译为 right_<name> 和 left_<name> 两组控制项. ",
  "Min Value": "最小值",
  "The minimum value the controller can have, typically 0": "控制器可取值的最小值, 通常为 0",
  "Max Value": "最大值",
  "The maximum value the controller can have, typically 1": "控制器所能取值的最大值, 通常为 1",
  "Implicit": "隐式",
  "This value is set when the morph control is created via mesh loading and not explictly created by the user": "此值是在通过加载网格来创建变形控件时设定的, 并非由用户显式设置",
  "New morph control name:": "新的变形控制名称: ",
  "Morph rule": "变形规则",
  "The named Morph Shape will receive the result of the expression": "指定的变形形状将接收表达式的计算结果",
  "Expression": "表达式",
  "A mathematical expression which reads from named morph controls and the result is stored in the name Target Morph Shape": "这是一个数学表达式, 它从指定的变形控制器中读取数值, 并将计算结果存储到名为'目标变形形状'的变量中",
  "If the Parent Bone is unset for an attachment or a hitbox, the model's origin is used.": "如果未为某个附着点或碰撞盒设置父骨骼, 则会使用模型的原点. ",
  "Relative Origin": "相对原点",
  "Relative Angles": "相对角度",
  "Attachment point that the game can use for gameplay, particles, etc.": "游戏可用于游戏逻辑、粒子效果等的附着点. ",
  "Ignore Rotation": "忽略旋转",
  "New attachment name:": "新附件名称: ",
  "Pick the parent bone for the attachment:": "请选择附件的父骨骼: ",
  "Additional influence for the attachment.": "附件带来的额外影响. ",
  "Attachment Camera Preview": "附件相机预览",
  "Preview helper for using an attachment as a camera position.": "用于将附件用作相机位置的预览辅助工具. ",
  "Screen Width for Aspect": "宽高比对应的屏幕宽度",
  "Screen Height for Aspect": "宽高比对应的屏幕高度",
  "Preview Scale": "预览缩放比例",
  "Background Color": "背景颜色",
  "Attachment Preview Model": "附件预览模式",
  "Helper for previewing how a model may attach to the given attachment. Does NOT affect the compiled model.": "用于预览模型如何附着到指定附着点的辅助工具. 该操作不会影响最终编译出的模型. ",
  "Local Attachment Offset": "本地附件偏移量",
  "A named group of hitboxes that the game considers logically equivalent. (ie. a character torso may consist of multiple hitboxes.)": "一组被命名为'碰撞区域'的集合, 游戏会将其视为逻辑上等价的整体. (例如: 一个角色的躯干可能由多个碰撞区域组成. )",
  "New Hitbox Set Name:": "新的碰撞盒集合名称: ",
  "A hitbox set that is auto-populated from the model skeleton during compile.)": "一个在编译时由模型骨架自动生成的碰撞盒集合",
  "Translation Only": "仅平移",
  "Group ID": "组ID",
  "Hitbox: %s set": "碰撞区域: %s 已设置",
  "Hitbox: Bone - %s": "碰撞框: 骨骼 - %s",
  "Pick the parent bone for the hitbox:": "请选择碰撞盒的父骨骼: ",
  "Pick the parent hitbox set:": "请选择父级碰撞体集合: ",
  "Hitbox": "碰撞区域",
  "Individual box within a hitbox set.": "命中框集合中的单个框. ",
  "Hitbox Mins": "碰撞框最小值",
  "Hitbox Maxs": "碰撞区域最大值",
  "A sphere shaped hit box within a hitbox set.": "位于命中框集合中的一个球形命中框. ",
  "A caspule shaped hitbox within a hitbox set.": "位于一组碰撞框内的胶囊形碰撞框. ",
  "Point 0": "点0",
  "Point 1": "点1",
  "No but transfer UVs": "否, 但需要传递UV信息",
  "A group of grooms that share a lighting and sim volume texture and will sort correctly against each other": "一组共享同一光照与模拟体积纹理的新郎模型, 它们能够彼此正确地排序",
  "Root Bone": "根骨骼",
  "Reference to an alembic file with curves data, turns into a runtime groom mesh": "该Alembic文件包含曲线数据, 加载后会在运行时生成Groom网格",
  "Target Hair Count": "目标头发数量",
  "Target Guide Hair Count": "目标引导毛发数量",
  "Max Curve Segments": "最大曲线分段数",
  "High Quality Interpolation": "高质量插值处理",
  "Render Material": "渲染材质",
  "Attach to Morphing Base Mesh": "附加到变形基础网格",
  "Base Mesh": "基础网格",
  "Base Mesh Material": "基础网格材质",
  "Enable Physics Sim": "启用物理模拟",
  "Simulation Params Material": "仿真参数与材料",
  "Could not create HairMetaData( %s ) node": "无法创建 HairMetaData(%s) 节点",
  "Groom root bone \"%s\" doesn't exist": "要修整的根骨骼'%s'不存在",
  "Pick the source hair file": "选择源头发文件",
  "Can't find this node in the list of all groom group nodes.": "在所有Groom组节点列表中找不到该节点. ",
  "Material \"%s\" is not using a proper hair shader.": "材质'%s'未使用正确的毛发着色器. ",
  "Material \"%s\" failed to load.": "材质'%s'加载失败. ",
  "Unsupported mix of opaque and translucent materials in thie groom group. Render materials in child groom meshfile nodes must either be all opaque or all translucent.": "此毛发组中混合使用了不透明与半透明材质, 这是不被允许的. 子毛发网格文件节点中的材质必须全部为不透明或全部为半透明. ",
  "Stores metadata for groom meshes.": "用于存储 groom 网格的元数据. ",
  "Physics Prop": "物理道具",
  "Ragdoll": "布娃娃效果",
  "Body Collection": "身体模型合集",
  "Physics Particle": "物理粒子",
  "Debris": "碎片/残留物",
  "Interactive": "交互式",
  "Place On Bone": "放置在骨骼上",
  "Place On Attachment": "置于附件处",
  "Default (No Name)": "默认(无名称) (No Name)",
  "Inherit Owner Name": "继承所有者名称",
  "Combine Owner + Part Name": "组合所有者与部件名称",
  "Default (No RGB Tint)": "默认(无RGB色调) (No RGB Tint)",
  "Inherit RGB Tint": "继承 RGB 色调",
  "Default Material Group": "默认材质组",
  "Inherit Material Index": "继承材质索引",
  "Inherit Material Name": "继承材质名称",
  "Random": "随机",
  "Do not change any physics joints.": "请勿修改任何物理关节. ",
  "Inherit All Joints": "继承所有关节",
  "The new break piece copies all the physics joints from the non-broken piece.": "新的断裂件会复制原始件上的所有物理关节. ",
  "Replace Specific Body's Joints": "替换指定角色的关节",
  "The new break piece only copies joints attached to a specific physics body": "新的断开片段仅会复制连接到特定物理体的关节",
  "Placement Mode": "放置模式",
  "Placement Bone": "放置骨骼",
  "Placement Attachment": "放置附着点",
  "+On Break": "休息中",
  "Sound Event On Spawn": "生成时触发音效",
  "Spawn Entity": "生成实体",
  "The type of entity to spawn for the break piece.": "要生成的断块实体类型. ",
  "Enable Collision With Parent": "启用与父级对象的碰撞检测",
  "When this breakpiece breaks, should it be able to intersect with the parent that spawned it?": "当此碎片破裂后, 它是否应该能与生成它的父体发生交叉?",
  "Ragdoll Applies Bind Pose Root": "布娃娃系统: 应用绑定姿势根节点",
  "If this break piece spawns a ragdoll, should we apply the root transform from the bind pose on top of the initial entity transform?": "如果这个断点生成了布娃娃模型, 我们是否应该在初始实体变换的基础上再应用绑定姿势的根变换呢?",
  "Collision Group": "碰撞组",
  "Offset Rotation": "偏移旋转",
  "+On Break/Fade": "+暂停/淡出",
  "Fade Time": "淡入淡出时间",
  "Seconds before the piece fades out and is removed from the game.<br>-1 means 'default fade time' which is currently 20 seconds.<br>0 means infinite <font color='red'>(which can cause performance problems if over-used)</font>": "方块逐渐淡出并从游戏中移除所需的秒数. <br>-1 表示'默认的淡出时间', 目前为 20 秒. <br>0 表示无限时间 <font color='red'>(过度使用可能导致性能问题)</font>",
  "Fade Min Dist": "渐隐最小距离",
  "Fade Max Dist": "淡出最大距离",
  "Name Mode": "名称模式",
  "Random Spawn Chance": "随机生成概率",
  "Suppress Creation On Death": "禁用角色死亡时的创建功能",
  "If true, this break piece can only be spawned manually by explicit game code such as code using animating_breakable_stage model GameData.": "若设为真, 此破碎部件只能通过游戏代码手动生成, 例如调用 animating_breakable_stage 模型及 GameData 的代码. ",
  "Essential Piece": "关键组件",
  "<font color='red'>(WARNING: Performance risk!)</font><br>Indicates this breakpiece is essential for gameplay or other reasons.<br>Forces the piece to always spawn, potentially suppressing other breakpieces to stay in-budget.": "<font color='red'>(警告: 可能影响性能! )</font><br>表示该破坏部件对游戏流程或其他方面至关重要. <br>强制使该部件始终生成, 但这可能导致其他破坏部件无法生成, 从而影响预算控制. ",
  "Can Player Pickup Piece": "玩家能否拾取道具",
  "Set true if this is a break piece the player should be able to pickup.": "如果此物品为玩家可拾取的破损物品, 请设为 true. ",
  "Render Color Mode": "渲染色彩模式",
  "Material Group Mode": "物料分组模式",
  "+On Break/+Physics": "+休息中/+物理效果",
  "Physics Joint Modification Mode": "物理关节修改模式",
  "Specific Physics Body to Replace": "要替换的物理实体",
  "Mass Override": "批量覆盖",
  "Override the mass this embedded piece will spawn with regardless of the VMDL propdata.": "忽略 VMDL 中的属性数据, 强制指定此嵌入部件生成的质量值. ",
  "Reference to a separate model to spawn when a physics prop is broken.": "当物理道具破碎时, 用于生成新模型的依据. ",
  "Force Motion Disabled": "强制运动已禁用",
  "Force this external piece to spawn motion-disabled regardless of the VMDL propdata. (For embedded pieces, just add propdata child node.)": "强制使此外部部件生成时处于无法移动的状态, 即便 VMDL 中的道具数据有不同设置. (对于嵌入式部件, 只需添加道具数据子节点即可. )",
  "Health Override": "健康状态覆盖",
  "Override the health this external piece will spawn with regardless of the VMDL propdata. (For embedded pieces, just add propdata child node.)": "无论VMDL中的道具数据如何设置, 均会以此值作为该外部道具生成时的生命值. (对于内嵌式道具, 只需添加propdata子节点即可. )",
  "Break Piece External": "断开外部部件连接",
  "Special operation to execute when this model breaks.": "当此模型出现异常时需执行的特殊操作. ",
  "Blend Anim Events": "混合动画事件",
  "By default, only the animation events on the first child animation are considered, if true all animation events which have a non-zero blend weight are used to detect animation events": "默认情况下, 仅考虑第一个子动画中的动画事件; 若设为 true, 则会使用所有混合权重不为零的动画事件来进行检测",
  "Fixed Blend": "固定混合模式",
  "Fixed Blend Val": "已修复混合值",
  "New animation name:": "新动画名称: ",
  "Match Frame Counts": "匹配帧数",
  "Add a hold to shorter animations in the blend to match frame counts on all blends": "为混合动画中时长较短的动画添加暂停效果, 以确保所有混合动画的帧数一致",
  "Animation references itself as blend target": "动画将自己标记为混合目标",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph, use \"Blend 1D\" node in AnimGraph instead": "模型文档'%s'中的节点与 AnimGraph 不兼容, 请改用 AnimGraph 中的'1D 混合'节点",
  "1D Blend Has No Referenced Animations": "1D混合模式未引用任何动画",
  "Fixed Blend is true, pose parameter \"%s\" is ignored.": "固定混合模式已启用, 姿态参数'%s'将被忽略. ",
  "Non-Matching Frame Count/Rate On Referenced Anim: %s, Expecting %d/%gfps got %d/%gfps": "引用的动画中帧数/帧率不匹配: %s, 预期值为 %d/%gfps, 实际值为 %d/%gfps",
  "Non-AnimFile Referenced: %s": "引用的非动画文件: %s",
  "Row Fixed Blend Val": "行固定混合值",
  "Col Fixed Blend Val": "列固定混合值",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph, use \"Blend 2D\" node in AnimGraph instead": "模型文档'%s'中的节点与AnimGraph不兼容, 请改用AnimGraph中的'2D混合'节点",
  "2D Blend Has No Referenced Animations": "2D混合动画未引用任何动画资源",
  "Fixed Blend is true, col pose parameter \"%s\" is ignored.": "固定混合模式已启用, 因此姿态参数'%s'将被忽略. ",
  "Node that takes an animation and resolves into a 2d blend": "该节点接收动画数据并生成二维混合结果",
  "WeightList Name": "权重列表名称",
  "Horizontal Pose Param": "水平姿势参数",
  "Vertical Pose Param": "垂直姿态参数",
  "Has Up Frame": "包含上帧",
  "Right To Left": "从右至左",
  "Auto Layer": "自动图层",
  "Pick the source animation file": "选择源动画文件",
  "Pick the horizontal pose parameter:": "请选择水平姿态参数: ",
  "Pick the vertical pose parameter:": "请选择垂直姿态参数: ",
  "Lowest": "最低值",
  "Medium": "中",
  "high": "高",
  "High": "高",
  "Highest": "最高",
  "Parameters which control the ACL compression for animation.": "用于控制动画ACL压缩的参数. ",
  "Compression Level": "压缩级别",
  "Applies to skeletal animation only.<br><br>Specify how aggressively to attempt to reduce the memory footprint. Higher levels will try more permutations and bit rates. The higher the level, the slower the compression but the smaller the memory footprint. <br><b>NOTE</b>: Currently lowest, low and medium are all equivalent.": "仅适用于骨骼动画. <br><br>指定压缩强度, 以尽可能减小内存占用. 数值越高, 程序会尝试越多种排列组合与比特率. 数值越高, 压缩速度越慢, 但内存占用也越小. <br><b>注意</b>: 目前最低、低及中等强度设置的效果相同. ",
  "Virtual Vertex Distance": "虚拟顶点距离",
  "Translation Constant Threshold": "平移常量阈值",
  "Threshold value to use when detecting if translation tracks are constant or default. In game units, i.e. inches": "用于判断平移轨迹是否保持恒定或处于默认状态的阈值, 单位采用游戏内置单位, 即英寸",
  "Error Threshold": "错误阈值",
  "Tracks Precision": "轨迹精度",
  "Applies to morph animation only.<br><br>This is the per component precision threshold to try and attain when optimizing the bit rate. If the error is below the precision threshold, we will remove bits until we reach it without exceeding it. If the error is above the precision threshold, we will add more bits until we lower it underneath.": "仅适用于变形动画. <br><br>这是在优化比特率时所力求达到的单个组件精度阈值. 如果误差值低于该精度阈值, 我们会逐步减少比特数直至达到但不超过此阈值; 如果误差值高于该阈值, 我们则会增加比特数以将其降至阈值以下. ",
  "Tracks Constant Threshold": "轨迹恒定阈值",
  "An extra string and weight to apply to the primary activity assigned to an animation": "可添加到动画所关联的主活动上的额外字符串及权重",
  "Activity Name": "活动名称",
  "Activity Weight": "活动权重",
  "Keyframe animation data": "关键帧动画数据",
  "Viewing Animation Data": "查看动画数据",
  "Bone Rename failed, results in duplicate bones in this animation": "骨骼重命名失败, 导致此动画中出现重复的骨骼",
  "Bone Rename failed, results in duplicate bone '%s' in this animation": "骨骼重命名失败, 导致此动画中出现重复的骨骼'%s'",
  "Number": "编号",
  "First Frame": "首帧",
  "Last Frame": "最后一帧",
  "Align TX": "对齐 TX",
  "Align TY": "对齐 TY",
  "Align TZ": "对齐时区",
  "Align RX": "对齐 RX",
  "Align RY": "对齐 RY",
  "Align RZ": "对齐 RZ",
  "Align Frame Type": "对齐框架类型",
  "Frame": "帧",
  "Align To Anim Name": "对齐至动画名称",
  "Align To Frame Type": "对齐到帧类型",
  "Align To Frame": "对齐到框架",
  "Bone Name": "骨骼名称",
  "Pick the animation to align to:": "请选择要对齐的动画: ",
  "Pick the bone to align:": "请选择要对齐的骨骼: ",
  "Controls the value of a material attribute over a frame range.": "用于控制某一材质属性在指定帧范围内的数值变化. ",
  "Material Attribute Name": "材料属性名称",
  "Specifies the name of the attribute in the material whose value is to be set. This is the name which appears in the 'Attributes Used' section when editing an expression in the material editor.": "指定需要设置值的材质属性的名称. 该名称即为在材质编辑器中编辑表达式时, '使用的属性'区域里显示的属性名. ",
  "Assigns a floating point value to a material attribute over a frame range.": "在指定的帧范围内为材质属性赋予一个浮点数值. ",
  "Target Value": "目标值",
  "The value to assign to the specified attribute when at full intensity. During fade in and fade out the value will blend from 0 to this value.": "在强度达到最大值时, 要赋予指定属性的值. 在渐亮和渐暗过程中, 该属性值会从 0 逐渐过渡到此值. ",
  "Material Attribute Value: %s : %0.2f": "材质属性值: %s: %0.2f",
  "Assigns a color value to a material attribute over a frame range.": "在指定的帧范围内为材质属性指定颜色值. ",
  "Target Color": "目标颜色",
  "The color to assign to the specified attribute when at full intensity. During fade in and fade out the value will blend from black to this value. Note that when the color value is provided to a material expression it will be in linear color space.": "当指定属性处于全强度状态时, 应赋予该属性的颜色. 在渐入渐出过程中, 颜色值会从黑色过渡到此值. 请注意: 当该颜色值被传递给材质表达式时, 它处于线性色彩空间. ",
  "Material Attribute Color: %s": "材质属性颜色: %s",
  "Object Rotation": "对象旋转",
  "Object": "对象",
  "Parent Rotation": "父级旋转",
  "Aim Offset": "瞄准偏移量",
  "Up Type": "向上类型",
  "Up Vector": "上方向向量",
  "Parent Attachment": "父级附件",
  "Constraint missing parent bone": "约束缺少父骨骼",
  "Slave Channel": "从属通道",
  "Constrained Bone": "受限骨骼",
  "Translation Offset": "平移偏移量",
  "Euler Offset XYZ": "欧拉偏移量 XYZ",
  "This is an Euler Rotation in degrees in XYZ order.": "这是按照 XYZ 顺序以度为单位表示的欧拉旋转值. ",
  "Radial Basis Function Type": "径向基函数类型",
  "Falloff": "衰减效果",
  "Attachment Name": "附件名称",
  "Clamp": "限制范围",
  "Drive a morph channel based on a remapped range of the angle between a bone's up-vector and the direction to a target bone.": "根据骨骼的上方向向量与目标骨骼方向之间的角度范围映射值来控制变形通道. ",
  "Target Bone Name": "目标骨骼名称",
  "Remap From Min": "重新映射起始值",
  "Remap From Max": "重新映射: 从最大值开始",
  "Remap To Min": "重新映射到最小值",
  "Remap To Max": "重新映射为最大值",
  "Morph Channel Name": "变形通道名称",
  "The position of this transform": "此变换的位置",
  "The orientation of this transform": "此变换的方向",
  "Name of the bone this pose refers to": "此姿势所对应的骨骼名称",
  "Poses": "姿势",
  "The saved pose data for this bone": "已保存的该骨骼姿势数据",
  "RBF Based Anim Constraint": "基于RBF的动画约束",
  "Translation Ignore Threshold": "平移忽略阈值",
  "Solver Settings": "求解器设置",
  "Depends on scale of translation, increase for stability at the cost of accuracy": "具体取决于平移的规模: 为提升稳定性可能会牺牲一定的准确性",
  "Rotation Ignore Threshold": "旋转忽略阈值",
  "Inverse Threshold": "反向阈值",
  "Trainer Settings": "训练器设置",
  "Linear system is solved by compute a Pseudo-Inverse via SVD. Set the threshold to zero small singular values instead of inverting them.  Increase for Stability at the cost of Accuracy.": "线性系统的求解方法是通过SVD计算伪逆矩阵. 此时应将阈值设为较小的数值以过滤掉极小的奇异值, 而非对这些值进行求逆处理. 提高该阈值可提升系统稳定性, 但会牺牲计算精度. ",
  "L2 Regularization": "L2正则化",
  "Apply the l2 Regularization (Ridge Regression). Increase for Stability & Smoothness at the cost of Accuracy.": "启用L2正则化(岭回归). 该设置可提升模型的稳定性与平滑度, 但会以牺牲精度为代价. ",
  "Input (Driver)": "输入(驱动程序) (Driver)",
  "The input bones and pose samples for the Rbf.  The input are the driver bones.": "用于 Rbf 的输入骨骼及姿势样本. 这些输入即为驱动骨骼. ",
  "Output (Driven)": "输出(受驱动) (Driven)",
  "The output bones and pose samples for the Rbf.  The output are the driven bones.": "输出的骨骼及姿态样本将用于 Rbf. 这些输出内容即受驱动的骨骼. ",
  "No input pose data": "无输入的姿势数据",
  "No output pose data": "无输出姿态数据",
  "Non-Matching Input %d & Output %d Pose Counts": "输入姿态数量 %d 与输出姿态数量 %d 不匹配",
  "X - Forward": "向前移动",
  "Y - Left": "Y轴 - 向左",
  "Z - Up": "Z - 向上",
  "Input Axis": "输入轴",
  "Slave Axis": "从属轴",
  "Inverse": "反相",
  "Parent Bind Rotation": "父级旋转绑定",
  "Child Bind Rotation": "子物体旋转绑定",
  "Generates a new animation which is a smooth blend from A to B": "生成一段从A状态平滑过渡到B状态的新动画",
  "Anim A": "动画 A",
  "Frames From End Of A": "从A片段末尾截取的帧",
  "Anim B": "动画 B",
  "Frames From Start Of B": "从B开头的帧",
  "Final animation consists of A, Crossfade, B": "最终动画由A、交叉淡入淡出效果以及B组成",
  "Couldn't create filtered anim": "无法创建筛选后的动画",
  "Couldn't find referenced animations": "无法找到引用的动画",
  "Specifies that the specified motion should be removed from the specified bones.  If no bones are specified, motion is discarded from all root bones, i.e. bones without a parent.  Motion is discarded for the specified channels by copying the first frame over all frames of the specified motion.": "指定需要从指定骨骼上移除的动作. 若未指定任何骨骼, 则该动作会从所有根骨骼(即没有父级骨骼的那些骨骼)上被移除. 实现方式是将指定动作的第一帧复制到该动作的所有帧上, 从而实现动作的移除. ",
  "Discard X Translation": "放弃 X 平移",
  "Discard Y Translation": "忽略 Y 轴平移",
  "Discard Z Translation": "忽略 Z 轴平移",
  "Discard X Rotation": "放弃 X 轴旋转",
  "Discard Y Rotation": "忽略 Y 轴旋转",
  "Discard Z Rotation": "忽略 Z 轴旋转",
  "Bone Names": "骨骼名称",
  "Bones to discard the specified motion from.  If no bones are specified, motion is discarded from all root bones, i.e. bones without a parent.": "需要移除指定动画的骨骼. 若未指定任何骨骼, 则动画会从所有根骨骼(即没有父骨骼的骨骼)中移除. ",
  "Base class for animations which are nodes that map to a compiled animation": "用于描述那些对应已编译动画的节点类动画的基类",
  "Is Default Idle Anim": "是否为默认闲置动画",
  "On models with an animgraph, setting this to true sets the Activity Name to ACT_IDLE, false will clear the activity.  The intended usage is on models intended to also be used without an animgraph, i.e. as map entities like prop_dynamic with use animgraph disabled in Hammer.  NOTE: If Activity Name is anything other than empty or ACT_IDLE, this field is not writable.": "在带有动画图表的模型上, 将此值设为 true 会将'活动名称'设置为 ACT_IDLE; 设为 false 则会清除该设置. 此设置主要用于那些既需要支持动画图表、又需在无动画图表环境下使用的模型, 例如那些在 Hammer 编辑器中禁用了动画图表功能的 prop_dynamic 类型的地图实体. 注意: 如果'活动名称'字段的值不是空值或 ACT_IDLE, 则该字段不可编辑. ",
  "Fade In Time": "渐入时间",
  "Time in seconds from the start of the animation over which it will fade int when it starts playing.": "动画开始播放时, 从起始时刻起经过多少秒后才会逐渐淡入显示. ",
  "Fade Out Time": "淡出时间",
  "Time in seconds from the end of the animation over which it will fade out when it stops playing.": "动画停止后, 逐渐淡出所需的秒数. ",
  "Looping": "循环",
  "Specify whether the animation loops.": "指定动画是否循环播放. ",
  "Delta": "德尔塔",
  "Hidden": "隐藏",
  "Specify whether the animation should be hidden from the compiled view outliner on the right and pulldowns.": "请指定是否需在右侧的编译后视图大纲及下拉菜单中隐藏该动画. ",
  "Anim Markup Ordered": "动画标记已排序",
  "Specify that the animation markup child nodes for this animation should be processed in the order they appear.": "指定此动画的动画标记子节点应按其出现的顺序进行处理. ",
  "Disable Compression": "禁用压缩",
  "AnimGraph Additive": "动画图叠加模式",
  "If animation has been subtracted in ModelDoc to create an additive animation to be used with AnimGraph, set this to true": "如果在 ModelDoc 中已对动画进行减法处理以生成用于 AnimGraph 的加法型动画, 请将此选项设为 true",
  "Delete From Compiled Model": "从编译后的模型中删除",
  "Delete this animation at the last stage of model compilation. This is useful if this animation is an intermediary source (e.g.: a base animation before subtraction), and while it's necessary to produce other animations, you don't want it to appear on the compiled model.": "在模型编译的最后阶段删除此动画. 如果此动画仅作为中间源文件使用(例如: 用于生成其他动画的基础动画), 那么该方法便十分实用 - 这样就能确保它不会出现在最终编译出的模型中. ",
  "(no-compile)": "(无需编译)(no-compile)",
  "Delta & WorldSpace are mutually exclusive, only check one of them": "Delta与WorldSpace互斥, 只能勾选其中一项",
  "Creates an animation from the model's bind pose": "根据模型的绑定姿态生成动画",
  "Pose To Cycle": "姿势循环",
  "Auto Cycle": "自动循环",
  "An animation to composite over top of this animation.  The cycle of the composited animation will be the same as this animation.": "用于叠加到此动画之上的动画. 叠加后的动画循环周期将与此动画保持一致. ",
  "Anim Name": "动画名称",
  "Pick the animaton to overlay:": "请选择要叠加的动画: ",
  "Crossfade": "淡入淡出",
  "No Blend": "无混合效果",
  "Local Space": "局部空间",
  "Start Frame": "起始帧",
  "Peak Frame": "峰值帧",
  "Tail Frame": "尾帧",
  "End Frame": "结束帧",
  "Pick the influence frame range:": "请选择影响帧范围: ",
  "Pose Param": "姿态参数",
  "Start Cycle": "开始循环",
  "Peak Cycle": "峰值周期",
  "Tail Cycle": "尾周期",
  "End Cycle": "结束周期",
  "Pick the pose parameter that will drive the cycle:": "请选择用于控制循环动作的姿势参数: ",
  "Cycle Type": "循环类型",
  "Pick the pose param that will drive the animation cycle:": "请选择用于控制动画循环的姿态参数: ",
  "A game event occurring at a particular frame in an animation (Footstep, sound, particle effect, etc.)": "在动画的特定帧处触发的游戏事件(如脚步声、音效、粒子效果等)",
  "Event Class": "事件类别",
  "No destructible hit group set up for hitgroup '%s'; this anim event should be removed/disabled!": "尚未为命中组'%s'设置可破坏命中组; 请移除或禁用此动画事件! ",
  "Override sound is invalid.": "自定义音效无效. ",
  "Frame Offset": "帧偏移量",
  "Shifts the frames of the additional animation file relative to the base animation file.  Negative values drop # frames from the start, positive values add # copies of the first frame to the start": "用于调整附加动画文件中的帧序列相对于基础动画文件的位置. 输入负值会从开头删除相应数量的帧, 输入正值则会在开头添加相应数量的首帧副本",
  "Filename": "文件名",
  "Filename of the additional animation file to be merged into the resulting animation": "要合并到最终动画中的额外动画文件的文件名",
  "Reference to a content file that will resolve to one or more animations. (Plus additional document nodes such as skeleton bones etc.)": "这是一个内容文件的引用, 该文件可对应一个或多个动画. (此外还包含诸如骨骼节点等其他文档节点. )",
  "The filename of the input animation file.": "输入动画文件的文件名. ",
  "Import Bone Scales": "导入骨骼比例数据",
  "Whether or not to import bone scales.  False by default (i.e. override bone scales to 1.0) for legacy compatibility.  Only applicable to fbx files.": "是否导入骨骼缩放值. 为保持向下兼容性, 默认值为 False(即将骨骼缩放值强制设为 1.0). 此设置仅适用于 FBX 文件. ",
  "The frame at which to start using animation data.  By default it's 0, the first frame of the animation.": "开始使用动画数据的帧数. 默认为 0, 即动画的第一帧. ",
  "The frame at which to end using animation data.  By default it's the last frame of the animation.": "用于指定结束使用动画数据的帧数. 默认值为动画的最后一帧. ",
  "Frame Rate": "帧率",
  "Specify the framerate at which to play back the animation.  It is filled in from the data in the animation file so normally it doesn't need to be modified.": "请指定动画播放的帧率. 该值会从动画文件的数据中自动获取, 因此通常无需修改. ",
  "Reverse": "反向",
  "Additional Anim Files": "额外的动画文件",
  "Import Bone Scales only applies to FBX and DMX input files, will be ignored for %s files": "'导入骨骼缩放'功能仅适用于 FBX 和 DMX 输入文件, 对于 %s 格式的文件则会忽略此设置",
  "Invalid anim file": "无效的动画文件",
  "No animation data found in source file": "在源文件中未找到动画数据",
  "Multi-take source animations not supported": "不支持多镜头源动画",
  "No animation in additional file: %s": "附加文件中未找到动画: %s",
  "Failed to merge additional anim file: %s": "合并附加动画文件失败: %s",
  "Couldn't create an animation with the name \"%s\", likely already exists": "无法创建名为'%s'的动画, 该名称可能已被使用",
  "Cannot rename non-compliant animated bone name from \"%s\" to \"%s\", animation data will be lost": "无法将不符合规范的动画骨骼名称从'%s'重命名为'%s', 否则动画数据将会丢失",
  "Sanitize Bone Names failed, results in duplicate bones in this animation": "骨骼名称清理失败, 导致此动画中出现重复骨骼",
  "Sanitize Bone Names failed, results in duplicate bone '%s' in this animation": "骨骼名称清理失败, 导致此动画中出现重复的骨骼'%s'",
  "Hold Frame %d Remapped To Last Frame Of Source Anim, Valid Range: [ %d, %d ]": "将帧 %d 映射为源动画的最后一帧, 有效范围:  [ %d, %d ]",
  "Force a single world-space bone transform": "强制使用单一世界空间骨骼变换",
  "Translation": "平移",
  "Rotation": "旋转",
  "AnimForceBonePosition [%s]": "动画力骨骼位置 [%s]",
  "Force a single world-space bone transform over a specified frame range": "强制在指定的帧范围内应用单个世界空间骨骼变换",
  "Start Frame Number": "起始帧编号",
  "Peak Frame Number": "峰值帧数",
  "Tail Frame Number": "尾帧编号",
  "End Frame Number": "结束帧编号",
  "AnimForceBonePositionRange [%s]": "动画力骨骼位置范围 [%s]",
  "Spin a bone around an axis of rotation. For quick procedural fans, propellers, etc": "围绕旋转轴旋转骨骼. 适用于快速生成程序化风扇、螺旋桨等效果",
  "Spin Degrees": "旋转角度",
  "Offset Axis of Rotation": "旋转轴偏移量",
  "AnimForceBoneSpin [%s]": "动画力骨骼旋转 [%s]",
  "Apply a morph parameter value over the specified range.": "在指定的范围内应用变形参数值. ",
  "Value Zero": "数值为零",
  "Value One": "数值一",
  "AnimForceMorphValueRange [%s]": "动画力变形值范围 [%s]",
  "Fix a specified bone to a given transform while maintaining all relative animation.": "将指定骨骼固定到指定的变换位置, 同时保留所有相对动画. ",
  "AnimAnchorBonePosition [%s]": "动画锚点骨骼位置 [%s]",
  "Override bone scale information on an animation": "忽略动画中的骨骼缩放信息",
  "Frame Number": "帧编号",
  "The name of the bone which will have the scale valve overwritten.": "将被覆盖缩放值的骨骼名称. ",
  "Scale Set": "缩放集",
  "The name of the scale set which will be applied to the animation at compile time.": "编译时将应用于动画的缩放集名称. ",
  "No scale set specified": "未指定任何缩放比例",
  "A single frame from a referenced animation": "被引用动画中的单帧画面",
  "Source Animation Name": "源动画名称",
  "The animation from which to get a frame.": "要从中提取帧的动画. ",
  "Frame Type": "帧类型",
  "The type of frame to get, first frame, last frame or a specific frame number.": "要获取的帧类型: 第一帧、最后一帧或指定的帧编号. ",
  "If the type of frame to get is a specific frame number, this is the frame that is used.": "如果要获取的帧类型为指定帧编号, 则此处即为所使用的帧编号. ",
  "Animation references itself as the source animation": "动画将自身标记为源动画",
  "Couldn't create new animation": "无法创建新动画",
  "Head": "标题",
  "Node that resolves into an auto-generated collection of gesture animations and composed final sequence for use in faceposer etc.": "该节点会自动生成一系列手势动画, 并将其组合为最终动画序列, 可供 Faceposer 等工具使用. ",
  "In Frame": "在框架内",
  "Loop Start Frame": "循环起始帧",
  "Loop End Frame": "循环结束帧",
  "Out Frame": "输出帧",
  "Accent Frame": "口音演示框",
  "Gesture Type": "手势类型",
  "Ignore Outro": "忽略结尾画面",
  "Loop FPS": "循环帧率",
  "Create Left": "创建左侧",
  "Create Right": "创建权限",
  "Translation Weight": "平移权重",
  "Rotation Weight": "旋转权重",
  "Pick the IK Chain to lock:": "请选择要锁定的IK链: ",
  "Animations from the specified model will be loaded and merged into this model at runtime.  Akin to QC's $includemodel": "指定模型中的动画会在运行时被加载并合并到当前模型中. 功能类似于 QC 中的 $includemodel",
  "The resource name of the model to include.": "需要包含的模型的资源名称. ",
  "Initial Value": "初始值",
  "Parent Node Name": "父节点名称",
  "AnimCombine [%s]": "动画合成 [%s]",
  "Subtracts a linear blend of the first and last frames of the animation from itself.": "从动画的每一帧中减去第一帧与最后一帧之间的线性插值结果. ",
  "Subtracts a frame of the specified animation from all frames of this animation.": "从此动画的所有帧中减去指定动画的某一帧. ",
  "Subtracts a frame of the specified animation from all frames of this animation in model space.": "在模型空间中, 将指定动画的某一帧从该动画的所有帧中减去. ",
  "Copies animation streams from the specified anim onto the parent anim over the given interval.": "在指定时间段内, 将指定动画的流内容复制到父级动画中. ",
  "Transforms the animation by the specified values": "按照指定的数值变换动画",
  "Euler XYZ": "欧拉XYZ",
  "Controls the order of sequences in the compiled model": "控制编译后模型中各序列的排列顺序",
  "Animation Order": "动画顺序",
  "Order of animation sequences in compiled model.  Specified entries will be ordered first, unspecified entries will be added after ordered entries in an unspecified order.": "编译后模型中动画序列的排列顺序. 指定的条目会排在最前面, 未指定的条目则会以任意顺序添加在它们之后. ",
  "Remove all values from the list": "清空列表中的所有值",
  "Populate": "填充",
  "Clears and populates the list from the current model": "清空列表并根据当前模型重新填充内容",
  "Node that resolves into an auto-generated collection of posture animations and composed final sequence for use in faceposer etc.": "该节点可自动生成一组姿势动画, 并组合成最终动画序列, 以供Faceposer等工具使用. ",
  "Apex Frame": "Apex 框架",
  "With Hands": "手动操作",
  "Lock Left Foot": "锁定左脚",
  "Lock Right Foot": "锁定右脚",
  "AnimProxy never found sequence matching '%s'": "AnimProxy 未找到与 '%s' 匹配的序列",
  "Base class for nodes which can be children of AnimMarkupTarget derived nodes": "可作为 AnimMarkupTarget 派生节点子节点的节点基类",
  "Pick the markup frame range:": "请选择标记帧范围: ",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph due to child markup nodes": "模型文档'%s'中的节点因包含子标记节点而无法与动画图兼容",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node \"%s\" incompatible with AnimGraph due to child markup nodes": "模型文档'%s'中的节点'%s'因包含子标记节点而无法与 AnimGraph 兼容",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph": "模型文档'%s'中的节点与动画图不兼容",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node \"%s\" incompatible with AnimGraph": "模型文档'%s'中的节点'%s'与动画图不兼容",
  "Full Frame Range": "完整帧范围",
  "Ease In/Out": "缓入缓出",
  "Lerp Type": "插值类型",
  "Whether the to use the curve or just a set value for the entire frame range": "是否对整个帧范围使用曲线还是仅使用固定值",
  "If Lerp Type is Full Frame Range, this is the fixed scale value applied, the curve is used otherwise": "若'Lerp类型'设置为'完整帧范围', 则应用此固定缩放值; 否则使用曲线进行计算",
  "CurveEditor( { extended=true input_name=\"Frame\" output_name=\"Value\" } )": "曲线编辑器({ extended=true input_name=\"帧数\" output_name=\"数值\" })",
  "An editable curve to control a value over a specified frame range which will be used to apply markup to an animation.  Curve is used when Lerp Type is Lerp.": "这是一条可编辑的曲线, 用于在指定的帧范围内控制某个数值, 该数值将被用来对动画添加标记. 当'Lerp类型'设为'Lerp'时, 此曲线即会被使用. ",
  "Specify the initial frame range:": "请指定初始帧范围: ",
  "Anim Curve": "动画曲线",
  "Base class for animation markup nodes which generate user animation data": "用于生成用户动画数据的动画标记节点基类",
  "Rename a bone in an animation": "重命名动画中的骨骼",
  "New Bone Name": "新建骨骼名称",
  "Cannot rename bone from '%s' to '%s', because animation for the new bone name already exists": "无法将骨骼名称从'%s'重命名为'%s', 因为使用新名称的动画已经存在",
  "Could not find animation bone named '%s' for rename.": "无法找到名为'%s'的动画骨骼以进行重命名. ",
  "Discard Bone Channels": "丢弃骨骼通道",
  "Discards bone channels matching the specified names or globs": "丢弃与指定名称或通配符相匹配的骨骼通道",
  "Discard Morph Channels": "丢弃变形通道",
  "Discards morph channels matching the specified names or globs": "忽略与指定名称或通配符匹配的变形通道",
  "Discard Float Channels": "忽略浮点数值通道",
  "Discards Float channels matching the specified names or globs": "丢弃名称或通配符与指定模式相匹配的浮点通道",
  "Discard Any Channels": "放弃所有频道",
  "Discards any channels matching the specified names or globs": "丢弃所有名称或通配符匹配指定条件的通道",
  "Static Only": "仅静态模式",
  "Only discards channels which are static in addition to matching any of the above.  Static means the animation channel's value does not change during the entire animation.": "仅会丢弃那些值始终保持不变且符合上述条件的通道. 所谓'值始终保持不变', 是指该动画通道的值在整个动画过程中都不会发生任何变化. ",
  "Static Only Tolerance": "仅静态容差",
  "Tolerance value for determining if an animation channel is static or not.": "用于判断动画通道是否处于静止状态的容差值. ",
  "Frames From Start": "从开头开始的帧数",
  "Frames From End": "从末尾开始的帧数",
  "Resets the starting frame of a looping animation.  This is useful when mixing multiple animations and the animations need to all run together in phase, but the source animations don't match.": "重置循环动画的起始帧. 当需要混合多个动画并确保它们同步播放, 但原始动画的起始帧并不一致时, 此功能非常有用. ",
  "Start Loop Frame": "开始循环帧",
  "Invalid turn animation file specified, must contain exactly 3 frames, found %d frames": "指定的转身动画文件无效: 该文件必须包含恰好3帧, 但当前检测到 %d 帧",
  "PoseParam( %s ) node already defined but expected [ min, max ] == [ -1, 1 ], got [ %g, %g ]": "PoseParam( %s ) 节点已定义, 但预期的取值范围应为 [ -1, 1 ], 实际得到的值为 [ %g, %g ]",
  "Could not create PoseParam( %s ) node": "无法创建 PoseParam(%s) 节点",
  "Could not create ModelDocAnim( %s ) node": "无法创建 ModelDocAnim( %s ) 节点",
  "Could not create ModelDoc1DBlend( %s ) node": "无法创建 ModelDoc1DBlend(%s) 节点",
  "Gameplay Identifier": "游戏玩法标识符",
  "Override Timing": "计时规则覆盖",
  "Associates a semantic identifier with an animgraph2 used by this model.": "将语义标识符与此模型所使用的动画图关联起来. ",
  "New AnimGraph2 Identifier:": "新的 AnimGraph2 标识符: ",
  "Specifies the AnimGraph2 that the model will use by default.": "指定模型默认使用的 AnimGraph2. ",
  "Default: %s": "默认值: %s",
  "Specifies a NmSkeleton that the model can be targetted by.": "指定模型可作为目标的 NmSkeleton. ",
  "Pick the source Nm Skeleton file": "选择源 Nm 骨架文件",
  "Unrestricted movement within the joint limits (Saloon Doors)": "在关节限制范围内可自由移动(像双扇门那样) (Saloon Doors)",
  "Friction": "摩擦力",
  "Continuously reduce joint velocity and oppose gravity (Barn Door)": "持续降低关节速度并抵抗重力(遮门机制) (Barn Door)",
  "Elastic": "弹性",
  "Continuously try to return to the bind-pose (Spring Loaded Door)": "持续尝试恢复到绑定姿势(弹簧加载门) (Spring Loaded Door)",
  "Plastic": "塑料",
  "Elastic behavior where the target pose gradually deforms towards the current pose": "目标姿态会逐渐向当前姿态变形, 呈现出弹性效果",
  "Constrain Translation Only": "仅限制平移",
  "Do not restrict angular motion": "请勿限制角度运动",
  "Constrain Rotation Only": "仅限制旋转",
  "Do not restrict linear motion": "请勿限制线性运动",
  "Parent Body": "上级主体",
  "Child Body": "子体",
  "Anchor Origin": "锚点原点",
  "Anchor Angles": "锚点角度",
  "Collision Enabled": "碰撞检测已启用",
  "Constraint Space": "约束空间",
  "Disable linear/angular component of this joint": "禁用此关节的线性/角度分量",
  "Use Block Solver": "使用块求解器",
  "Use a higher quality solver for this joint. Improves accuracy / stiffness but increases CPU cost.": "请为此关节使用质量更高的求解器. 这能提升精度与刚度, 但会增加CPU开销. ",
  "+Motion Resistance": "+抗运动干扰能力",
  "Counteract motion in the joint": "抑制关节处的运动",
  "How fast joint velocity is reduced": "关节速度的降低速度",
  "Elasticity": "弹性",
  "How much the joint tries to drive back to bind pose": "该关节试图恢复到绑定姿势的程度是多少",
  "Damping": "阻尼",
  "Reduce how bouncy the joint is": "降低关节的弹性程度",
  "Plasticity": "可塑性",
  "How quickly the elasticity target pose changes to match the current pose": "弹性目标姿态适应当前姿态的速度有多快",
  "A list of choices (each of which is group of meshes), only one of which will be visible at a time in-game.": "一系列可选选项(每个选项都对应一组网格), 在游戏中一次只能显示其中一个. ",
  "Hide in Tools": "隐藏在工具菜单中",
  "Non-BodyGroup Single Choice": "非体组单选",
  "If this bodygroup has a single choice, and this is set, do not suffix the output bodygroup name with an _@#, output it as is.  Mainly for import compatibility.": "如果此体型组仅有一个可选选项, 且本设置已启用, 则无需在输出的体型组名称后添加 _@#, 直接输出原名称即可. 该设置主要用于确保导入时的兼容性. ",
  "Suppress Missing Warnings": "抑制缺失警告",
  "Suppress warnings when bodygroups specify meshes that do not exist. This is useful if the bodygroup definition is in a shared prefab and missing warnings are expected or benign.": "当身体部件组指定了不存在的网格时, 抑制相关警告信息. 如果身体部件组的定义位于共享预制件中, 且产生此类警告属于正常现象或并无危害, 则此选项十分有用. ",
  "New bodygroup name:": "新的身体部位组名称: ",
  "A list of meshes that form a single choice within a bodygroup.": "构成身体组中单个选项的网格列表. ",
  "Choice #0 (default)": "选项 #0(默认) (default)",
  "Choice #%d": "选项 #%d",
  "Bounds": "边界",
  "Override model bounds.": "忽略模型边界限制. ",
  "Bounds Mins": "边界最小值",
  "Bounds Maxs": "边界最大值",
  "Bounds View": "边界视图",
  "If this node is present, set the model view bounds explicitly.  Normally the model view bounds is derived from the render mesh bounds at model load time.": "如果存在此节点, 请显式设置模型视图边界. 通常情况下, 模型视图边界会在加载模型时根据渲染网格的边界自动计算得出. ",
  "Bounds Hull": "边界包围盒",
  "If this node is present, set the model hull bounds explicitly.  Normally the model hull bounds is derived from the physics hull bounds at model load time.": "如果存在此节点, 请显式设置模型的外壳边界. 通常情况下, 模型的外壳边界是在模型加载时根据物理外壳边界计算得出的. ",
