  "Heat": "热度",
  "Hybrid": "混合模式",
  "Pick the parent bone for the bone:": "请选择该骨骼的父骨骼: ",
  "No parent bone specified": "未指定父骨骼",
  "Cannot specify self or any child as parent": "无法将自身或任何子项设置为父项",
  "Parent bone '%s' specified by define bone could not be found.": "未能找到由定义骨骼所指定的父骨骼'%s'. ",
  "Generates a distance field using the mesh triangles selected in child nodes.": "使用子节点中选定的网格三角形来生成距离场. ",
  "Surface Bias": "表面偏差",
  "Distance Offset": "距离偏移量",
  "Two Sided": "双面",
  "Far Field Only": "仅远场",
  "Trace the distance field with low fidelity far field occlusion only. This can be much faster, but the result will lack high frequency occlusion detail.": "仅以低精度方式追踪距离场中的远场遮挡情况. 这种方式速度会快很多, 但结果会缺失高频遮挡细节. ",
  "Use For Occlusion": "用于遮挡处理",
  "Whether this distance field contributes to AO.": "此距离字段是否参与环境光遮蔽计算. ",
  "Use For Collision": "用于碰撞检测",
  "Whether this distance field is a collider for certain effects such as hair simulation.": "此距离字段是否作为碰撞体用于毛发模拟等特效. ",
  "Optional bone to use as the root transform.": "可选的骨骼, 用作根变换节点. ",
  "Add Extra Boundary Voxels": "添加额外的边界体素",
  "Advanced": "高级设置",
  "Bone Influence Filter Threshold": "骨骼影响过滤阈值",
  "Bone Influence Filter": "骨骼影响过滤器",
  "Exclude Materials": "排除材料",
  "Body Group Name": "身体部位组名称",
  "Body Group Choice": "实体组选择",
  "DistanceField: %s": "距离字段: %s",
  "Distance field body group '%s' is invalid.": "距离字段的主体组'%s'无效. ",
  "A selection of meshes from a file to trace against during distance field generation.": "用于在生成距离场时进行轮廓描边处理的、从文件中选取的多个网格. ",
  "Viewing File: %s": "正在查看文件: %s",
  "A selection of render meshes to trace against during distance field generation.": "用于在生成距离场时进行追踪的各种渲染网格. ",
  "Input dynamic mesh deformation params": "输入动态网格变形参数",
  "Compute Dynamic Smooth Normals": "计算动态平滑法线",
  "If true, recompute smooth normals at runtime after animation.": "若设为 true, 则会在运行时于动画后重新计算平滑法线. ",
  "Smooth Normals Across UV Seams": "跨越UV接缝的平滑法线处理",
  "Avoids normal seams on UV boundaries. Turning it off is faster and saves some GPU memory.": "可避免在UV边界处出现常规接缝. 禁用此选项能提升运行速度并节省部分GPU显存. ",
  "Compute Dynamic Mesh Tension": "计算动态网格张力",
  "If true, recompute dynamic mesh tension (wrinkle map) values after animation.": "如果设为 true, 则在动画结束后重新计算动态网格张力值(褶皱贴图). ",
  "Tension Compress Scale": "张力压缩比例",
  "Scale value for the tension strength of compressed parts of the mesh.": "用于控制网格中受压缩部分的张力强度的缩放值. ",
  "Tension Stretch Scale": "张力拉伸比例",
  "Scale value for the tension strength of stretched parts of the mesh.": "用于控制网格中拉伸部分的张力强度的比例值. ",
  "Frame Count": "帧数",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph, use \"Zero Pose\" node in AnimGraph instead": "模型文档'%s'中的节点无法与动画图配合使用, 请改用动画图中的'零姿势'节点",
  "Uniform": "统一",
  "Single": "单个",
  "Specified": "已指定",
  "Specify that root motion should be extracted from this animation, if no root bone is specified, the first bone without a parent is used": "请指定需从该动画中提取根运动信息; 若未指定根骨骼, 则会自动选用第一个没有父骨骼的骨骼",
  "quadratic": "二次的",
  "Extract TX": "提取 TX",
  "Extract TY": "提取 TY",
  "Extract TZ": "提取时区信息",
  "Extract RZ": "提取 RZ",
  "Quadratic": "二次方",
  "Extract Initial Offset": "提取初始偏移量",
  "If set, the offset of the extracted motion channels from the origin is removed and stored as a queryable value on the animation": "若勾选此项, 提取出的动作通道相对于原点的偏移量将被移除, 并作为可查询的数值保存在动画中",
  "Motion Type": "动画类型",
  "Specify the motion type.  Choices are as follows: <br><b>Single</b>: Extract motion from the first frame of the animation.<br><b>Uniform</b>: Extract motion from every frame in the animation.<br><b>Specified</b>: Specify the frame ranges with which to extract motion.<br>": "请指定运动类型. 可选选项如下: <br><b>单一帧</b>: 从动画的第一帧提取运动信息. <br><b>全部帧</b>: 从动画的每一帧提取运动信息. <br><b>指定帧范围</b>: 自行指定需要提取运动信息的帧范围. <br>",
  "Set Initial Values For Extract Motion Node": "设置提取动作节点的初始值",
  "Posture": "姿势",
  "Gesture": "手势",
  "exit": "退出",
  "Type of faceposer keys, Gesture or Posture": "面部动画关键帧的类型: 手势或姿势",
  "InFrame frame, also called \"apex\" and \"in\", can be aliased via \"entrytag\" in sequence KV": "InFrame帧, 亦称'apex'或'in', 可通过序列KV中的'entrytag'来设置别名",
  "Accent": "口音/语音特征",
  "Accent frame of the gesture/posture, unused": "手势/姿势的强调框架, 目前未使用",
  "Start Loop": "开始循环",
  "Frame where looping starts, also called \"loop\", can be aliased via \"startloop\" in sequence KV": "循环开始的帧, 亦称'loop'; 在序列 KV 中也可通过'startloop'来定义",
  "End Loop": "结束循环",
  "Frame where looping ends, also called \"endloop\" and \"end\", can be aliased via \"endloop\" in sequence KV": "循环结束的帧, 也称为'endloop'或'end'; 在序列配置中可通过'endloop'来设置别名",
  "Exit": "退出",
  "Frame where looping ends, also called \"end\" and \"out\", can be aliased via \"exittags\" in sequence KV": "循环结束的帧, 也称为'end'或'out', 可通过序列 KV 中的 'exittags' 设置别名",
  "Thumbnail": "缩略图",
  "Frame to be used at the thumbnail pose in Faceposer": "在 Faceposer 中用于缩略图姿态的帧",
  "Base class for nodes which can be children of FaceposerMarkupBase derived nodes": "可作为 FaceposerMarkupBase 派生节点子节点的节点的基类",
  "Faceposer folder name": "面部表情编辑器文件夹名称",
  "Faceposer Folder Name": "面部表情文件夹名称",
  "Group of nodes for organizational purposes.": "用于组织管理的节点组. ",
  "Pick the source geo cache file": "选择源地理缓存文件",
  "Perlin": "佩林",
  "Two Bone": "双骨骼",
  "Dog Leg (3-Bone)": "犬腿肉(含3根骨头) (3-Bone)",
  "Match Target Orientation": "匹配目标方向",
  "Match Target Forward Only": "仅向前匹配目标",
  "Maintain Parent Orientation": "保持父级方向",
  "Animgraph Parameter": "动画图参数",
  "X (Red   / Forward)": "退出(红色 / 前进)",
  "Y (Green / Left)": "是(绿色/左侧)",
  "Z (Blue  / Up)": "Z(蓝色 / 向上)",
  "An IK chain describes a section of a model that you want to control procedurally.": "IK链用于描述模型中需要按程序化方式控制的部分. ",
  "End Effector Offset Attachment": "末端执行器偏移量调节装置",
  "+Chain Settings": "+链式设置",
  "An offset to use for positioning the chain.  Optional.": "用于定位链路的偏移量. 此项为可选参数. ",
  "Parent of Chain Requires Alignment": "链的父级需要对齐",
  "By default, any change to the chain position will be reflected in parent's rotation.  Uncheck this if you wish the parent to be left unmodified.": "默认情况下, 对链中位置的任何更改都会反映到父级对象的旋转设置上. 如果您希望保持父级对象不变, 请取消勾选此选项. ",
  "Use Pole Vector for Axis": "使用极向量来确定轴向",
  "For solvers that require a pole vector, this sets it relative to the local space of the node being solved.  False uses the old-style runtime calculation that should be avoided (if this works...).": "对于需要极向量的求解器而言, 此选项用于设定该向量相对于正在被求解节点的本地空间的位置. 若设为'False', 则会使用旧式的运行时计算方式, 但这种方式应避免使用(前提是该方法能正常工作……). ",
  "Pole Vector for Axis": "轴向极向量",
  "For solvers that require a pole vector, what local space X/Y/Z should it use?": "对于需要极向量的求解器, 应使用哪个局部空间中的 X/Y/Z 轴呢?",
  "Solver Type": "求解器类型",
  "+Default Solver Settings": "+默认求解器设置",
  "Which solver to use for positioning the IK chain.  Required.": "用于确定IK链位置的解算器. 此为必填项. ",
  "Num Iterations": "迭代次数",
  "How many iterations this solvers hould use.": "此求解器应执行的迭代次数. ",
  "End Effector Rotation Fix Behaviour": "末端执行器旋转修正行为",
  "How the end effector should be rotated after the solve.": "求解完成后末端执行器应如何旋转. ",
  "Target Source": "目标源",
  "+Default Target Settings": "+默认目标设置",
  "The default target source to use.  Animgraph will let you override this on a per node basis.": "默认使用的目标源. Animgraph 允许您为每个节点单独设置不同的值. ",
  "The target bone to use.  Animgraph will let you override this on a per node basis.": "要使用的目标骨骼. Animgraph 允许您针对每个节点单独设置该值. ",
  "Not enough joints for an IK chain of this default solver type (found %d, expected at least %d)": "此默认求解器类型所需的关节数量不足(实际找到 %d 个, 但至少需要 %d 个)",
  "Invalid bone specified for default target settings.": "为默认目标设置指定的骨骼无效. ",
  "An individual joint in an IK chain.": "IK链条中的一个关节. ",
  "All data pertaining to IK.": "所有与IK相关的数据. ",
  "A joint constraint depicting a hinge: i.e., two bones locked against a plane, with a min/max angle.": "一种模拟铰链式连接的关节约束: 即两个骨骼被限制在某一平面内运动, 且运动角度存在最小值与最大值. ",
  "Minimum Degrees": "最低度数",
  "The minimum degrees for this hinge constraint.": "此铰链约束的最小角度值. ",
  "Maximum Degrees": "最大角度",
  "The maximum degrees for this hinge constraint.": "此铰链约束的最大旋转角度. ",
  "Constrained Joint": "受限联合模式",
  "The joint we're constraining.": "我们正在限制移动的关节. ",
  "Hinge Axis": "铰链轴",
  "The local hinge axis for this constraint.": "此约束的局部铰链轴. ",
  "A joint constraint that forces bones to end up on one side of a plane.": "一种关节约束, 可强制骨骼位于平面的同一侧. ",
  "Local Angles": "本地角度",
  "Local Position": "本地位置",
  "Rigid": "固定不变",
  "Flexible": "灵活多变",
  "Neither": "两者都不是",
  "Jiggle bone. Implemented through cloth.": "抖动骨骼. 通过布料模拟来实现. ",
  "Jiggle Root Bone": "抖动根骨骼",
  "Jiggle Type": "抖动类型",
  "Has Yaw Constraint": "启用偏航约束",
  "Has Pitch Constraint": "启用了音高限制",
  "Has Angle Constraint": "是否包含角度限制",
  "Has Base Spring": "包含基础弹簧",
  "Allow Flex Length": "允许灵活调整长度",
  "Invert Axes": "反转坐标轴",
