  "Material Filter": "材料筛选",
  "Ignore faces whose material matches this substring.": "忽略材质名称中包含此子字符串的面. ",
  "Texture Generator Preview": "纹理生成器预览",
  "TextureGenerator cannot build a relative output file without a starting path.": "TextureGenerator 缺少起始路径, 因此无法生成相对路径的输出文件. ",
  "TextureGenerator output filename is empty.": "纹理生成器输出文件名为空. ",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to find the CONTENT path.": "TextureGenerator 无法找到 CONTENT 路径. ",
  "Filename %s specifies extension '%s', but this node will generate a '%s'. You can specify output filename without an extension, or use '%s'": "文件名 %s 指定的扩展名为'%s', 但此节点将生成'%s'格式的文件. 您可以指定不带扩展名的输出文件名, 或者使用'%s'作为扩展名",
  "TextureGenerator invalid output filename: %s": "纹理生成器: 无效的输出文件名: %s",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to build the target output path: %s": "纹理生成器无法创建目标输出路径: %s",
  "TextureGenerator requires a valid mesh node.": "TextureGenerator 需要一个有效的网格节点. ",
  "TextureGenerator failed to locate mesh named '%s'.": "纹理生成器无法找到名为'%s'的网格. ",
  "TextureGenerator does not handle multi-mesh nodes": "TextureGenerator 无法处理包含多个网格的节点",
  "TextureGenerator empty or invalid mesh set.": "纹理生成器: 网格集为空或无效. ",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to load the generator material.": "TextureGenerator 无法加载生成器材质. ",
  "TextureGenerator material missing mode %s": "纹理生成器: 材质缺失模式 %s",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to initialize the output render target.": "TextureGenerator 无法初始化输出渲染目标. ",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to validate the output render target.": "纹理生成器无法验证输出渲染目标. ",
  "TextureGenerator material mode %s has no renderable passes.": "纹理生成器材质模式 %s 下没有可渲染的通道. ",
  "TextureGenerator ReadTexturePixels failure.": "纹理生成器: 读取纹理像素失败. ",
  "Generates a texture that represents a model's object-space surface in UV-space, effectively a UV-to-object-space lookup table.": "生成一张纹理图, 该图将模型在对象空间中的表面映射至UV空间, 实际上就是一个从UV空间到对象空间的查找表. ",
  "Edge Dilation": "边缘扩张",
  "Dilate pixels at UV island edges.": "扩展UV岛边缘处的像素. ",
  "TextureGenerator model vertex extents are invalid.": "TextureGenerator 模型的顶点范围无效. ",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to generate a pixel position map.": "纹理生成器无法生成像素位置映射表. ",
  "TextureGenerator was unable to write to %s": "纹理生成器无法写入到 %s",
  "Generates an object-space normal map.": "生成对象空间法线贴图. ",
  "Specify a tangent-space normal map (source texture) that will contribute to the object-space output.": "请指定一个切线空间法线贴图(源纹理), 该贴图将用于生成对象空间下的法线贴图. ",
  "Internal Render Resolution": "内部渲染分辨率",
  "Render internally at this size for effective super-sampling.": "在此尺寸下进行内部渲染以实现高效的超级采样. ",
