  "Computed Cavity Map for %i pixels in %.3f (%i pixels per job, %i total traces)": "已为 %i 个像素计算出腔体映射, 耗时 %.3f 秒(每个任务处理 %i 个像素, 共执行了 %i 次追踪)",
  "Generates a texture with white values representing more convex local surface topology, and black values representing more concave local surface topology.": "生成的纹理中, 白色像素值表示局部表面较为凸起, 黑色像素值则表示局部表面较为凹陷. ",
  "Sample Count": "样本数量",
  "Number of samples per pixel.": "每个像素的采样次数. ",
  "Surface Offset": "表面偏移",
  "Offset the centroid of the sample position from the surface by this amount.": "将样本位置的质心相对于表面偏移此数值. ",
  "Trace Distance": "追踪距离",
  "Radius of surface sample ray traces.": "表面采样光线追踪的半径. ",
  "Remap Min": "重新映射最小值",
  "Remap the trace result value relative to this range.": "在此范围内重新映射跟踪结果值. ",
  "Remap Max": "重新映射最大值",
  "Ambient Occlusion Map": "环境光遮蔽贴图",
  "Specify an ambient occlusion map (source texture) to multiply over the generated cavity map.": "请指定一个环境光遮蔽贴图(源纹理), 该贴图将与生成的凹痕贴图相乘. ",
  "Ambient Occlusion Map Power": "环境光遮蔽贴图强度",
  "Power scale for applying the supplemental ambient occlusion map.": "用于应用补充性环境光遮蔽贴图的强度值. ",
  "TextureGenerator failed to load %s": "纹理生成器无法加载 %s",
  "Position map produced zero ray trace start positions. There might be no UVs in 0-1 space?": "位置贴图未能生成任何光线追踪起始点. 有可能是 0-1 坐标空间内不存在 UV 信息?",
  "Computed PointOcclusionMap for %i pixels in %.3f (%i pixels per job, %i total traces)": "已为 %i 个像素计算出 PointOcclusionMap, 耗时 %.3f 秒(每个任务处理 %i 个像素, 共进行了 %i 次追踪)",
  "Generates a texture indicating per-pixel occlusion from a point source.": "生成一张纹理图, 用于显示从某个点光源出发的逐像素遮挡情况. ",
  "Brightness": "亮度",
  "How much to consider facing angle in occlusion.": "在遮挡处理中, 视角因素的考量程度如何?. ",
