  "A list of mutually-exclusive materials (skins) that the game can dynamically select between.": "游戏可动态从中挑选的互斥材质(皮肤)列表. ",
  "New material group name:": "新建材料组名称: ",
  "Specifies the materials that the model will render with by default. (Allows overriding the materials inferred from the source FBX/DMX file.)": "指定模型默认使用的材质. (可覆盖从源 FBX/DMX 文件中推断出的材质. )",
  "Replace materials on an input mesh": "替换输入网格上的材质",
  "Controls the order of the draw calls for this mesh by specifying the order of materials for each draw call the mesh.Only the materials on the original mesh need to be specified, any materials no on the mesh will have no effect.": "通过指定每个绘制调用中所使用的材质顺序, 可控制该网格的绘制调用顺序. 只需指定原始网格上存在的材质即可, 未出现在网格上的材质则不会产生任何影响. ",
  "Draw Order": "绘制顺序",
  "List of meshes": "网格列表",
  "Add to Selection": "添加到选择列表",
  "Components are added to the existing selection.": "组件将被添加到当前选中的列表中. ",
  "Subtract from Selection": "从选定内容中减去",
  "Components are subtracted from the existing selection.": "组件会从当前选中的内容中移除. ",
