  "Offset selected face UV coordinates.": "偏移所选面的UV坐标. ",
  "Absolute mode sets UV coordinates exactly. Relative(default) offsets them relative to where they currently already are.": "绝对模式会精确设置UV坐标. 相对模式(默认)则会在现有坐标的基础上进行偏移. ",
