  "Incoming face vertex selection was empty.": "接收到的面部顶点选择数据为空. ",
  "Select Faces With Overlapping UVs": "选择UV重叠的面",
  "Selects faces whose UVs overlap. Note that neighboring faces are not considered overlapping, and there is a minor tolerance to this check.": "选择UV坐标发生重叠的面. 请注意, 相邻的面并不被视为重叠, 且此检测过程存在一定的容差. ",
