  "Selection Assertion": "选择断言",
  "Asserts (fails compilation) if selection criteria is not met.": "若未满足选择条件, 则会触发断言(导致编译失败). ",
  "Check Vertex Selection": "检查顶点选择状态",
  "Check Edge Selection": "检查边缘选择",
  "Check Face Selection": "检查面部选择",
  "Fail on empty": "为空时失败",
  "By default, empty selection is the failure case. Set this to false to make having not-empty selection be a failure case.": "默认情况下, 未选中任何内容被视为失败情况. 将此选项设为 false 后, 只要选中了内容即被视为失败情况. ",
  "Error (not warn)": "错误(非警告) (not warn)",
  "If set, considers failure cases to be errors. Failures are warnings by default.": "启用后, 系统会将失败情况视为错误. 默认情况下失败情况仅作为警告处理. ",
  "This MeshOpSelectionAssertion isn't checking anything.": "此 MeshOpSelectionAssertion 并未执行任何检查. ",
  "Selection Assertion Failed: Vertex selection should %sbe empty.": "选择验证失败: 顶点选择列表应当 %s为空. ",
  "Selection Assertion Failed: Edge selection should %sbe empty.": "选择验证失败: 边缘选择列表应当 %s为空. ",
  "Selection Assertion Failed: Face selection should %sbe empty.": "选择验证失败: 面选择内容应该%s为空. ",
  "Loads an external mesh file and transfers its morph data (blend shapes) onto the parent mesh using a wrap deformer. The MeshOpStack vertex selection controls which vertices are affected when transferring morph deltas.": "加载外部网格文件, 并通过包裹变形器将其变形数据(混合形状)传递至父网格. 通过 MeshOpStack 的顶点选择功能, 可指定在传递变形数据时受影响的顶点. ",
  "The mesh file containing morph data to transfer onto the parent mesh": "包含要转移到父网格上的变形数据的网格文件",
  "Selection Mode": "选择模式",
  "Controls how the mesh op vertex selection is applied during morph transfer": "控制在形态变换过程中, 网格顶点选择方式如何应用",
  "No source file specified for TransferMorphs": "未指定用于 TransferMorphs 的源文件",
  "Unable to get loader utils": "无法获取加载器工具",
  "Failed to load source file '%s'": "无法加载源文件'%s'",
