  "No meshes found in source file '%s'": "在源文件'%s'中未找到任何网格数据",
  "No morph data to transfer from specified mesh": "没有可从指定网格传输的变形数据",
  "Failed to transfer deltas from '%s'": "无法从'%s'传输增量数据",
  "A transform which was the parent of a mesh without explicit skinning defined in the source geometry file": "一种变换节点, 曾是某个网格的父节点, 但该网格在源几何文件中并未定义显式的蒙皮信息",
  "Child Mesh Name": "子网格名称",
  "The name of the unskinned child mesh of this transform in the source geometry file.": "源几何文件中, 与此变换关联的未应用蒙皮的子网格的名称. ",
  "Find and replace in resource references across the document (NOTE: Some references like materialgroups may be missed with the current implementation.)": "在文档中搜索并替换资源引用内容(注意: 目前的实现方式可能会遗漏某些引用, 例如 materialgroups)",
  "Find String": "查找字符串",
