  "Optional pattern for attribute names (* for wildcards.) Note that this matches against non-display (ie. raw view) attribute names.": "属性名称的可选模式(* 表示通配符). 请注意, 该模式是针对非显示状态下的属性名称进行匹配的. ",
  "Rename the specified bone replacing all references to the original bone name with the new bone name.": "重命名指定的骨骼, 并将所有原骨骼名称的引用替换为新骨骼名称. ",
