  "Error if Not Found": "未找到时显示错误",
  "Should it be considered an error if this bone isn't found to rename?": "如果找不到需要重命名的骨骼, 这应被视为错误吗?",
  "'%s' -> '%s'": "'%s' -> '%s'",
  "New bone name cannot be empty": "新骨骼名称不能为空",
  "Original bone name cannot be empty": "原始骨骼名称不能为空",
  "Bone names must differ": "骨骼名称必须互不相同",
  "Could not find bone with name '%s' or '%s'": "无法找到名为'%s'或'%s'的骨骼",
