  "Unable to rename bone from '%s' to '%s', %s[%s] failed to apply bone rename": "无法将骨骼名称从'%s'重命名为'%s', %s[%s] 未能成功应用骨骼重命名操作",
  "Translate the overall model by the specified vector.": "按照指定的向量对整个模型进行平移. ",
  "Removes all morph data from the compiled model.": "移除编译后模型中的所有变形数据. ",
  "Copy skinning information from one rendermesh to another, based on a simple heuristic.": "根据简单的启发式规则, 将一个渲染网格的蒙皮信息复制到另一个渲染网格. ",
