  "Failed to find dest node '%s'": "未能找到目标节点'%s'",
  "Source and dest cannot be the same": "源路径与目标路径不能相同",
  "Source node has no mesh data": "源节点未包含任何网格数据",
  "Dest node has no mesh data": "目标节点不包含任何网格数据",
  "Generate decal UVs on the specified channel": "在指定的通道上生成贴图UV",
  "Channel Name": "频道名称",
  "Material Property": "材质属性",
  "Foliage-specific vertex normal modification.": "仅针对植被的顶点法线修改. ",
  "Project From Primitive": "从原始数据创建项目",
  "Smooth By Distance": "按距离平滑处理",
  "Override Vector": "覆盖向量",
  "Sphere": "球体",
  "Capsule": "胶囊",
  "Modification Amount": "修改金额",
  "Amount to modify vertex normals (0-none, 1-completely)": "用于修改顶点法线的值(0-不修改, 1-完全修改)",
  "Write Separate Vertex Stream": "写入独立的顶点流",
  "If enabled writes the modified normals into a separate vertex stream to be used by the shader. Otherwise modifies meshes original normals.": "启用后, 系统会将修改后的法线数据写入独立的顶点流中供着色器使用; 否则将直接修改网格原有的法线数据. ",
  "Operator": "操作员",
  "Operator to be used to set vertex normals": "用于设置顶点法线的操作符",
  "Smooth Distance": "平滑距离",
  "Average vertex normals over given distance to point away from neighbors.": "在指定距离内对顶点法线进行平均处理, 使其方向背离相邻顶点. ",
  "Projected Primitive": "预测原始对象",
  "Primitive type to project vertex normals from.": "用于投影顶点法线的原始类型. ",
  "Primitive Position": "原始位置",
  "Position of the primitive to project normals from.": "法线投射源的图元位置. ",
  "Primitive Height": "原始高度",
  "Height of the primitive to project normals from.": "用于投影法线的图元的高度. ",
  "Primitive Radius": "原始半径",
  "Radius of the primitive to project normals from.": "用于投影法线的图元半径. ",
  "Override all mesh normals with a specific vector.": "使用指定向量来覆盖所有网格的法线. ",
  "Exclude meshes which have set materials assigned.": "排除已指定材质的网格. ",
  "CModelDocModelModifier_FoliageVertexNormals: Computing...": "CModelDocModelModifier_FoliageVertexNormals: 正在计算...",
  "CModelDocModelModifier_FoliageVertexNormals: Mesh %d/%d...": "CModelDocModelModifier_FoliageVertexNormals: 网格 %d/%d...",
  "Per-material sorting options. Normally used for transparency sorting.": "按材质排序选项. 通常用于透明度排序. ",
  "Mesh & Skeleton": "网格与骨骼",
  "Skeleton Only": "仅骨架",
  "[cloth] | [procedural]": "[布料] | [procedural]",
  "[procedural]": "[procedural]",
  "[anim]": "[anim]",
  "Content": "内容",
  "This model will fail to compile outside a development environment.": "该模型在开发环境之外将无法编译. ",
  "This is Work-In-Progress Content": "此为正在开发中的内容",
  "Safeguard against producing a model outside budgetary limits.": "防止生成超出预算范围的模型. ",
  "Max vertex count of LOD0": "LOD0的最大顶点数量",
  "Max triangle count of LOD0": "LOD0的最大三角形数量",
  "Max total vertex count (all LODs)": "最大顶点总数(所有LOD级别) (all LODs)",
  "Max total triangle count (all LODs)": "最大三角形总数(所有LOD级别) (all LODs)",
  "Max number of LODs": "最大 LOD 数量",
  "Max MaterialGroup count": "最大材质组数量",
  "Max BodyGroup count": "最大身体部件数量",
  "Max Bone count": "最大骨骼数量",
  "Treat Warnings as Errors": "将警告视为错误",
  "Automatically export a representative FBX of this model next to the VMDL for reference purposes.": "自动在 VMDL 文件旁边导出该模型的一个典型 FBX 文件以供参考. ",
  "FBX filename suffix": "FBX文件名后缀",
  "Appended to output filename for example supplying '_reference' to 'mymodel.vmdl' will produce 'mymodel_reference.nocompile.fbx'": "添加到输出文件名末尾即可. 例如: 若在'mymodel.vmdl'后添加'_reference', 则会生成'mymodel_reference.nocompile.fbx'",
  "Export destination root": "导出目标根目录",
  "Export into the GAME or CONTENT root.": "导出到 GAME 或 CONTENT 根目录. ",
  "Export Type": "导出类型",
  "Type of data to export.  Note that skeleton can only be filtered if type is skeleton only": "要导出的数据类型. 请注意: 只有当类型选择为'仅骨架'时, 才能对骨架进行筛选",
  "Inverse ModelDoc Scale": "反向模型文档缩放",
  "Applies the inverse scale of a ModelDoc_ScaleAndMirror scale value if true.  Note that only applies if type is skeleton only": "若设置为真, 则使用 ModelDoc_ScaleAndMirror 中设定比例值的倒数. 请注意: 此设置仅在类型为骨架类型时才生效",
  "Exclude Bones With Flags": "排除带有标记的骨骼",
  "Bones which have the specified flags are excluded from skeleton only exports.  The bones can have other flags as well.": "带有指定标志的骨骼不会被包含在仅导出骨骼的数据中. 这些骨骼也可以拥有其他标志. ",
  "Exclude Bones With Exact Flags": "排除具有指定标志的骨骼",
  "Bones which have the specified flags exactly, i.e. no other flags set, are excluded from skeleton only exports.": "仅当骨骼设置了指定的标志且未设置其他任何标志时, 该骨骼才会被排除在仅用于导出骨架的操作之外. ",
  "Set specific model flags.  This node is rarely used": "设置特定的模型标志. 此节点很少被使用",
  "No Forced Fade": "无强制淡化效果",
  "Disable global fade for the entity using this model, if the entity supports it.": "如果实体支持该功能, 则禁用对此模型所用实体的全局淡入淡出效果. ",
  "Do Not Cast Shadows": "禁止投射阴影",
  "If the entity using this model derives from BaseAnimating will AddEffects( EF_SHADOW ) to the entity on spawn": "如果使用该模型的实体继承自 BaseAnimating, 则该实体在生成时会自动调用 AddEffects( EF_SHADOW )",
  "Keep Vertices In Memory": "在内存中保留顶点",
  "When this model is loaded preserve vertex data in CPU memory.": "加载此模型时, 请将顶点数据保留在 CPU 内存中. ",
  "Apply a scale to the entire model": "对整个模型应用缩放比例",
  "Uniform scale factor to apply to the model": "应用于模型的统一缩放系数",
  "Mirror X": "镜像 X",
  "Mirror the model across the x-axis": "沿X轴镜像模型",
  "Mirror Y": "垂直镜像",
  "Mirror the model across the y-axis": "沿Y轴镜像模型",
  "Mirror Z": "镜像 Z",
  "Mirror the model across the z-axis": "沿 Z 轴镜像模型",
  "Flip Bone Forward": "向前翻转骨骼",
  "Flip the forward (x) axis direction of bones": "翻转骨骼的向前(X)轴方向",
  "Swap Left And Right Bones": "交换左右骨骼",
  "Swap left and right bone names": "交换左右骨骼名称",
  "Delayed": "已延迟",
  "A shape which is applied as a corrective shape when the referenced shapes are active, referenced shapes are separated by double underscores, i.e. '__'": "此形状会在被引用的形状处于激活状态时作为修正形状使用; 多个被引用形状之间以双下划线'__'分隔",
  "Morph Shape": "变形形状",
  "Two morph controls which should be grouped into a single control": "两个变形控制项, 应将其合并为一个控制项",
  "Min Morph Shape": "最小变形形状",
  "Max Morph Shape": "最大变形形状",
  "A morph control which should be split into right_ and left_ stereo controls if a balance map is present": "该变形控件: 若存在平衡度映射表, 则应被拆分为右声道与左声道两个立体声控件",
  "Morph Control": "形态控制",
  "The Morph Shape For This Incremental Morph": "此次渐进式变形所使用的变形形状",
  "Peak": "峰值",
  "The Peak Value For This Incremental Morph Shape": "此递增变形形状的峰值",
  "A morph control which controls a set of weighted shapes": "一种用于控制一组带权重形状的变形控件",
  "Shapes": "形状",
  "Shapes controlled by this incremental control": "由此增量控件控制的形状",
  "Invalid Peak %.2g for Incremental Shape \"%s\", valid range [0.0, 1.0]": "无效的峰值值 %.2g, 适用于递增形状'%s', 有效范围应为 [0.0, 1.0]",
  "Incremental Shapes \"%s\" & \"%s\" cannot have the same Peak value %.2g": "增量形状'%s'和'%s'的峰值值不能相同, 当前值为 %.2g",
  "A morph dominator": "形态操控大师",
  "Suppressed Shapes": "已隐藏的形状",
  "Shapes suppressed when this shape is active": "此形状处于激活状态时, 其他形状将被隐藏",
  "Input morph params": "输入变形参数",
  "Disable Morph": "禁用形态变换",
  "If true, morph data from this mesh is ignored by the compiler and won't be part of the resulting compiled model.": "如果设为 true, 则此网格的变形数据将被编译器忽略, 不会出现在最终编译生成的模型中. ",
  "Include Speed": "包含速度",
  "If true, and speed vertex map values exists, include them in the resulting morph data.": "若此值设为 true 且存在速度顶点映射值, 则将其纳入生成的变形数据中. ",
  "Include Wrinkle": "包含皱纹",
  "If true, and wrinkle vertex map values exists, include them in the resulting morph data.": "若此值为真且存在皱纹顶点贴图值, 则将其纳入生成的变形数据中. ",
  "Best Fit Atlas": "最佳匹配图集",
  "If true, try to pack the morph data into the smallest texture size during compile.  This is a slow operation.": "如果设为 true, 编译时会尝试将变形数据打包到尺寸最小的纹理中. 该操作耗时较长. ",
  "Width Target": "宽度目标值",
  "Set the target width for the morph texture.  It will automatically grow if necessary.  This is the starting size for the best fit atlas algorithm, setting it close to the best atlas size will speed up compilation if best fit atlas is true.": "设置变形纹理的目标宽度. 必要时它会自动增大. 该值作为'最佳适配图集'算法的初始尺寸; 如果启用了'最佳适配图集'功能, 将此值设为接近最佳图集尺寸可加快编译速度. ",
  "Height Target": "高度目标值",
  "Set the target height for the morph texture.  It will automatically grow if necessary.  This is the starting size for the best fit atlas algorithm, setting it close to the best atlas size will speed up compilation if best fit atlas is true.": "设置变形纹理的目标高度. 如有需要, 该高度会自动增加. 这是'最佳适配图集算法'的起始尺寸; 如果启用了该算法, 将目标高度设为接近最佳图集尺寸可加快编译速度. ",
  "Cut Min": "剪切最小值",
  "Cut Max": "剪切最大值",
  "Viewing PhysicsFile: %s": "正在查看物理文件: %s",
  "Viewing %s: (%i inputs)": "正在查看 %s: (%i 个输入项)",
  "Viewing %s: (all inputs)": "正在查看 %s: (所有输入) (all inputs)",
  "Quadric Error Metric": "四次误差度量",
  "Incremental Vertex Reduction": "渐进式顶点简化",
  "Incremental Face Reduction": "渐进式人脸精简功能",
  "Exact": "精准",
  "Don't remove verts/faces/edges unless there are > 256": "除非顶点/面/边的数量超过256, 否则请勿删除它们",
  "Automatically builds a physics hull from render geometry.": "自动根据渲染几何体生成物理外壳. ",
  "Face Merge Angle": "面部融合角度",
  "Max Vertices Per Hull": "每个外壳的最大顶点数",
  "Optimization Algorithm": "优化算法",
  "Expand point with eight additional vertices in a box shape.": "扩展为包含八个额外顶点的方形点. ",
  "Tetrahedron": "四面体",
  "Expand point with six additional vertices in a tetrahedron shape.": "展开该点, 使其生成六个呈四面体排列的额外顶点. ",
  "Point is a single vertex.": "点即单个顶点. ",
  "Automatically builds a physics hull from user-specified points": "根据用户指定的点自动生成物理外壳",
  "Place these under a PhysicsHullFromPoints node to build a custom-shaped hull from scratch, or place under a PhysicsHullFile node to modify an existing hull.": "将此节点置于 PhysicsHullFromPoints 节点下, 即可从零开始创建自定义形状的 Hull; 也可将其置于 PhysicsHullFile 节点下, 用以修改现有的 Hull. ",
  "Point Type": "点类型",
  "This PhysicsHullPoint will be ignored because its parent PhysicsHullFile is not in single-hull mode.": "此 PhysicsHullPoint 将被忽略, 因为其父级 PhysicsHullFile 并未处于单外壳模式. ",
  "Reference to a file containing one or more meshes to be converted to a convex hull.": "指向一个包含一个或多个待转换为凸包的网格文件的引用. ",
  "Import Mode": "导入模式",
  "Small Element Threshold": "小元素阈值",
  "Thin Element Threshold": "细元素阈值",
  "Disable Region SVM": "禁用区域 SVM",
  "Disable building a Region SVM for this model. Disabling this will save memory and disk space, but reduce the performance of sphere traces against the model.": "禁用为该模型构建区域 SVM. 禁用此功能可节省内存与磁盘空间, 但会降低基于该模型的球体追踪性能. ",
  "Ignoring invalid hull with %i vertices: %s": "正在忽略包含 %i个顶点的无效外壳: %s",
  "Hull Too Complex for Runtime (%d verts, %d edges, %d faces)": "网格结构过于复杂, 无法在运行时处理(%d个顶点, %d条边, %d个面)",
  "Max Vertices Per Mesh": "每个网格的最大顶点数",
  "Simplify (Qem Error)": "简化(QEM错误) (Qem Error)",
  "Reference to file which contains one or meshes to be used a physics mesh.": "引用的文件内含一个或多个需用作物理网格的网格数据. ",
  "Simplification Params": "简化参数",
  "Removed %d verts from %d meshes": "已从 %d 个网格中移除 %d 个顶点",
  "Viewing PhysicsMeshFile: %s": "正在查看物理网格文件: %s",
  "Automatically builds a physics mesh from render geometry.": "自动根据渲染几何体生成物理网格. ",
  "Removed %d verts from meshes": "已从网格中移除 %d个顶点",
  "Specify which specific shapes belong to this detail layer(s)<br><br><em>(NOTE: All other shapes will <strong>NOT</strong> belong to these detail layers unless explicitly included)</em>": "请指定哪些特定的形状属于此细节图层<br><br><em>注意: 除非明确包含, 否则所有其他形状<strong>均不属于</strong>这些细节图层</em>",
  "Detail Layer": "详情图层",
  "This detail layer will only include the specified shapes.<br><br><em>(NOTE: Unspecified shapes will be removed from these detail layers automatically. Use 'PhysicsDetailLayerOverride' for more control. )</em>": "此细节图层仅会包含指定的形状. <br><br><em>(注意: 未指定的形状会自动从这些细节图层中移除. 如需更细致的控制, 请使用 'PhysicsDetailLayerOverride'. )</em>",
  "These shapes will be included in the given detail layer": "这些形状将被包含在给定的细节图层中",
  "Allow Empty Detail Layer": "允许空详情图层",
  "If there are 0 shapes in this detail layer at this is enabled, entities targeting this detail layer will not collide with the model at all<br><br><em>(NOTE: This will cause clipping and is probably not what you want )</em>": "如果启用了此选项, 且该细节图层中没有任何形状, 那么所有以该图层为目标的实体都不会与模型发生碰撞. <br><br><em>(注意: 此举可能导致模型出现剪裁现象, 通常并非您期望的效果. )</em>",
  "Explicitly define what detail layers specific shapes should/shouldn't belong to": "明确指定特定形状应归属于哪些细节图层, 或不应归属于哪些细节图层",
  "These shapes will be assigned the given detail layers": "这些形状将被分配指定的细节图层",
  "These detail layers will only include the specified shapes.<br><br><em>(NOTE: This will also remove other shapes from these detail layers unless 'Is Exclusive' is unchecked )</em>": "这些细节图层将仅包含指定的形状. <br><br><em>(注意: 除非取消勾选'仅限指定形状', 否则此操作还会移除这些图层中的其他形状)</em>",
  "Included Detail Layers are Exclusive": "包含的详细图层具有排他性",
  "Shapes not on this node will not be part of the detail layer automatically<br><br><em>(NOTE: PhysicsDetailLayer always enables this )</em>": "未位于此节点上的形状不会自动成为细节图层的组成部分<br><br><em>(注意: PhysicsDetailLayer 始终会启用此功能)</em>",
  "These detail layers will NOT include the specified shapes.<br><br><em>(NOTE: The shapes will belong to all other non-exclusive detail layers, unless 'Included Detail Layers' is specified)</em>": "这些细节图层将不会包含指定的形状. <br><br><em>(注意: 除非指定了'包含的细节图层', 否则这些形状仍会属于所有其他非独占型细节图层)</em>",
  "Also Missing Exclusive Detail Layers": "缺少专属细节图层",
  "Shapes on this node will be missing any detail layers on the model not included on this node.": "此节点上的形状将缺失模型中未被包含在该节点内的所有细节图层. ",
  "Physics body markup data": "物理体标记数据",
  "Target Body": "目标主体",
  "Inertia Scale": "惯性缩放比例",
  "Linear Damping": "线性阻尼",
  "Angular Damping": "角阻尼",
  "Linear Drag": "线性拖拽",
