  "Disable Continuous Collision Detection": "禁用连续碰撞检测",
  "PhysicsBodyMarkup: %s": "物理体标记: %s",
  "Pick the target body:": "选择目标身体: ",
  "Duplicate target body (%s) specified in body markup.  Please fix.": "在正文标记中指定了重复的目标正文(%s). 请予以修正. ",
  "A physics hull which is a box.": "一个呈长方体形状的物理外壳. ",
