  "Wheel joint.": "轮式关节. ",
  "Enable Suspension Limit": "启用暂停限制",
  "Min Suspension Offset": "最小挂起偏移量",
  "Max Suspension Offset": "最大挂起偏移量",
  "Enable Steering Limit": "启用转向限制",
  "Min Steering Angle": "最小转向角度",
  "Max Steering Angle": "最大转向角度",
  "Spin Axis Friction": "旋转轴摩擦力",
  "Friction that resists motion about the spin axis. Ignored by drivable vehicles.": "阻碍绕旋转轴运动的摩擦力. 可操控的交通工具会忽略此摩擦力. ",
  "Loop": "循环",
  "New pose parameter name:": "新的姿势参数名称: ",
  "ModelDoc \"%s\" node incompatible with AnimGraph, use graph parameters in AnimGraph instead": "模型文档'%s'中的节点与 AnimGraph 不兼容, 请改用 AnimGraph 中的图表参数",
  "A reference to model prefab file whose contents will be merged with this document.": "指向模型预制体文件的引用, 该文件的内容将会被合并到当前文档中. ",
  "NO TARGET": "无目标",
  "Prefab [%s]": "预制体 [%s]",
  "Child of a prefab must be a clone of a source node": "预制体的子对象必须是源节点的克隆体",
  "Node is not a valid under the prefab's parent": "该节点作为预制体父级时无效",
  "Nodes belonging to a prefab in the Global Prefab List must be under a valid parent inside the prefab source.": "在全局预制体列表中, 属于某个预制体的节点必须置于该预制体源文件中的合法父节点下. ",
