  "Spawn particle meshes when this prop breaks. (Automatically creates a helper model with a bodygroup choice for each particle, a snapshot that positions them in the appropriate places, and a breakcommand that spawns a particlesystem driven by the model and vsnaps.)": "当该道具破碎时生成粒子网格. (系统会自动创建一个辅助模型, 为每个粒子设置相应的体型组选项; 还会生成快照以确定粒子的位置, 最后生成一条 breakcommand 指令来触发由该模型及快照控制的粒子系统. )",
