  "Wait For Completion": "等待完成",
  "Synchronous - Wait for this node to fully complete before proceeding.": "同步模式 - 等待此节点完全执行完毕后再继续. ",
  "Proceed Immediately": "立即执行",
  "Asynchronous - This node executes independently using a new Cursor. Formerly 'Fire and Forget'. Equivalent to scheduling using an additional 'Fire Child Cursors' node.": "异步模式 - 此节点会借助一个新的游标独立执行. 原名为'触发即忽略'. 其效果等同于通过额外的'触发子游标'节点来安排执行. ",
  "Keep running normally.": "继续正常运行. ",
  "Kill After.": "执行后终止. ",
  "Do not stop the current yielding node, but do not continue to the next node afterwards.": "请勿停止当前的产出节点, 但之后也不要继续处理下一个节点. ",
  "Kill Elegantly.": "优雅地终结吧. ",
  "Request elegant wind-down of any associated work (e.g. vcd interrupt).": "请优雅地终止所有相关操作(例如: 取消VCD中断). ",
  "Kill Immediately.": "立即终止. ",
  "Stop without any wind-down.": "直接停止, 无需任何过渡过程. ",
  "Proceed Elegantly.": "优雅地完成吧. ",
  "Request elegant wind-down of any associated work (e.g. vcd interrupt), then proceed afterwards.": "请有序结束所有相关工作(例如: 终止VCD中断), 然后再继续执行后续操作. ",
  "Proceed Immediately.": "立即执行. ",
