  "Parent VData": "父级 VData",
  "Begin testing a condition composed of Observable variable references. Continues checking until true.": "开始测试由可观察变量引用组成的条件. 该测试会持续进行直至结果为真. ",
  "Fired when the observable boolean is true, and killed when false.": "当可观察的布尔值变为真时触发, 变为假时停止. ",
  "While True": "始终如此",
  "Fired when the observable boolean is false, and killed when true.": "当可观察的布尔值为 false 时触发, 当值为 true 时终止. ",
  "While False": "为假时",
  "Monitor Observable": "监控可观测项",
  "While active, manage child cursors based on the results of a boolean condition. When the observable result changes, the prior cursor will be canceled and the appropriate outflow will fire a new child cursor. Will monitor continuously until externally canceled.": "启用后, 将根据布尔条件的结果来管理子游标. 当观测到的结果发生变化时, 原有的游标会被取消, 随后相应的输出流程会触发新的子游标. 该机制会持续监控直至被外部指令取消. ",
  "Begin testing a condition composed of Observable values. Continues checking until canceled.": "开始测试由可观察值组成的条件. 该测试会持续进行直至被取消. ",
  "Condition to evaluate when any of its dependent values change.": "当任何相关值发生变动时需进行评估的条件. ",
  "Observable": "可观察对象",
  "Wait Until": "等待至",
  "All values connected to this node must be 'observable'. Variables on this graph will be automatically promoted to observable. Other value nodes must take an explicit context, look for those nodes with a corresponding icon.": "与此节点关联的所有值都必须是'可观察的'. 此图表中的变量会自动被标记为可观察. 其他值节点则必须指定明确的上下文, 可寻找带有相应图标的节点来设置. ",
  "On True": "启用时",
  "Basic math support.": "基础数学运算支持. ",
  "Sine of angle. Input in radians, output in radians": "角度的正弦值. 输入值为弧度制, 输出结果也为弧度制",
  "Arc Sin": "反正弦",
  "Cosine of angle. Input in radians, output in radians": "角度的余弦值. 输入值为弧度值, 输出结果也为弧度值",
  "Arc Cos": "反余弦",
  "Tangent of angle. Input in radians, output in radians": "角度的正切值. 输入为弧度值, 输出也为弧度值",
  "Arc Tan": "反正切",
  "Deg2 Rad": "度转弧度",
  "Convert degrees (0-180) to radians (0-pi)": "将角度值(0-180)转换为弧度值(0-π) (0-pi)",
  "Rad2 Deg": "弧度转角度",
  "Convert radians (0-pi) to degrees (0-180)": "将弧度值(0 到 π)转换为角度值(0 到 180) (0-180)",
  "X to the Y power": "X的Y次方",
  "Min Float": "最小浮点数值",
  "Minimum of two values (float)": "至少需要两个数值(浮点数) (float)",
  "Min Int": "最小整数值",
  "Minimum of two values (int)": "至少需要两个整数值 (int)",
  "Max Float": "最大浮点数值",
  "Maximum of two values (float)": "最多可输入两个数值(浮点数) (float)",
  "Max Int": "最大整数值",
  "Maximum of two values (int)": "最多可输入两个整数值 (int)",
  "Clamp Float": "浮点数限制",
  "Clamp value to range (float)": "将数值限制在指定范围内(浮点数) (float)",
  "Clamp Int": "整数限制",
  "Clamp value to range (int)": "将值限制在指定范围内(整数) (int)",
  "Remap Clamped Float": "重新映射受限浮点数",
  "Remap and clamp input value from input range to output range (float)": "将输入值从输入范围重新映射到输出范围(浮点数) (float)",
  "Lerp Float": "浮点数插值",
  "Returns interpolated value between A and B based on frac 0.0 - 1.0 (float)": "根据范围值 frac(0.0 至 1.0 的浮点数)返回 A 与 B 之间的插值 (float)",
  "Lerp Vector": "向量插值",
  "Returns interpolated value between A and B based on frac 0.0 - 1.0 (vector)": "根据 0.0 至 1.0 之间的 frac 值, 返回 A 与 B 之间的插值结果(向量) (vector)",
  "Lerp World Vector": "插值世界坐标向量",
  "Returns interpolated value between A and B based on frac 0.0 - 1.0 (world vector)": "根据 0.0 至 1.0 之间的 frac 值, 返回 A 与 B 之间的插值结果(世界坐标向量) (world vector)",
  "Random World Position": "随机世界坐标",
  "Returns a random position centered on vCenter with random min and max radius": "返回以 vCenter 为中心、具有随机最小和最大半径的随机位置",
  "Abs Float": "绝对浮点数",
  "Absolute value (float)": "绝对值(浮点数) (float)",
  "Abs Int": "绝对整数",
  "Absolute value (int)": "绝对值(整数) (int)",
  "Integer Divide": "整数除法",
  "Integer division - unlike the divide (/) node, this will truncate any remainder (floor) and return an integer.": "整数除法 - 与除法 (/) 节点不同, 该操作会舍去余数(向下取整)并返回一个整数. ",
  "Round Float": "浮点数四舍五入",
  "Round - round float up or down to integer": "向上/向下取整 - 将浮点数向上或向下取整为整数",
  "Floor Float": "楼层浮点值",
  "Floor - round float down to nearest integer": "向下取整 - 将浮点数四舍五入为最接近的整数",
  "Ceiling Float": "ceiling浮动值",
  "Ceiling - round float up to nearest integer)": "向上取整 - 将浮点数向上圆整为最接近的整数",
  "Returns the constant pi (3.14...)": "返回圆周率常量(3.14...)",
  "Sqrt": "平方根",
  "Square root": "平方根",
  "R Sqrt": "平方根运算",
  "Reciprocoal square root (1/sqrt)": "倒数平方根(1/平方根)",
  "Sqr Float": "浮点数平方",
  "Sqr Int": "平方整数",
  "Frac": "分数",
  "Fractional component (ie. returns 0.34 for 12.34)": "小数部分(例如: 对于12.34, 返回值为0.34)",
  "Saturate": "饱和",
  "Saturate (clamps float between 0 and 1)": "饱和处理(将浮点数值限制在 0 到 1 之间) (clamps float between 0 and 1)",
  "Natural logarithm (base e)": "自然对数(以 e 为底数) (base e)",
  "Log2": "日志2",
  "Base-2 logarithm": "以2为底的对数",
  "Log10": "以10为底的对数",
  "Base-10 logarithm": "以10为底的对数",
  "Computes e ( 2.71...) raised to a power": "计算自然常数 e(2.71...)的指定次幂",
  "Computes 2 ( 2.71...) raised to a power": "计算 2 的 2.71... 次方",
  "Sign Float": "浮点数签名",
  "Returns -1.0 or 0.0 or 1.0 based on the sign of the argument": "根据参数的正负值返回 -1.0、0.0 或 1.0",
  "Sign Int": "有符号整数",
  "Returns -1 or 0 or 1 based on the sign of the argument": "根据参数的正负值返回 -1、0 或 1",
  "Is Valid Vector": "是否为有效向量",
  "Returns true if the Vector is valid": "如果该向量有效, 则返回 true",
  "Is Valid World Vector": "是否为有效的世界坐标向量",
  "Returns true if the World Vector is valid": "如果世界向量有效, 则返回 true",
  "Length Vector": "长度向量",
  "Length (magnitude) of Vector": "向量的长度(模)",
  "Length Vector2 D": "长度 Vector2 D",
  "Length (magnitude) of Vector2D": "Vector2D的长度(模值)",
  "Normalize Vector": "标准化向量",
  "Normalize Vector a": "归一化向量 a",
  "Cross Product Vector": "向量叉乘结果",
  "Cross Product of Vector a x Vector b": "向量 a 与向量 b 的叉乘",
  "Dot Product Vector": "点积向量",
  "Make Vector2 D": "将 Vector2 转换为 D",
  "Make a Vector2D from component parts.": "根据各分量生成 Vector2D. ",
  "Split Vector2 D": "拆分 Vector2 D",
  "Split a Vector2D into component parts.": "将 Vector2D 拆分为各个分量. ",
  "Make Vector": "生成矢量图",
  "Make a Vector from component parts.": "根据各个组成部分来创建向量. ",
  "Split Vector": "分割向量",
  "Split a Vector into component parts.": "将向量拆分为各个组成部分. ",
  "Make Vector4 D": "将 Vector4 设为 D",
  "Split Vector4 D": "拆分 Vector4 D",
  "Make World Vector": "生成世界向量",
  "Make a World Vector from component parts.": "从各个组成部分生成世界矢量. ",
  "Split World Vector": "分割世界矢量",
  "Split a World Vector into component parts.": "将世界坐标系向量拆分为各个分量. ",
  "Make Transform": "创建变换",
  "Make a Transform from component parts.": "根据各个组件部件来创建变换. ",
  "Split Transform": "拆分变换",
  "Split a Transform into component parts.": "将变换拆分为各个组成部分. ",
  "Make World Transform": "生成世界变换",
  "Split World Transform": "分割世界变换",
  "Make Color": "设置颜色",
  "Make a Color from component parts": "根据各组成部分合成颜色",
  "Split Color": "分割颜色",
  "Split a Color into component parts.": "将颜色拆分为各个组成成分. ",
  "Make Angle": "设置角度",
  "Make an Angle from component parts": "由多个组件组合成角度",
  "Split Angle": "分割角度",
  "Split an Angle into component parts.": "将角度拆分为各个组成部分. ",
  "Float To Game Time": "转换为游戏时间",
  "Convert from a raw floating-point time to a Game Time that will be saved/loaded appropriately": "将原始的浮点数时间转换为可正确保存/加载的游戏时间",
  "Game Time To Float": "游戏时长转为浮点数",
  "Convert from a Game Time a raw floating-point time that will NOT fixed up - use with caution!": "转换为游戏时间: 这是一种未经修正的原始浮点时间值, 请谨慎使用! ",
  "Vector To World Vector": "向量转世界坐标向量",
  "Convert from a local-space to a world-space vector": "将局部空间中的向量转换为世界空间中的向量",
  "World Vector To Vector": "世界坐标向量转换",
  "Convert from a world-space to local-space vector": "将世界空间中的向量转换为局部空间中的向量",
  "Make Angle From Forward Vector": "根据前向向量计算角度",
  "Make an Angle from a Forward Vector": "根据前向向量生成角度",
  "Make Vector From Angle": "根据角度生成向量",
  "Make a Vector from an Angle": "根据角度生成向量",
  "Basic string support.": "基本的字符串支持. ",
  "Strings Are Equal Case Sensitive": "字符串是否区分大小写",
  "Compare strings with case sensitivity, in contrast to normal string equality which is case-insensitive.": "与不区分大小写的常规字符串比较方式不同, 此方式会区分大小写来比较字符串. ",
  "String Length": "字符串长度",
  "Count the number of codepoints in the string (unicode-aware). If you want rendered glyphs, you probably want to consider using Panorama.": "统计字符串中代码点的数量(支持 Unicode). 若需要计算实际渲染出的字符数量, 建议考虑使用 Panorama. ",
  "Format Duration String From Seconds": "将秒数转换为 formatted 时长字符串",
  "Turn a time in seconds into a display string. NOT localized.": "将秒数转换为可显示的字符串. 此功能不进行本地化处理. ",
  "Pitch": "音高",
  "Roll": "滚动",
  "Choose Best": "选择最佳选项",
  "Process Selector": "进程选择器",
  "Choose the best outflow with all rules passing, as determined by number of passing rules (specificity).": "请选择符合所有规则且通过规则数量最多的流出路径(即特异性最高的路径). ",
  "Choose First": "选择第一个",
  "Choose the first outflow with all rules passing, from left to right": "请从左到右选择第一条满足所有规则的流出通道",
  "Select Best Exit": "选择最佳出口",
  "Evaluate the requirements of each connected node": "评估每个已连接节点的需求",
  "Limit Count": "数量限制",
  "Skip this node after the limit. Check Type does not apply, the limit will always be checked.": "超过限制后跳过此节点. 检查类型设置无效, 始终会进行限制检查. ",
  "Check Requirement": "检查要求",
  "Commit Step": "提交步骤",
  "Flow Node ID": "流程节点编号",
  "Pass Outflow": "传递流出",
  "Fail Outflow": "传输失败",
  "Check Type": "检查类型",
  "Outflow List": "流出列表",
  "Array Count": "数组元素数量",
  "Return the number of elements in the array.": "返回数组中元素的数量. ",
  "Array Set Count": "数组元素数量设置",
  "Set the number of elements in the array.": "设置数组中元素的数量. ",
  "Array First N Elements": "数组前N个元素",
  "Returns up to the maximum requested elements. Never grows the array (unlike SetCount).": "最多返回请求数量的元素. 不会增加数组长度(与 SetCount 不同). ",
  "Array Append": "数组追加",
  "Copy 'element' to the end of 'a', increasing its count by one.": "将'element'复制到'a'的末尾, 使其计数增加一. ",
  "Array Insert": "数组插入",
  "Insert 'element' in the given index in 'a', increasing its count by one and moving the elements after index.": "在'a'的指定索引位置插入'element', 使其元素数量增加1, 同时该索引之后的元素均向后移动一位. ",
  "Array Remove Index": "数组移除索引",
  "Remove the element at the given index in 'a', decreasing its count by one and moving the elements after index.": "移除 'a' 中指定索引处的元素, 使其元素数量减一, 并移动该索引之后的所有元素. ",
  "Array Remove Element Matching": "数组: 移除匹配的元素",
  "Remove all elements from 'a' which compare equal to 'element'.": "移除'a'中所有与'element'相等的元素. ",
  "Array Remove Invalid Elements": "移除数组中的无效元素",
  "Remove all elements from 'a' which are invalid instances.": "移除 'a' 中所有无效的实例元素. ",
  "Array Concatenate": "数组拼接",
  "Add the array 'b' to the end of 'a'.": "将数组 'b' 添加到数组 'a' 的末尾. ",
  "Array Shuffle": "数组打乱",
  "Randomizes the order of items in the array (Knuth/Fisher-Yates Shuffle)": "随机打乱数组中各项的顺序(Knuth/Fisher-Yates洗牌算法)",
  "Array Find Element Matching": "查找数组中匹配的元素",
  "Find first element 'a' which compare equal to 'element' and return its index.": "查找第一个值与'element'相等的'a'元素, 并返回其索引. ",
  "Array support.": "数组支持. ",
  "Enum support.": "枚举类型支持. ",
  "Has All Flags": "包含所有标志",
  "Whether value has ALL of the specified flags set (it may have other flags.)": "值是否设置了所有指定的标志位(也可以包含其他标志位)",
  "Has Any Flags": "是否包含任意标记",
  "Whether value has ANY of the specified flags set (it may have other flags.)": "值是否设置了任何指定的标志位(也可能同时设置了其他标志位)",
  "Add Flags": "添加标志",
  "Add flags to the given value.": "为指定的值添加标志. ",
  "Remove Flags": "移除标记",
  "Remove flags from the given value.": "移除给定值中的标志位. ",
  "Register Test Checkpoint": "注册测试检查点",
  "Indicate that a checkpoint has been reached.": "表明已到达检查点. ",
  "Indicate Test Failure": "注明测试失败",
  "Used to flag a test as having failed.": "用于标记测试失败. ",
  "Assert True": "验证为真",
  "Indicates a test failure if Value is false.": "当该值为 false 时, 表示测试失败. ",
  "Is In Test Mode": "是否处于测试模式",
  "Are we currently running unit tests?": "当前我们正在运行单元测试吗?",
  "Test Mode Assert True": "测试模式: 断言为真",
  "Indicates a test failure if value is false; only tested when running unit tests": "若值为 false, 则表示测试失败; 仅在运行单元测试时才会进行测试",
  "Testing script helpers.": "测试脚本辅助工具. ",
  "Pause": "暂停",
  "Wait": "等待中",
  "Causes each execution cursor to pause at this node for a fixed period of time. Each cursor will wake up and resume execution when the time expires, unless aborted or early-woken.": "使每个执行游标在此节点处暂停一段固定时长. 时间结束后, 各游标才会恢复执行, 除非被中止或提前唤醒. ",
  "Pause the cursor at this point.": "将光标暂停在此处. ",
  "Random Integer": "随机整数",
  "Generate a random integer between min and max (inclusive)": "生成最小值与最大值之间(包含两端值)的随机整数 (inclusive)",
  "Eval": "评估",
  "Random Float": "随机浮点数",
  "Generate a random float between min and max (inclusive)": "生成介于最小值和最大值之间(包含两端值)的随机浮点数 (inclusive)",
  "Base Flow  Wake Elegantly": "基础流程: 优雅唤醒",
  "Base Flow  Wake Immediately": "基础流程: 立即唤醒",
  "Base Flow  Cancel After": "基础流程: 取消操作延迟时间",
  "Base Flow  Cancel Elegantly": "基础流程: 优雅地取消",
  "Base Flow  Cancel Immediately": "基础流程 立即取消",
  "Wake Resume": "唤醒恢复",
  "Evaluate the curve at the specified input position": "在指定的输入位置对曲线进行求值",
  "Stop Waiting": "停止等待",
  "Evaluate the gradient at a position between 0 and 1": "计算 0 到 1 之间某一位置处的梯度值",
  "Time since the start of the timer": "计时器启动后的时长",
  "Value 0-1 how far along duration (always 0 if duration is -1)": "取值范围为 0 到 1, 表示在持续时间中的进度位置(若持续时间为 -1, 则此值始终为 0) (always 0 if duration is -1)",
  "Signature hook to fill out arguments for OnInterval": "用于填充 OnInterval 参数的签名钩子",
  "This is the overall duration. If -1 timer will continue forever. During this duration, we will fire a new child cursor at each Interval.": "这是整体持续时间. 如果值为 -1, 计时器将无限运行. 在此时间段内, 我们会按照设定的间隔生成一个新的子光标. ",
  "If specified, each wait interval will vary randomly between WaitInterval this value": "若指定该选项, 每个等待间隔时间将会在'等待间隔'值与此值之间随机变化",
  "Start a timer with the specified duration, fire the OnInterval output": "启动一个指定时长的计时器, 随后触发 OnInterval 输出",
  "Called when timer reaches the duration OR is stopped. NOTE: This will run a little while AFTER the last interval fires unless they line up perfectly.": "在定时器达到设定时长或被停止时调用. 注意: 除非各时间点完全吻合, 否则此函数会在最后一个时间间隔触发后稍晚一点才执行. ",
  "New child cursor starts here every time the wait interval elapses": "每次等待时间结束后, 新的子光标均从此处开始",
  "Interval Timer": "间隔计时器",
  "Wait for a duration, firing a child cursor at regular (or randomized) intervals": "等待指定时长, 然后以固定(或随机)间隔触发子光标",
  "Completed": "完成",
  "On Interval": "按间隔执行",
  "Tag Cursor": "标签光标",
  "Save a named value of any type on the cursor.": "在光标处保存任意类型的带名称的值. ",
  "Cursor Has Tag": "光标带有标签",
  "Check if the cursor already has the given tag.": "检查光标处是否已存在指定的标签. ",
  "Any Other Cursors Have Tag": "是否存在其他带有标签的光标",
  "Check if any yielded cursors on the graph already have the given tag.": "检查图表中是否有任何已生成的光标带有指定的标签. ",
  "Kill Cursors With Tag": "按标签杀死游标",
  "Find all the yielded cursors on this graph with the matching tag and cancel them.": "找出此图表中所有带有匹配标签的光标并将其取消. ",
  "Wake Cursors With Tag": "基于标签唤醒光标",
  "Find all the yielded cursors on this graph with the matching tag and wake them.": "找出此图表中所有带有匹配标签且已挂起的游标, 然后唤醒它们. ",
  "Kill All Other Cursors": "杀死所有其他光标",
  "Find all the yielded cursors on this graph and cancel them.": "找出此图形中所有已生成的光标并将其取消. ",
  "Remove Tag From Cursor": "移除光标处的标签",
  "Remove the given tag from this cursor. If other cursors are waiting on us, they will resume.": "移除此光标上的指定标签. 如果有其他光标正在等待, 它们将会恢复运行. ",
  "Any extra waiting cursors will be terminated. -1 for infinite cursors.": "所有多余的等待光标都将被终止. 值为 -1 则表示允许无限数量的光标. ",
  "Apply the same tag we're waiting on to the resulting cursor upon wait completion. Can be used to wait on our result cursor with the same tag.": "在等待操作完成后, 将我们正在使用的相同标签应用到生成的游标上. 该标签可用于后续对同一结果游标进行等待操作. ",
  "When we start waiting, how should we handle existing cursors?": "当我们开始等待时, 该如何处理现有的光标呢?",
  "Wait For Cursors With Tag": "等待带有标签的光标出现",
  "Causes this execution cursor to wait for the completion of other cursors with the given tag. Can optionally kill the tag while waiting.": "使当前执行游标等待带有指定标签的其他游标执行完毕. 也可选择在等待过程中终止该标签对应的所有游标. ",
  "Any cursors above this count will wait, up to the limit.": "超过此数量的游标都将进入等待状态, 直至达到上限. ",
  "Cursor Queue": "光标队列",
  "Causes each execution cursor to wait for the completion of all prior cursors that have visited this node. Use this to safely support multiple triggers to areas of the graph that take time to complete.": "该选项会让每个执行中的游标都等待所有先前已访问过该节点的游标执行完毕. 如需安全地对图中那些执行耗时较长的区域触发多次操作, 则可使用此选项. ",
  "Library for interacting with pulse cursors.": "用于与脉冲光标进行交互的库. ",
  "A string associated with this Cursor, to use later for remote Kill or Wait requests. Cursors can have any number of Tags associated with them.": "与此游标相关联的字符串, 供日后发起远程终止或等待请求时使用. 一个游标可关联任意数量的标签. ",
  "Optional. Type 'Any'. An associated value, e.g. the Entity Handle which is responsible for this Cursor. The Tag is defined by the unique combination of Name and Value.": "可选. 输入'Any'. 也可输入关联值, 例如负责此光标的实体句柄. 标签由名称和值的唯一组合来定义. ",
  "If this cursor spawns other work via Fire And Forget, should this Tag be inherited?": "如果此光标通过'立即执行无需等待'方式生成其他任务, 是否应继承该标签?",
