  "Inconsistent face geometry (Error in position of some face-related data element, may be due to a precision issue)": "面部几何结构不一致(部分与面部相关的数据元素位置有误, 可能是由于精度问题导致)",
  "Inconsistent edge geometry (Error in position of some edge-related data element, may be due to a precision issue)": "边缘几何形状不一致(部分与边缘相关的数据元素位置出现错误, 可能是精度问题导致)",
