  "World space": "世界空间",
  "World space transform, not relative to the specific smart prop object placement.": "世界空间变换, 并非相对于特定智能组件对象的放置位置而言. ",
  "Object space": "对象空间",
  "Object space transform, relative to the object placement, but does not include the current element transform.": "对象空间变换: 相对于对象的放置位置而言, 但不包含当前元素的变换信息. ",
  "Element space": "元素间距",
  "Element space transform, includes the transform of the current element, which is also relative to the object.": "元素空间变换, 包含当前元素的变换过程, 该变换同样以对象为参照基准. ",
  "ELEMENT": "元素",
  "Forward direction (+x)": "正向方向(+x) (+x)",
  "Left direction (+y)": "向左方向(+y) (+y)",
  "Up direction (+z)": "向上方向(+z) (+z)",
  "Distribute the child elements randomly within the specified area or volume": "在指定的区域或空间内随机分布子元素",
  "Regular": "常规",
  "Distribute the child element evenly within the specified area of volume": "将子元素均匀分布在体积的指定区域内",
  "Place in sphere": "置于球体内",
  "Child elements will be placed within a sphere of the specified radius.": "子元素将被放置在指定半径的球体范围内. ",
  "Place in circle": "置于圆圈内",
  "Child elements will be placed within a circle of the specified radius.": "子元素将被放置在指定半径的圆圈内. ",
  "Randomly pick a choice. If the choices have weights, the weights will be used to determine the probability of picking a given choice": "随机选择一个选项. 如果各选项设有权重, 则会根据权重来决定选中各个选项的概率",
  "First": "首先",
  "Pick the first valid choice. Selection criteria may be added to a choice to determine if it is valid.": "请选择第一个符合条件的选项. 您可以为某个选项添加筛选条件, 以判定其是否符合要求. ",
  "Specific": "具体说明",
  "Pick a choice specified by an additional authored value.": "选择一个由额外编写的值所指定的选项. ",
  "Specific Color": "指定颜色",
  "Specify a specific color value (may be linked to a variable": "请指定具体的颜色值(可关联某个变量",
  "Gradient Random": "渐变随机",
  "Pick a random color from anywhere on the authored color gradient": "从设定的颜色渐变中随机选取一种颜色",
  "Gradient Random Stop": "渐变随机停止",
  "Randomly select one of the color stops specified on the gradient. Never picks a value between stops.": "随机选取渐变中设定的某个颜色节点, 但绝不会选取两个节点之间的颜色值. ",
  "Gradient Specific Value": "渐变特定值",
  "Use a color value from a specified location on the gradient": "从渐变中指定位置获取颜色值",
  "No fade out. The object will not fade out, but will still be culled when below the minimum size and will pop at that that point.": "无淡出效果. 对象不会淡出, 但在尺寸小于最小阈值时仍会被剔除, 此时会立即消失. ",
  "Most Aggressive": "最具攻击性",
  "Most aggressive fade out. The object will fade out while still quite large on screen.": "最激进的淡出效果. 对象在屏幕上仍保持较大尺寸时便会开始淡出. ",
  "More Aggressive": "更激进",
  "More aggressive fade out. The object will fade out while larger on screen than normal.": "更明显的淡出效果: 对象在屏幕上显示的尺寸会比正常情况下更大, 随后再逐渐淡出. ",
  "Normal fade out. The object will fade at when at the standard size on screen.": "常规淡出效果. 对象会在屏幕上保持标准大小时逐渐淡出. ",
  "Less Aggressive": "较温和/攻击性较低",
  "Less aggressive fade out. The object will not fade out until it is smaller on screen than normal.": "渐隐效果较温和. 只有当物体在屏幕上的尺寸小于正常大小时才会开始渐隐. ",
  "Least Aggressive": "最温和的模式",
  "Least aggressive fade out. The object will be quite small before fading out. Fade out will only complete at the size cull limit.": "最温和的淡出效果. 对象在淡出前会保持相当大的尺寸, 且仅当尺寸达到剔除阈值时才会完全淡出. ",
  "NORMAL": "正常",
  "Circle": "圆形",
  "Diamond": "钻石",
  "All positions": "所有职位",
  "Place at all positions along the path": "可放置在路径上的任意位置",
  "Every N positions": "每 N 个位置",
  "Place at every Nth position along the path, skipping over the other positions": "在路径上每隔 N 个位置放置一个, 其余位置则跳过",
  "Only at start and end": "仅在开头和结尾处出现",
  "Only place at the start or end of the path": "仅可放置在路径的开头或结尾",
  "Path control points": "路径控制点",
  "Place at path control points instead of every point along the path, when this is selected the path spacing no longer applies": "选中此选项后, 会将项目放置在路径的控制点上, 而非路径上的每个点; 此时路径间距设置将不再生效",
  "No scaling": "不缩放",
  "Do not allow selected elements to be scaled, the parts may not fit the line exactly": "禁止缩放所选元素, 否则各部分可能无法完全对齐到线上",
  "Scale last": "缩放上次操作",
  "Apply scale to the last element in order to fit the line. Only proceed to scale additional elements if the scale range of the last element is not sufficient.": "将缩放比例应用于最后一个元素, 以使其适配整行. 只有当最后一个元素的缩放范围不足时, 才继续对其他元素进行缩放. ",
  "Scale equally": "等比例缩放",
  "Attempt to apply the same amount of scale to all of the elements placed on the line while still respecting their size constraints.": "尝试在遵守各元素大小限制的前提下, 对排列在同一直线上的所有元素应用相同的缩放比例. ",
  "Maximize scale": "最大化缩放比例",
  "Each element will be scaled to is maximum allowable size that will still fit on the line.": "每个元素都会被缩放到仍能适应该行的最大允许尺寸. ",
  "Largest fitting": "最大适配尺寸",
  "Pick the largest child element that will fit in the remaining length of the line, repeat this process until the line is full or no child will fit in the remaining length.": "选择能够放入当前行剩余长度内的最大子元素, 然后重复此过程, 直到该行被填满或没有子元素能放入剩余长度内为止. ",
  "Random fitting": "随机适配",
  "Pick a random choice from the child elements that will fit within the remaining length, repeat this process until the line is full or no child will fit in the remaining length.": "从子元素中随机选择一个能够容纳在剩余长度内的元素, 重复此过程直至该行被填满或没有子元素能放入剩余空间中. ",
  "Place all in order": "按顺序排列所有项",
  "Place all of the child elements in the order they are specified even if they do not fit the line or do not fill the line. NOTE: end cap settings are ignored in this mode.": "请按照指定的顺序放置所有子元素, 即便它们无法填满整行或无法排列在一条线上. 注意: 在此模式下, 端点设置将被忽略. ",
  "Generate the grid by placing N x N children.": "通过放置 N x N 个子元素来生成网格. ",
  "Fill": "填写",
  "Fill the area based on the largest bounds of child elements as specified in their selection criteria.": "根据子元素在其选择条件中所定义的最大边界范围来填充整个区域. ",
  "Lay out child elements with their origin at the center of each grid cell.": "将子元素排列在网格中, 使其原点位于每个网格单元的中心. ",
  "Corner": "转角处",
  "Lay out child elements with their origin at the corner of each grid cell.": "将子元素布局在网格单元格的角落处, 以其原点作为对齐点. ",
  "CENTER": "居中",
  "First Open Edge": "首次打开 Edge",
  "Orientation of child elements placed on faces will be driven by position of center of first open edge relative to face center.": "放置在面上的子元素的方向, 由第一条开放边缘的中心位置相对于面中心的位置决定. ",
  "First Closed Edge": "首个封闭的边缘",
  "Orientation of child elements placed on faces will be driven by position of center of first closed edge relative to face center.": "放置在面上的子元素的方向由第一个闭合边缘的中心相对于面中心的位置决定. ",
  "UV Channel 1": "UV通道1",
  "Orientation of child elements placed on faces will be driven by orthonormalized UV basis at face center. U axis is prioritized during orthonormalization.": "置于面上的子元素的方向将由面中心处的正交化UV基矢来确定. 在正交化过程中, U轴具有较高优先级. ",
  "UV Channel 2": "UV通道2",
  "Coordinate Space": "坐标空间",
  "Specifies a coordinate space in which a point or vector value is defined.": "指定一个坐标系, 用于定义某个点或向量的位置. ",
  "Enumerator Types": "枚举类型",
  "Direction Vector": "方向向量",
  "Specifies a basis direction vector ( Forward, Left, or UP).": "指定一个基准方向向量(前向、左侧或上向). ",
  "Distribution Mode": "分发模式",
  "Specifies a distribution mode used to determine how certain elements distribute instances of their children within a space.": "指定一种分布模式, 用于确定特定元素如何在指定空间内分布其子元素实例. ",
  "Placement Shape": "放置形状",
  "Specifies the shape (circle, or sphere) to use with elements that place children within a radius.": "指定用于那些将子元素放置在半径范围内的元素的形状(圆形或球体). ",
  "Specifies the method by which a child element is selected from a list.": "指定从列表中选择子元素的方式. ",
  "Color Selection mode": "颜色选择模式",
  "Specifies the method by which a color selection is to be made.": "指定选择颜色的方式. ",
  "Is this element enabled? If not enabled, this element will not be evaluted and will have no effect on the result.": "此元素是否已启用?若未启用, 则该元素不会被计算, 也不会对结果产生任何影响. ",
  "Label": "标签",
  "Optional text that will appear in the outliner to help organize Smart Prop elements and communicate their purpose to other users.": "可选的文本, 将显示在大纲视图中, 有助于整理'智能道具'元素并向其他用户说明其用途. ",
  "Selection Criteria": "选择标准",
  "Modifiers": "修饰符",
  "Smart Prop Element": "智能道具元素",
  "Specifies the current version of this smart prop. Any existing references to this smart prop with an older version number will not automatically update.": "用于指定此智能组件的当前版本. 任何引用了旧版本号的相关组件均不会自动更新. ",
  "Maximum depth of smart prop evaluation stack during evaluation.": "在求值过程中, 智能属性求值堆栈的最大深度. ",
  "Choices": "选项",
  "List of the root level elements making up the smart prop definition, each element may be an entire tree.": "构成智能属性定义的根级元素列表, 每个元素都可能是一整棵树. ",
  "Smart Prop Root": "智能道具根节点",
  "Root of a smart prop, contains a list of elements to evaluate.": "智能属性的根节点, 包含待评估的元素列表. ",
  "Apply Modifiers": "应用修饰符",
  "An element which is used to apply a set of modifiers to the state of its parent.": "用于对父级状态应用一组修改器的元素. ",
  "List of child elements which will appear if this element appears": "当此元素出现时, 会随之出现的子元素列表",
  "A group of elements that will all be evaulated.": "一组需要全部进行评估的元素. ",
  "Name of the model resource (.vmdl) to place.": "要放置的模型资源(.vmdl)的名称. ",
  "Specifies the name of the material group (skin) to use when displaying the specified model.": "指定显示指定模型时所使用的材质组(皮肤)的名称. ",
  "If enabled the model will be rendered as a detail object, which is faster for placing many small objects and has fade out functionality, but may have different lighting characteristics. Detail object models support only uniform scale and will use the largest component of the scale value.": "启用后, 模型将以细节对象的形式渲染. 这种方式在放置大量小对象时效率更高, 还具备淡出效果, 但光照表现可能有所不同. 细节对象模型仅支持等比例缩放, 且会采用缩放值中最大的那个分量作为缩放比例. ",
  "Scale factor (may be non-uniform) to be applied directly to the model (in the model's local space).": "要直接应用于模型的比例因子(可非均匀), 该因子作用于模型的局部空间内. ",
  "Model Scale": "模型比例",
  "Uniform scale to be applied to the model, certain properties like detail object mean only uniform scale may be applied to the model.": "将对模型应用统一缩放比例; 某些属性(如细节对象)意味着仅能对模型应用统一缩放. ",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor( LODLevel )": "智能属性编辑器(LOD级别)( LODLevel )",
  "Select model LOD level. The default Auto LOD means the lod will be picked based on the size of the model on screen. If a specific level is selected, then that lod level will always be used regardless of the size of the model on screen.": "请选择模型的LOD等级. 默认设置为'自动LOD', 此时系统会根据模型在屏幕上的大小来选择相应的LOD等级. 若手动指定了某个等级, 则无论模型在屏幕上的大小如何, 都会始终使用该等级. ",
  "Override Surface Property": "覆盖表面属性",
  "If non-empty, specifies the name of a surface property to use for all physics shapes of the specified model, overriding any surface properties specified within the model.": "如果不为空, 则指定一个表面属性名称, 该属性将用于指定模型中的所有物理形状, 并覆盖模型内部设定的任何表面属性. ",
  "Fade Level": "渐变强度",
  "Controls the size at which a model marked as a detail object will fade out.": "用于控制标记为细节对象的模型在何种尺寸下开始淡出. ",
  "Should the model cast shadows.": "模型是否应投射阴影. ",
  "Rigid Deformation Only": "仅刚性变形",
  "If enabled, only the transform of the model will be modified by any active deformer, the vertices of the model will not be changed by the deformer.": "启用后, 仅有模型的变换会受到当前变形器的影响, 模型的顶点则不会被变形器修改. ",
  "Disable Dynamic Deformable": "禁用动态变形功能",
  "If checked, this model will not deform in game when the smart prop is placed inside a dynamic deformable entity (such as func_deformable_brush).": "勾选后, 当智能道具被放置于可动态变形的实体中(如 func_deformable_brush)时, 该模型在游戏中也不会发生变形. ",
  "Places a model as the child of an element.": "将模型设置为某个元素的子级. ",
  "Name of the target smart prop resource (.vsmart) to evaluate.": "待评估的目标智能属性资源名称(.vsmart格式). ",
  "Smart Prop Reference": "智能道具引用",
  "Evaluates a specified smart prop as a child of the current element.": "评估指定的智能属性, 将其视为当前元素的子项. ",
  "Path Positions": "路径位置",
  "Specifies the set of positions that are valid for path placement.": "指定路径放置时允许的位置集合. ",
  "Fit on Line Scale Mode": "适配线条缩放模式",
  "Specifies how a fit on line element will scale generate scale values for the objects it places.": "指定在线元素上进行的适配操作应如何缩放, 从而生成其所放置对象的缩放值. ",
  "Fit on Line Pick Mode": "在线适配选取模式",
  "Specifies how a fit on line element will pick which child elements it will place.": "指定行内元素布局时如何选择要放置的子元素. ",
  "Grid Placement": "网格布局",
  "Specifies how to place elements within a grid.": "指定如何在网格中排列元素. ",
  "Grid Origin": "网格原点",
  "Specifies where the origin of a child element is placed realative to each grid cell.": "指定子元素的原点相对于每个网格单元的位置. ",
  "ConvertSelfToPulse unimplemented (%s)": "ConvertSelfToPulse功能尚未实现 (%s)",
  "ConvertSelfToPulse_Modifier unimplemented (%s)": "ConvertSelfToPulse_Modifier 尚未实现 (%s)",
  "Disabled criteria - skipping (%s)": "已禁用的筛选条件 - 跳过 (%s)",
  "Criteria with nonliteral enabled state unsupported (%s)": "不支持启用非字面含义状态的条件 (%s)",
  "Evaluated %s in %.2fms": "已评估 %s, 耗时 %.2f毫秒",
  "Material Asset Variable": "材质资源变量",
  "Default Model": "默认模型",
  "Model Asset Variable": "模型资源变量",
  "Default Surface Property": "默认曲面属性",
  "Surface Property Variable": "表面属性变量",
  "Option Value Name": "选项值名称",
  "Option Display Name": "选项显示名称",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(VariableValue)": "智能属性编辑器(变量值)(VariableValue)",
  "SmartPropVariableValueEditor( comparison )": "智能属性变量值编辑器(比较)( comparison )",
  "If enabled, this value will be exposed as a parameter that can be set on the smart prop object in hammer.": "启用后, 该值将作为参数在 Hammer 中被设置到智能属性对象上. ",
  "Parameter Display Name": "参数显示名称",
  "Name of the parameter which will appear as a property in the Hammer object properties ui when selecting an object using this smart prop.": "该参数的名称: 当使用此智能属性选择对象时, 该名称会作为属性出现在 Hammer 对象属性界面中. ",
  "Expression to evaluate to determine if this parameter should be hidden. Can be used to hide this parameter based on the state of other parameters.": "用于判断该参数是否应隐藏的表达式. 可依据其他参数的状态来决定是否隐藏此参数. ",
  "Expression to evaluate to detemrine if this parameter should be read-only. Can be used to make this parameter read-only based on the state of other parameters.": "用于判断该参数是否应设为只读的表达式. 借助此表达式, 可根据其他参数的状态来决定此参数是否为只读. ",
  "Vector 2D": "二维向量",
  "Vector 3D": "三维向量",
  "Vector 4D": "四维向量",
  "Model containing the set of material groups to select.": "包含待选择材料组集合的模型. ",
  "Default material group (skin) to assign to the variable value.": "分配给变量值的默认材质组(表皮). ",
  "Specifies the coordinate space that vector should be returned in.": "指定返回矢量时所使用的坐标空间. ",
  "Normalized (Direction Vector)": "标准化处理(方向向量) (Direction Vector)",
  "Should the return value be normalized to unit length (direction vector).": "是否需要将返回值归一化为单位长度(方向向量). ",
  "Vector Between Points": "两点间的向量",
  "Compute the vector between two 3D points": "计算两个三维点之间的向量",
  "Local space rotation (in degrees) to apply to the current transform": "要应用于当前变换的本地空间旋转角度(单位为度)",
  "Transform: Rotate": "转换: 旋转",
  "Apply a rotation to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用旋转操作. ",
  "Normalize the value of a 3d vector.": "标准化三维向量的值. ",
  "Position of origin point.": "原点位置. ",
  "Coefficient to modulate the rotation": "用于控制旋转的系数",
  "Input Coordinate Space": "输入坐标空间",
  "Space in which the origin position is defined.": "定义原点位置的空间. ",
  "Space in which the target position is defined.": "定义目标位置的空间. ",
  "Space in which the up target is defined.": "定义上升目标的空间. ",
  "Transform: Rotate Towards": "变换: 朝向旋转",
  "Apply a rotation to the current transform according to the alignment of two points.": "根据两点的对齐情况, 对当前变换应用旋转操作. ",
  "+Vector A": "+向量 A",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of vector A.": "指定向量 A 的坐标空间. ",
  "+Vector B": "+向量 B",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of posivectortion B.": "指定位置扭曲B的坐标空间. ",
  "Projection to plane": "投影到平面",
  "Interpret Vector B as plane normal.": "将向量 B 解释为平面法线. ",
  "Project Vector": "项目矢量",
  "Project Vector A onto Vector B": "将向量A投影到向量B上",
  "Scale to apply to the current transform": "应用于当前变换的比例值",
  "Transform: Scale": "转换: 缩放",
  "Apply a scale to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用缩放比例. ",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(MaterialInSmartProp)": "智能属性编辑器(材质在智能属性中)(MaterialInSmartProp)",
  "Original Material": "原始素材",
  "Original material to replace. This is the material specified in the model, including any material group asignment within the model. Does not consider any existing material overrides specified within the smart prop.": "待替换的原始材质. 此为模型中指定的材质, 包含了模型中设定的所有材质组分配信息. 此过程不会考虑智能属性中已设定的任何材质覆盖设置. ",
  "Minimum random position offset": "最小随机位置偏移量",
  "New Material": "新建素材",
  "New material to replace the original material with.": "用于替换原材质的新材质. ",
  "Maximum random position offset": "最大随机位置偏移量",
  "If non-zero, specifies the increment to which the randomly selected offset value will be snapped. Note that the snap value is absolute, not relative to the min or max, but if the if the min or max are not multiples of the snap value they can still be selected.": "若该值不为零, 则表示随机选取的偏移值需对齐的增量值. 请注意, 此对齐值为绝对值, 并非相对于最小值或最大值而言; 即使最小值或最大值并非该对齐值的倍数, 它们仍可被选中. ",
  "Transform: Random Offset": "转换: 随机偏移",
  "Apply a random position offset to the current transform.": "为当前变换应用一个随机位置偏移量. ",
  "Clear Active Overrides": "清除当前覆盖设置",
  "If enabled, clear any previous material overrides, so that only the material replacements specified in this table will be active.": "启用后, 将清除所有先前设置的材质覆盖项, 此时仅有此表中指定的材质替换才会生效. ",
  "Material Replacements": "材料替换",
  "Table specifying pairs of existing materials and the material to replace them with.": "表格中列出了现有材料及其对应的替代材料. ",
  "Material Override": "材质覆盖",
  "Specifies a table of material replacements to apply to all following models. Mapping goes from the material specified by the model (including material group selection) to the replacement material. Previous material overrides are not considered when determining the base material.": "指定一个材料替换表, 该表将应用于后续的所有模型. 映射关系为: 从模型中指定的材料(包括材料组选择)对应到替换后的材料. 在确定基础材料时, 先前的材料替换设置不会被纳入考量. ",
  "Minimum rotation range": "最小旋转范围",
  "Maximum rotation range": "最大旋转范围",
  "If non-zero, specifies the angle increment to which the randomly selected value will be snapped. Note that the snap value is absolute, not relative to the min or max, but if the if the min or max are not multiples of the snap value they can still be selected.": "若此值不为零, 则指定随机选取的值应对齐到的角度增量. 请注意, 该对齐值为绝对数值, 并非相对于最小值或最大值的相对值; 不过即便最小值或最大值并非该对齐值的倍数, 它们仍可被选中. ",
  "Transform: Random Rotation": "变换: 随机旋转",
  "Apply a random rotation to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用随机旋转. ",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor( MaterialGroupFromVariable )": "智能属性编辑器(从变量获取材质组)( MaterialGroupFromVariable )",
  "Minimum scale range": "最小缩放范围",
  "Maximum scale range": "最大缩放范围",
  "If non-zero, specifies the increment to which the randomly selected scale value will be snapped. Note that the snap value is absolute, not relative to the min or max, but if the min or max are not multiples of the snap value they can still be selected.": "若该值不为零, 则表示随机选定的缩放值应对齐到的步长数值. 请注意, 此步长为绝对数值, 并非相对于最小值或最大值而言; 即便最小值或最大值并非该步长的倍数, 它们仍可被选中. ",
  "Transform: Random Scale": "变换: 随机缩放",
  "Apply a random scale to the current transform.": "为当前变换应用随机缩放比例. ",
  "Material group variable to set to the selected choice.": "要设置为所选选项的材质组变量. ",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( Variable:MaterialGroup )": "智能属性项名称编辑器(变量: 材质组)",
  "Specifies how the material group is to be selected from the authored set of choices": "指定如何从预设的选项集中选择材质组",
  "Transform: Rigid Deformation": "转换: 刚性变形",
  "Apply the active deformer to the current transform as a rigid deformation and disable the deformer.": "将当前激活的变形器作为刚性变形应用到当前变换上, 然后禁用该变形器. ",
  "Choice Index": "选项索引",
  "Specifies the index of the material group choice to pick": "指定要选择的材质组选项的索引",
  "Set Material Group Choice": "设置材质组选择",
  "Picks a material group from a set of choices and assigns that material group to a specified variable.": "从多个选项中选取一个材质组, 并将其赋值给指定的变量. ",
  "Trace Miss Behavior": "追踪丢失追踪行为",
  "Specified what to do when a trace does not hit a surface.": "指定当追踪线未触及任何表面时应执行的操作. ",
  "Material to which color tint is to be applied.": "需要上色的材质. ",
  "Specifies how the color is to be specified.": "指定颜色的设定方式. ",
  "Color Gradient": "颜色渐变",
  "Defines a color gradient from which a color can be selected based on the selection mode.": "定义一个颜色渐变范围, 可根据所选模式从中选取颜色. ",
  "Material Color Tint": "材质颜色调色",
  "Set a color tint to apply to a specific material.": "设置要应用于特定材质的颜色色调. ",
  "Specifies the origin point for the start of the trace. To trace from the current position, set to < 0, 0, 0 > and set the coordinate space to Element Space": "指定轨迹起始点的原点位置. 若要从当前位置开始追踪, 请将该值设为 < 0, 0, 0 > 并将坐标系设置为元素坐标系",
  "Coordinate space the origin is specified in. Using Element space allows specifying a value relative to the current position. However, world space should generally be used when for variable values.": "原点所属的坐标空间. 选择'元素空间'即可基于当前位置来设定数值; 而对于变量值而言, 通常应使用'世界空间'. ",
  "Offset to apply to the specified origin along the trace direction to compute the starting point of the trace.": "需沿轨迹方向对指定原点施加的偏移量, 用于计算轨迹的起始点. ",
  "How much should the surface normal up direction influence the final orientation. [ 0, 1 ] where 0 = don't modify the orientation, 1 = completely re-orient to match the surface.": "表面法线向上方向对最终朝向的影响程度. [ 0, 1 ], 其中 0 表示不改变朝向, 1 表示完全根据表面方向重新调整朝向. ",
  "If No Surface Hit": "若无表面碰撞",
  "Specifies the behavior when the trace does not hit a surface.": "指定当跟踪线未击中任何表面时的行为. ",
  "Trace filtering": "追踪过滤",
  "Do not trace against tool materials (attribute 'tools.toolsmaterial').": "请勿针对工具材质进行追踪(属性为 'tools.toolsmaterial'). ",
  "Do not trace against sky materials (attribute 'mapbuilder.sky').": "请勿对天空材质进行追踪(属性为'mapbuilder.sky'). ",
  "Do not trace against no draw materials (material attribute 'mapbuilder.nodraw').": "请勿对没有绘制属性的材质进行追踪(即材质属性为'mapbuilder.nodraw'的情况). ",
  "Do not trace against translucent materials (materials with 'alphatest' or 'translucent' attributes).": "请勿对半透明材质进行轨迹追踪(即带有'alphatest'或'translucent'属性的材质). ",
  "Do not trace against any models (only hit world geometry).": "请勿对任何模型进行追踪(仅检测世界几何体即可). ",
  "Do not trace against dynamic entities which may move in game.": "切勿对游戏中可能移动的动态实体进行追踪. ",
  "Do not trace against cable geometry.": "请勿根据电缆几何形状进行追踪. ",
  "+Trace Direction": "+跟踪方向",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the trace direction vector is specified in.": "指定轨迹方向向量所对应的坐标空间. ",
  "Maximum length of the trace. Surfaces beyond this distance will not be hit.": "轨迹的最大长度. 超出此距离的曲面将不会被击中. ",
  "Transform: Trace In Direction": "转换: 沿指定方向追踪",
  "Perform a trace in a direction from a specified origin and stop when a surface is hit.": "从指定起点沿指定方向进行追踪, 直至碰到表面为止. ",
  "+Target Point": "添加目标点",
  "The target point to trace to from the origin.": "从原点出发要追踪到的目标点. ",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the target point is specified in.": "指定目标点所使用的坐标空间. ",
  "+Trace Away": "+取消追踪",
  "Trace away from point": "从该点开始追踪",
  "If enabled, instead of tracing from the origin to the target point, trace away from the target point for the specified distance starting at the origin.": "启用后, 系统会从起点开始, 沿着指定距离向远离终点的方向进行追踪, 而非从起点向终点追踪. ",
  "Transform: Trace To Point": "转换: 追踪至指定点",
  "Perform a trace between the specified origin and a specified target point.": "在指定的起点与目标点之间执行追踪. ",
  "+Line End Point A": "+线条终点 A",
  "End point of the line to trace to.": "要追踪的线段的终点. ",
  "Coordinate space the end point is specified in.": "终点坐标所使用的坐标系. ",
  "+Line End Point B": "+线条终点 B",
  "Trace away from line": "从线条处开始追踪",
  "If enabled, instead of tracing from the origin to the line, trace away from the line for the specified distance starting at the origin.": "启用后, 系统不会从原点向直线进行追踪, 而是从原点开始沿直线向外追踪指定距离. ",
  "Transform: Trace To Line": "转换: 追踪为直线",
  "Perform a trace from a specified origin point to a the closest point on a line.": "从指定的起点开始追踪, 直至到达线上最近的点. ",
  "Color to be applied if this choice is selected.": "选中此选项时应用的颜色. ",
  "Relative weight of this choice, higher weighted choices are more likely to be selected.": "此选项的相对权重: 权重值越高的选项被选中的可能性越大. ",
  "Tint Mode": "着色模式",
  "Specifies how a color tint value is to be applied with respect to the existing color tint": "指定如何将颜色色调值应用到现有的颜色色调上",
  "Specifies how the color is to be selected from the authored set of choices": "指定如何从预设的色值选项中选择颜色",
  "Color Selection": "颜色选择",
  "Specifies the index of the color to pick": "指定要选择的颜色的索引",
  "Application Mode": "应用程序模式",
  "Specifies how the selected color should be applied to the current color.": "指定所选颜色应如何应用到当前颜色上. ",
  "List of possible colors which may be selected": "可选择的颜色列表",
  "Tint Color Choice": "色调颜色选择",
  "Set the color tint to one color out of a pre-selected set of colors.": "将颜色色调设置为预选颜色集合中的任意一种颜色. ",
  "Do nothing": "什么都不做",
  "If no surface it hit, don't update the transform at all, act as if the trace was not performed.": "若未击中任何表面, 则完全不更新变换信息, 就如同并未执行该检测一样. ",
  "Stop evaluation": "停止评估",
  "If no surface is hit stop evaluation of the current element, no following modifiers will be evaluated and the current transform will not be modified.": "如果未命中任何表面, 则停止对当前元素的评估, 后续修饰符均不再被评估, 当前变换也不会被修改. ",
  "Move to start": "移到开头",
  "If no surface is hit move the current transform to the start of the trace.": "如果未命中任何表面, 请将当前变换移至轨迹的起点. ",
  "Move to end": "移至末尾",
  "If no surface is hit move the current transform to the end of the trace.": "如果未击中任何表面, 请将当前变换移动到轨迹末端. ",
  "Multiply object tint": "调整对象色调强度",
  "Multiply with the object level color tint and replace the current color value.": "与对象级别的色调值相乘, 从而替换当前的颜色值. ",
  "Multiply current tint": "将当前的色调倍数化",
  "Multiply with the current color tint value.": "使用当前的颜色色调值进行相乘. ",
  "Replace tint": "替换为色调",
  "Replace the current color tint value completely, overwriting any object level tint.": "完全替换当前的颜色色调值, 覆盖所有对象级别的色调设置. ",
  "Color Position": "颜色位置",
  "Defines a color gradient from which a random color will be piked.": "定义一个颜色渐变范围, 系统将从中随机选取一种颜色. ",
  "Tint Color Gradient": "色调颜色渐变",
  "Set the color tint to a selection from within the defined gradient.": "设置颜色色调, 从预定义的渐变色中选择所需颜色. ",
  "Set Variable": "设置变量",
  "Set the value of a variable.": "设置变量的值. ",
  "State": "状态",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( Locator )": "智能属性名称编辑器(定位器)( Locator )",
  "Name of the locator. This can be used to reference the locator in this element or its children. If the locator is configurable, the locator will be identified by this name in Hammer.": "定位器名称. 此名称可用于在当前元素或其子元素中引用该定位器. 如果该定位器可配置, 则在 Hammer 中会以此名称来标识它. ",
  "Offset of the locator relative to the current transform. This allows the locator to be created at an offset location without applying that offset to the current transform.": "定位器相对于当前变换的偏移量. 此设置可让定位器生成在指定的偏移位置, 而无需将该偏移值应用到当前变换中. ",
  "Scale to apply only to the locator model": "仅应用于定位器模型的缩放比例",
  "Controls whether or not the locator can be edited in a smart prop configuration. If enabled an editable locator will appear when the smart prop is placed in Hammer. Any changes to that locator will modify the current transform.": "用于控制是否在智能属性配置中编辑定位器. 启用后, 将智能属性放置到 Hammer 中时会出现一个可编辑的定位器. 对该定位器的任何修改都会影响当前的变换设置. ",
  "Configuration": "配置",
  "Controls whether or not the configuration of the locator can include scale. If enabled scale can be applied to the editable locator in Hammer. If disabled the scale will not be editable and the current scale will be used.": "用于控制定位器的配置中是否允许设置缩放比例. 启用后, 便可在 Hammer 中对可编辑的定位器应用缩放比例; 禁用后则无法编辑缩放比例, 系统将使用当前的缩放值. ",
  "Create Locator": "创建定位器",
  "Create a locator with the current transform. The locator may optionally be configurable, so that its transform can be modified in Hammer.": "根据当前变换信息创建一个定位器. 该定位器也可设置为可配置状态, 这样便能在 Hammer 中修改其变换参数. ",
  "Manipulators": "操纵器",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( SavedState )": "智能属性名称编辑器(已保存状态)( SavedState )",
  "Name to assign to the saved state, the save state can be restored later using this name.": "为保存的状态指定一个名称, 日后即可通过该名称恢复此状态. ",
  "Save State": "保存状态",
  "Save the current state, allowing it to be restored at a later state.": "保存当前状态, 以便日后恢复. ",
  "Name of the previously saved state to restore": "要恢复的先前保存状态的名称",
  "If true, the parent element will be discarded there is no state with the specified name. If false, and there is no state with the specified name then no changes are made.": "若设为 true, 当不存在指定名称的状态时, 父元素将被移除. 若设为 false, 即使不存在指定名称的状态, 也不会进行任何更改. ",
  "Restore State": "恢复状态",
  "Replace the current state with a previously saved state.": "将当前状态替换为先前保存的状态. ",
  "Name used to identify the sizer. Must be unique within the paraent element.": "用于标识此尺寸调整器的名称. 该名称在父元素内必须唯一. ",
  "Display Model": "显示模式",
  "If enabled a model will be displayed at the position of the sizer that can be used to select the sizer in Hammer.": "启用后, 将在尺寸调整器的位置显示一个模型, 用于在 Hammer 中选择该尺寸调整器. ",
  "X-Axis Size": "X轴尺寸",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( Variable:Float )": "智能属性项名称编辑器(变量类型: 浮点数)",
  "Y-Axis Size": "Y轴尺寸",
  "Z-Axis Size": "Z轴尺寸",
  "Create Sizer": "创建尺寸调整器",
  "Create a sizer that will be displayed at the current location, allowing the user to manipulate the specified set of size values.": "创建一个尺寸调整器, 它会显示在当前位置, 便于用户调整指定的尺寸数值. ",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of the saved position value.": "指定保存的位置值所采用的坐标空间. ",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( Variable:Vector3 )": "智能属性名称编辑器(变量类型: Vector3)",
  "Save Current Position": "保存当前位置",
  "Save the current position to a specified variable in the requested coordinate space": "将当前位置保存到指定坐标空间中的变量里",
  "Specifies which direction vector to save.": "指定要保存的方向向量. ",
  "Save Direction Vector": "保存方向向量",
  "Save the specified direction vector to a specified variable, in the requested coordinate space": "将指定的方向向量保存到目标变量中, 并采用指定的坐标空间",
  "Name used to identify the rotator. Must be unique within the parent element.": "用于标识旋转器的名称. 该名称在父元素内必须唯一. ",
  "Offset of the rotator relative to the current transform. This allows the rotator to be created at an offset location without applying that offset to the current transform.": "旋转器相对于当前变换的偏移量. 通过此设置, 可将旋转器放置在指定的偏移位置, 而无需将该偏移量应用到当前变换中. ",
  "Axis around which the rotation will occur": "旋转所围绕的轴",
  "Coordinate space the axis of rotation is specified in.": "指定旋转轴所使用的坐标空间. ",
  "Radius at which the rotator handle should be displayed.": "显示旋转手柄的半径值. ",
  "Color to display the rotator handle with.": "用于设置旋转器手柄的显示颜色. ",
  "Should the rotation be applied to the current transform.": "是否将旋转应用于当前的变换?. ",
  "Specifies the number of degrees the rotation should snap to. If set to 0, then the rotation snapping will be controlled by the rotation snapping in Hammer.": "指定旋转角度的对齐粒度. 若设为 0, 则旋转对齐将由 Hammer 中的设置来控制. ",
  "Specifies the angle the rotator should be set to initially.": "指定旋转器初始时应设置的角度. ",
  "Enforce Limits": "强制限制",
  "If enabled, the minimum and maximum rotation angles will be used to limit the range of the rotation.": "启用后, 最小和最大旋转角度将用于限定旋转范围. ",
  "Minimum Angle": "最小角度",
  "Specifies the minimum angle limit in degrees": "指定最小角度限制值(单位为度)",
  "Maximum Angle": "最大角度",
  "Specifies a float variable to which the rotation value should be output. The variable only receives the rotation around the axis, the axis of rotation does not affect this output.": "指定一个浮点数变量, 用于接收旋转值. 该变量仅存储绕轴旋转的角度值, 旋转轴本身不会影响此输出结果. ",
  "Create Rotator": "创建旋转器",
  "Create a rotator that will be displayed at the current location, allowing the user to manipulate a rotation around an axis. The rotation value can be applied to the current transform as well as saved to a variable.": "创建一个旋转控件, 该控件会显示在当前位置, 便于用户对某个轴进行旋转操作. 旋转值既可应用于当前的变换设置, 也可保存至变量中. ",
  "Save Current Scale": "保存当前缩放比例",
  "Save the current scale factor to a specified variable.": "将当前缩放比例保存到指定的变量中. ",
  "Save Current Surface Normal": "保存当前表面法线",
  "Save the current surface normal to a specified variable in the requested coordinate space": "将当前表面法线保存到指定坐标空间中的相应变量里",
  "If enabled, the rotation will be reset to a world space instead of object space, meaning any rotation applied to the object in Hammer will be ignored.": "启用后, 旋转坐标将重置为世界空间而非物体空间, 这意味着在 Hammer 中对物体所做的任何旋转设置都将被忽略. ",
  "Should the pitch (rotation around left vector) value be reset.": "是否需要重置俯仰角值(围绕左向量的旋转角度). ",
  "Should the yaw (roation around the up vector) value be reset.": "是否需要重置偏航角(绕垂直轴的旋转角度)数值. ",
  "Should the roll (rotation around forward vector) value be reset.": "是否需要重置滚动值(围绕前向轴的旋转角度). ",
  "Transform: Reset Rotation": "变换: 重置旋转",
  "Reset the current rotation such the element only inherits the object level rotation, but does not inherit the rotation applied to its parent.": "重置当前旋转设置, 使该元素仅继承对象级别的旋转属性, 而不继承其父级元素所设置的旋转属性. ",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( Variable:Color )": "智能属性名称编辑器(变量: 颜色)",
  "Save Current Color": "保存当前颜色",
  "Save the current color tint value to a specified variable": "将当前颜色色调值保存到指定的变量中",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the forward direction is being specified in": "指定用于定义正向方向的坐标空间",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the up direction is being specified in": "指定用于定义向上方向的坐标空间",
  "If the specified vectors are not orthogonal, normally the up vector will be adjusted to make it orthogonal to the forward vector. If prioritize up is true, then the forward vector will be adjusted to be orthogonal to the specified up vector instead.": "如果指定的向量不相互垂直, 通常情况下系统会调整上方向向量以使其与前进方向向量垂直. 若启用了'优先保持上方向'选项, 则会调整为使前进方向向量与指定的上方向向量垂直. ",
  "Transform: Set Orientation": "转换: 设置方向",
  "Set the current orientation from a specified forward and up vector.": "设置当前方向: 通过指定的前向向量和上方向向量来确定. ",
  "Output Variable": "输出变量",
  "Vector A": "向量 A",
  "Vector B": "矢量 B",
  "Dot Product": "点积",
  "Compute a dot or cross product between two 3D vectors": "计算两个三维向量之间的点积或叉积",
  "Compute": "计算",
  "If enabled, the object level scale will be ignored, meaning any scale applied in Hammer will have no effect on the element or its children.": "启用后, 对象级别的缩放设置将被忽略, 也就是说在 Hammer 中所做的任何缩放操作都不会对该元素及其子元素产生影响. ",
  "Transform: Reset Scale": "变换: 重置缩放",
  "Reset the current scale such the element only inherits the object level scale, but does not inherit the scale applied to its parent.": "重置当前缩放比例, 使该元素仅继承对象级别的缩放设置, 而不会继承其父级元素所设置的缩放比例. ",
  "Cross Product": "向量叉积",
  "Local space position translation to apply to the current transform": "待应用于当前变换的局部空间位置平移值",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of the specified position value.": "指定位置值所对应的坐标空间. ",
  "Transform: Set Position": "变换: 设置位置",
  "Set the position of the current transform.": "设置当前变换的位置. ",
  "Specifies the coordinate space the distance should be computed in. The scale of the coordinate space may affect the distance value.": "指定计算距离时所使用的坐标空间. 该坐标空间的缩放比例可能会影响最终的距离值. ",
  "+Position A": "+位置 A",
  "Position A": "位置 A",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of position A.": "指定位置 A 的坐标空间. ",
  "+Position B": "+位置 B",
  "Position B": "位置 B",
  "Specifies the coordinate space of position B.": "指定位置 B 的坐标空间. ",
  "Distance": "距离",
  "Compute the distance between two 3D points": "计算两个三维点之间的距离",
  "Transform: Translate": "转换: 平移",
  "Apply a position offset to the current transform.": "对当前变换应用位置偏移. ",
  "Not yet supporting SetTintColor with multiple choices": "暂不支持在多个选项中使用 SetTintColor",
  "SetNodeStaticAttribute_KV3Transfer( %s ) failed: %s": "SetNodeStaticAttribute_KV3Transfer( %s ) 执行失败: %s",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(string)": "智能属性编辑器()(string)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(MaterialGroup)": "智能属性编辑器(材质组)(MaterialGroup)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(SurfaceProperty)": "智能属性编辑器(表面属性)(SurfaceProperty)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(model)": "智能属性编辑器(模型)(model)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(material)": "智能属性编辑器(材质)(material)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(locator)": "智能属性编辑器(定位器)(locator)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(savedState)": "智能属性编辑器(已保存状态)(savedState)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(bool)": "智能属性编辑器(布尔值)(bool)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(integer)": "智能属性编辑器(整数)(integer)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(float)": "智能属性编辑器(浮点数)(float)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(vector2)": "智能属性编辑器(二维向量)(vector2)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(vector3)": "智能属性编辑器(三维向量)(vector3)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(vector4)": "智能属性编辑器(vector4)(vector4)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(color)": "智能属性编辑器(颜色)(color)",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(angles)": "智能属性编辑器(角度)(angles)",
  "Relative to Surface": "相对于曲面",
  "Snap to Surface": "吸附到表面",
  "Stiffen Overlapping Joints": "硬化重叠接合处",
  "SNAP": "快照",
  "Align Forward with Normal": "向前对齐并设为正常",
  "Align Up With Normal": "与法线对齐",
  "Align Backward with Normal": "向后对齐并设为正常对齐方式",
  "Maintain Closest Triangle Offset": "保持三角形偏移量不变",
  "Should the entity created by this element cast shadows.": "此元素创建的实体是否投射阴影. ",
  "Force Static": "强制静态模式",
  "Force this model to be placed as a static model rather then generating an entity.": "强制将此模型作为静态模型使用, 而非生成对应的实体. ",
  "Attachment Mode": "附件模式",
  "Deformable Entity Settings": "可变形实体设置",
  "If the smart prop is child of a deformable entity, this setting specifies how the entity generated by this element will be attached to the deformable surface.": "如果智能属性是可变形实体的子元素, 此设置用于指定由该元素生成的实体应如何附着到可变形表面上. ",
  "If the smart prop is child of a deformable entity, this setting specifies how the entity generated by this element will be oriented relative to the deformable surface.": "如果智能属性是可变形实体的子项, 此设置将决定由该元素生成的实体相对于可变形表面如何定向. ",
  "Should this physics prop start in a sleeping (non-simulating) state such that it won't update until it is woken up by an external event.": "该物理属性是否应初始处于'休眠'状态(即不进行模拟), 直到被外部事件唤醒后才开始更新?. ",
  "Prop Physics": "物理属性设置",
  "Places a prop physics entity.": "放置一个物理道具实体. ",
  "Prop Dynamic": "属性动态化",
  "Places a prop dynamic entity.": "放置一个动态道具实体. ",
  "Start Asleep": "开始睡眠模式",
  "Deformation Enabled": "变形功能已启用",
  "Should the deformation be applied. If disabled the children will still be placed, but will not be deformed. Esentially making the element behave as a group.": "是否应用变形效果. 若禁用此选项, 子元素仍会被放置, 但不会发生变形, 此时该元素整体上相当于一个整体来运作. ",
  "A local offset to apply to the base volume of the deformer that will not apply to its children.": "一个本地偏移量, 用于调整变形器的基准音量, 但该设置不会影响其子项. ",
  "A local rotation to apply to apply the base volume of the deformer that will not apply to its children. This can be used to alter the direction of the deformation.": "一个仅作用于变形器自身基础体积的局部旋转设置, 不会影响其子对象. 该设置可用于改变变形的方向. ",
  "Size of the base volume to be deformed.": "待变形基础体积的大小. ",
  "Bend amount to apply, specified in degrees. Bend occurs along the local x-axis and bends around the local z-axis": "要应用的弯曲角度, 以度为单位. 弯曲方向沿局部X轴, 围绕局部Z轴发生",
  "Radius of the bend. If 0 the radius will be computed automatically to preserve the length of the inner edge of the x-axis. If a non-zero value is specified then the inner edge will maintain this radius, but its length will change.": "弯曲部分的半径. 若设为0, 则会自动计算半径以保持X轴内边缘的长度不变. 若指定了非零值, 则内边缘将保持该半径, 但其长度会随之改变. ",
  "Bend Deformer": "弯曲变形器",
  "Creates a bend deformer that is applied to child elements. The deformation bends the local space x-axis around the local space z-axis. The Angles property can be used to rotate the local axis to change the direction of deformation.": "创建一个弯曲变形器并将其应用于子元素. 该变形效果会使局部空间的X轴围绕局部空间的Z轴发生弯曲. 通过'角度'属性可旋转局部坐标轴, 从而改变变形的方向. ",
  "Is this an element which should be placed at the start of the line.": "这是否为应放置在行首的元素?. ",
  "Is this an element which should be placed at the end of the line.": "这是一个应当放置在行尾的元素吗?. ",
  "End Cap Settings": "端点设置",
  "Specifies that this is a special part that should be used at the start or end of the line.": "指定该部件为特殊部件, 应置于行首或行尾使用. ",
  "+End Points": "+结束点",
  "Specifies the start point of the line in the specified coordinate space.": "指定线条在给定坐标空间中的起始点. ",
  "Specifies the end point of the line in the specified coordinate space.": "指定指定坐标空间中线段的终点. ",
  "End point space": "终点空间",
  "Specifies the coordinate space in which the end point values are specified.": "指定用于定义端点值的坐标系. ",
  "Should the child elements be oriented based on the line. If enabled the child elements placed on the line will be oriented such that their +x axis points along the line towards the end point.": "是否让子元素沿直线方向排列. 启用后, 放置在该直线上的子元素其 +x 轴方向将指向直线的终点. ",
  "Up vector which is used to determine the rotation of each element around the line.": "用于确定每个元素沿直线旋转方向的上方向向量. ",
  "Space in which the up direction is defined.": "定义向上方向的空间. ",
  "When the up direction is not orthogonal to the line direction normally the up vector will be adjusted to make it orthogonal to the line direction. If prioritize up is true, then the up direction will be maintained and the forward direction will be adjusted.": "通常, 当上方向并非与线路方向垂直时, 上向量会被调整以确保其与线路方向垂直. 若启用了'优先保持上方向'选项, 则会保留原上方向不变, 而调整前进方向. ",
  "Scale Mode": "缩放模式",
  "Specifies how scale is applied to each of the selected element in order to fit them to the line.": "指定如何将缩放比例应用于每个选中的元素, 以使其适配该线条. ",
  "Child Selection Mode": "子项选择模式",
  "Fit on Line": "适应行宽",
  "An element which fits one or more instances of a set of choices on to a line.": "一种可将一组可选选项中的一个或多个实例排列到一行中的元素. ",
  "Specifies the length of the line that will be taken up if this element is selected.": "指定选中此元素后所占用的行长度. ",
  "Can this object be scaled. If enabled the minimum and maximum lengths must be set to specify the size range of allowable scale.": "此对象是否可缩放?若启用此选项, 则需设置最小和最大长度以限定允许的缩放范围. ",
  "Minimum length": "最小长度",
  "Minimum allowable length for the object. Must be <= length. If length is 100 and minimum length is 20, then the object may be assigned a scale in the rage [ 0.2, 1.0 ].": "对象允许的最小长度. 该值必须小于等于总长度. 假如总长度为100且最小长度为20, 那么该对象的可缩放范围即为[0.2, 1.0]. ",
  "Maximum length": "最大长度",
  "Maximum allowable length for the object. Must be >= length. If length is 100 and maximum length is 160, then the object may be assigned a scale in the rage [ 1.0, 1.6 ].": "对象的最大允许长度. 该值必须大于等于实际长度. 例如, 若实际长度为100且最大允许长度为160, 则该对象可使用的缩放比例范围为[1.0, 1.6]. ",
  "Linear Length": "线性长度",
  "Specifies the length of this element, used when fitting an element on to a line.": "指定此元素的长度, 该值在将元素调整到单行显示时使用. ",
  "ConvertSelfToPulse_Criteria unimplemented (%s)": "'ConvertSelfToPulse_Criteria'功能尚未实现 (%s)",
  "Overall grid dimension along X axis.": "X轴方向上的网格总体尺寸. ",
  "Overall grid dimension along Y axis.": "沿Y轴的总体网格尺寸. ",
  "Layout length vertically (Along Z axis instead of Y).": "垂直方向的布局长度(沿Z轴而非Y轴). ",
  "ARRAY: Grid is a specific number of grid divisions. FILL: The boundary is filled with as many as will fit at the specified cell spacing.": "阵列模式: 指定网格的划分数量. 填充模式: 以设定的单元格间距在边界内尽可能多地填充内容. ",
  "Specifies the overall grid origin location. Corner origin grids default to quadrant I, but may be expressed in others using negative values for Width and/or Length.": "用于指定网格的整体原点位置. 以角点作为原点的网格默认位于第一象限, 但也可通过将宽度和/或长度设为负值来将其置于其他象限. ",
  "Grid segments along width axis.": "沿宽度轴的网格分段. ",
  "Grid segments along Length axis.": "沿长度轴分布的网格段. ",
  "Minimum Width of filled grid cells.": "填充后的网格单元格的最小宽度. ",
  "Minimum Length of filled grid cells.": "填充的网格单元格的最小数量. ",
  "Shifts every other cell row and/or column.": "每隔一行/一列的单元格都会进行位移. ",
  "Vary cell shift in X.": "调整X轴上的单元格偏移量. ",
  "Vary cell shift in Y.": "调整单元格在Y轴上的位移值. ",
  "Layout Grid": "布局网格",
  "Generates set of child instances arranged in a regular grid layout.": "生成按规则网格布局排列的子实例集合. ",
  "Start Point": "起点",
  "Endpoint of deformation region.": "变形区域的端点. ",
  "End Point": "终点/结束点",
  "Effect Size": "效果强度",
  "The distance from the line formed by the endpoints that encapsulated the deformation region.": "从包围变形区域的端点所构成的直线到该区域的距离. ",
  "Continuous Interpolation": "连续插值",
  "Enables an alternate interpolation method that doesnt deform endpoint tangents.": "启用另一种插值方法, 该方法不会使端点切线发生变形. ",
  "Midpoint Offset": "中点偏移量",
  "Offsets the center of the deformation region.": "调整变形区域的中心位置. ",
  "Midpoint Rotation": "中点旋转",
  "Rotate the center of the deformation region.": "旋转变形区域的中心. ",
  "Midpoint Scale": "中点比例",
  "Scale the center of the deformation region.": "调整变形区域的中心位置. ",
  "Adjust deformation falloff from the center of the region to the endpoints.": "调整从区域中心到端点的变形衰减效果. ",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( Variable:Vector )": "智能属性项名称编辑器(变量类型: 向量)",
  "Outputs the absolute position of the midpoint post deformation.": "输出变形后中点的绝对位置. ",
  "Midpoint Deformer": "中点变形器",
  "Soft deform the center of a volume defined by two endpoints.": "对由两个端点定义的体积区域的中心进行柔性变形. ",
  "Choice Weight": "选项权重",
  "Specifies a weighting value which affects that likelyhood of selecting this element which picking a choice.": "指定一个权重值, 该值会影响在做出选择时选中此元素的可能性. ",
  "Valid When": "生效条件",
  "Expression to evaluate to determine if this choice is currently valid.": "用于判断当前选项是否有效的表达式. ",
  "SmartPropAttributeEditor(expression)": "智能属性编辑器(表达式)(expression)",
  "Is Valid": "是否有效",
  "Specifies if this element is currently valid choice.": "指定此元素是否为当前有效的选项. ",
  "Specifies how the initial selection of a choice should be handled.": "指定初始选项的选择应如何处理. ",
  "Specific Child": "指定子项",
  "Specifies the index of the child to pick.": "指定要选择的子项的索引. ",
  "Choice Output Variable": "选择输出变量",
  "If a variable name is specified, sets the value of that variable to the index of the selected choice": "如果指定了变量名, 则将该变量的值设为所选选项的索引",
  "SmartPropItemNameEditor( Variable:Integer )": "智能属性项名称编辑器(变量: 整数)",
  "Should a control to select the specific choice be shown when this prop is placed in Hammer.": "当此属性被置于 Hammer 中时, 是否应显示用于选择特定选项的控件. ",
  "Handle Settings": "处理设置",
  "Specifies an offset in the local space of the element to apply to the configuration handle.": "指定要应用于配置手柄的、相对于元素本地空间的坐标偏移量. ",
  "Color to use to display the configuration handle.": "用于显示配置句柄的颜色. ",
  "Size of the configuration handle.": "配置句柄的大小. ",
  "Shape of the configuration handle to display.": "要显示的配置句柄形状. ",
  "Select Single Child": "选择单个子项",
  "An element which selects a single choice from its set of child choices.": "一种用于从一组子选项中选择单个选项的组件. ",
  "Unsupported feature: m_OutputChoiceVariableName (%s)": "不支持的功能: m_OutputChoiceVariableName (%s)",
  "Specifies how the positions are computed based on the radius.": "指定如何根据半径来计算位置. ",
  "Specifies the method to be used to distribute.": "指定要使用的分发方式. ",
  "0 to 1 value indicating the amout of random offset that should be applied to the reguluarly spaced positions": "一个取值范围为0到1的数值, 用于指示应施加在规则间隔位置上的随机偏移量",
  "Vector up direction of the plane of the circle. This in the local space of the current element.": "圆所在平面的向上向量. 此向量处于当前元素的局部空间中. ",
  "Minimum number of instances of this object and its children to be placed.": "可放置的此对象及其子对象的最小数量. ",
  "Maximum number of instances of this object and its children to be placed.": "可放置的此对象及其子对象的最大数量. ",
  "Inner radius from the placement position where the model can appear.": "模型可出现位置距离放置点的内部半径. ",
  "Outer radius from the placement position where the model can appear.": "模型可出现位置距放置点的最大半径. ",
  "Align the initial orientation of each placed object based on it position on the sphere or circle.": "根据物体在球体或圆形上的位置来调整其初始朝向. ",
  "Vector in the local space of the child element to be aligned with sphere or circle": "用于在子元素本地空间中与球体或圆形对齐的向量",
  "Place In Radius": "在半径范围内放置",
  "An element which places multiple instances of its child elements within a radius.": "一种可将多个子元素实例放置在指定半径范围内的元素. ",
  "Number of instances of this object and its children to be placed.": "要放置的此对象及其子对象的实例数量. ",
  "Stop When": "达到以下条件时停止",
  "Stop placing copies of the children when this expression evaluates to true.": "当此表达式的计算结果为真时, 停止创建子项的副本. ",
  "Place Multiple": "批量放置",
  "An element which places multiple instances of its child elements.": "一个用于放置多个子元素实例的容器元素. ",
  "Specifies the method to use to determine which positions this element should be placed at along the path.": "指定用于确定该元素在路径上应放置于哪些位置的方法. ",
  "Specifies the spacing between positions. For example, a value of 1 will place the element at very position, 2 every other position, 3 every third position": "指定元素之间的间隔. 例如, 设置为1时元素会出现在每个位置; 设置为2时则每隔一个位置出现一次; 设置为3时每隔两个位置出现一次",
  "Specifies an offset to use when determining the Nth position to place an element at. For example if placing at every third position with an offset of 0, an element will appear at positions 1, 4, 7, and so on. But if an offset of 2 is set instead of 0, then an element will appear at positions 3, 6, and 9 and so on.": "该参数用于指定在确定元素放置位置时的偏移量. 例如, 若每隔两个位置放置一个元素且偏移量为0, 则元素会出现在位置1、4、7等; 但若将偏移量设为2而非0, 则元素会出现在位置3、6、9等. ",
  "Should this element be placed at the first positions on the path": "是否应将此元素置于路径的首个位置",
  "Should this element be placed at the last positions on the path": "是否应将此元素置于路径的最后一个位置",
  "Valid Path Positions": "有效的路径位置",
  "Specifies the path positions at which this element may appear.": "指定此元素可以出现的路径位置. ",
  "Name of the path to use. This path name will show up in the property editor when selecting a placement of this smart prop in Hammer, allowing selection of a path object in the map to use.": "要使用的路径名称. 在 Hammer 中为该智能道具选择放置位置时, 此路径名称会显示在属性编辑器中, 便于从地图中选取所需的路径对象. ",
  "Spacing between points on the path": "路径上各点之间的间距",
  "Offset from the start of the path to place the first point.": "从路径起点开始计算, 放置第一个点的位置偏移量. ",
  "Offset from path": "路径偏移量",
  "Offset to apply to the path, specifies a horizontal and vertical offset to apply relative to the up direction.": "要应用到路径的偏移量, 用于指定相对于朝上方向的水平与垂直偏移值. ",
  "Path Evaluation Space": "路径评估区域",
  "If true, treat the specified up direction as fixed up direction to apply to all elements placed on the path. If false the up direction is just an initial direction.": "若设为 true, 则将指定的向上方向视为固定向上方向并应用于路径上所有元素; 若设为 false, 则该向上方向仅作为初始方向使用. ",
  "Compute the spacing distance in the 2d plane defined by the up direction. Most useful when using a fixed up direction, if maintaining a distance in the 2d plane is more important than maintaing distance along the path.": "计算由'上方向'所定义的二维平面内的间距距离. 此方法在使用固定的上方向时尤为实用; 此时在二维平面上保持距离的重要性要高于沿路径保持距离. ",
  "If not using a fixed up direction, provides an initial up direction which will be used to determine the orientation of first element on the path, after that the elements will incrementally update to follow the path and may not match this direction. If Use Fixed Up direction is specified, then all elements will use this direction to deterime their up direction.": "若不设置固定的向上方向, 则系统会指定一个初始向上方向用于确定路径上第一个元素的方向; 此后各元素会逐步调整以贴合路径走向, 但未必始终保持该方向. 若已指定'使用固定的向上方向', 则所有元素都会以此方向作为自身的向上方向. ",
  "Default Path In World Space": "世界空间中的默认路径",
  "If enabled, the default path values will be treated as world space values, if disabled they are treated as object space values. Typically it makes sense for literal values to be treated as being in object space, but if the values are being supplied by locators they will typically be in world space.": "启用后, 默认路径值将被视为世界空间值; 禁用后则被视为对象空间值. 通常来说, 字面量值应视为对象空间值, 但如果这些值是由定位器提供的, 则它们通常属于世界空间值. ",
  "A set of points defining a path to use when an external path isn't specified. This will be used in the preview and thumbnail for the smart prop. It will also be used when the smart prop is placed in Hammer before a path is selected.": "当未指定外部路径时, 此点集将用于定义路径. 该路径会用于智能道具的预览及缩略图显示. 此外, 在尚未选择路径的情况下将智能道具放置到 Hammer 中时, 也会使用此路径. ",
  "Place on Path": "置于路径上",
  "An element which places an instance of its child elements at a specified interval along a path.": "该元素可按照指定间距, 在路径上依次放置其子元素的实例. ",
  "Target material name.": "目标材质名称. ",
  "When true, discard faces with matching material.": "设为 true 时, 将忽略材质相同的面. ",
  "Filter Faces By Material": "按材质筛选面部",
  "Angle at closed edge of face.": "面闭合边缘处的角度. ",
  "When true, discard edges within the angle threshold.": "设为 true 时, 将角度阈值范围内的边缘予以丢弃. ",
  "Filter Edges by Angle": "按角度过滤边",
  "Orientation Mode": "方向模式",
  "Determine how child elements are oriented when mapped to face.": "确定子元素在映射到表面时的排列方式. ",
  "Place on Mesh": "放置在网格上",
  "Place Children on Mesh Components.": "将子对象放置到网格组件上. ",
  "Target Vertex Count": "目标顶点数量",
  "Iterate through faces with target vertex count.": "遍历顶点数量符合要求的面部. ",
  "Filter Faces By Vertex Count": "按顶点数量过滤面部",
  "Edge Count": "边数量",
  "Iterate through faces with 'n' open edges (edges with only one neighboring face).": "遍历那些拥有'n'条开放边(即仅与一个面相邻的边)的面. ",
  "Use Closed Edges": "使用闭合边缘",
  "When true, we only consider closed edges (edges with exactly two neighboring faces).": "设为 true 时, 我们仅考虑闭合边(即恰好有两个相邻面的边). ",
  "Enforce Shared Vert": "强制使用共享顶点",
  "When true, only consider open/closed edges that share a vert with another open/closed edge.": "设为 true 时, 仅考虑那些与另一条开放/封闭边缘共享顶点的开放/封闭边缘. ",
  "Filter Faces By Open Edges": "按开放边缘筛选面部",
  "Add Model": "添加模型",
  "Whether to continue executing": "是否继续执行",
  "0.0 to 1.0 value indicating the probability of this element being evaluated. Where a value of 0 means the element will never be evaluated and 1.0 means it will always be evaluated": "这是一个取值范围为0.0到1.0的数值, 用于表示该元素被评估的概率. 其中0表示该元素永远不会被评估, 而1.0则表示它必定会被评估",
  "Minimum slope on which the target will be placed. Slope is a [ 0, 180 ] value of the surface normal rotation from up such that 0 is a horizontal surface (floor), 90 is a vertical surface (wall), 180 is horizontal upside down surface (ceiling).": "目标物体可被放置的最小坡度值. 该坡度值的取值范围为 [0, 180], 表示表面法线相对于垂直向上方向的旋转角度: 0 表示水平表面(地面), 90 表示垂直表面(墙壁), 180 表示倒置的水平表面(天花板). ",
  "Maximum slope on which the target will be placed.": "目标可放置的最大坡度. ",
  "Filter downstream elements based on a true/false condition": "根据真/假条件筛选下游元素",
  "Filter Probability": "过滤概率",
  "Filter downstream elements based on a specified random probability": "根据指定的随机概率来过滤下游元素",
  "Filter Surface Angle": "筛选表面角度",
  "Filter downstream elements based on the current surface angle. The surface angle is set based on the initial placement of the smart prop object, but can also be updated by the Trace to Surface modifier.": "根据当前表面角度来过滤下游元素. 该表面角度是根据智能道具对象的初始放置位置设定的, 但也可通过'贴合表面'修饰器进行更新. ",
  "Do not trace against any cable objects.": "请勿对任何电缆对象进行追踪. ",
  "Reset Scale": "重置缩放比例",
  "Set Position": "设置位置",
  "Random Offset": "随机偏移量",
  "Random Rotation": "随机旋转",
  "Random Scale": "随机缩放",
  "Trace In Direction": "追踪方向",
  "Set Tint Color": "设置色调颜色",
  "Change the color tint based on the specified apply mode.": "根据指定的应用模式来更改颜色色调. ",
  "Clear Material Overrides": "清除材质覆盖设置",
  "Clear any previous material overrides.": "清除所有先前设置的材料覆盖项. ",
  "Add Material Override": "添加材质覆盖",
  "Specifies a material replacement to apply to all following models. Mapping goes from the material specified by the model( including material group selection ) to the replacement material. Previous material overrides are not considered when determining the base material.": "指定一个材质替换项, 该替换项将应用于其后所有的模型. 映射关系为: 从模型指定的材质(包括所选的材质组)对应到替换材质. 在确定基础材质时, 先前的材质覆盖设置不会被纳入考量. ",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Min X": "HAC K 提供结果最小值 X",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Max X": "HAC K: 提供结果最大X值",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Min Y": "HAC K 提供结果最小Y值",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Max Y": "HAC K: 提供结果的最大Y值",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Min Z": "HAC K: 提供结果最小值 Z",
  "HAC K  Provide Result Max Z": "HAC K: 输出结果的最大 Z 值",
  "Handle Shape": "处理形状",
  "PlaceInSphere Parent Cursor": "置于球体内的父级光标",
  "Place On Path": "置于路径上",
  "Path Name": "路径名称",
  "Instance Count": "实例数量",
  "Instance Index": "实例索引",
  "Evaluation Depth": "评估深度",
  "Max Evaluation Depth": "最大评估深度",
  "Linear Scale": "线性比例",
  "Line Length": "行长度",
  "Random Int": "随机整数",
  "Experimental - please ignore": "实验功能 - 请忽略",
  "Called to invoke the graph": "调用以执行图形处理",
  "Evaluate": "评估",
  "Filter: Probability": "筛选条件: 概率",
  "Causes the parent element to only be evaluated with a specified random probability.": "使父元素仅以指定的随机概率被评估. ",
  "Filter: Surface Angles": "筛选条件: 表面角度",
  "Allows the parent element to be conditionally evaluated base on the current surface angle. The surface angle is set based on the initial placement of the smart prop object, but can also be updated by the Trace to Surface modifier.": "该功能允许根据当前表面角度有条件地计算父元素的状态. 表面角度由智能属性对象的初始放置位置决定, 但也可通过'追踪至表面'修改器进行更新. ",
  "Filter: Variable Value": "筛选条件: 变量值",
  "Compares the current value of a variable to the specified value. If the comparison is false the element evaluation is stopped.": "将变量的当前值与指定值进行比较. 如果比较结果为假, 则停止对该元素的后续处理. ",
  "Filter: Expression": "筛选器: 表达式",
  "Evaluates the specified expression, if the result of the expression is false evaluation of the element is stopped.": "计算指定的表达式; 若该表达式的结果为假, 则停止对该元素的后续处理. ",
  "List of surface properties on which this element is valid. If empty element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素适用的表面属性列表. 若为空, 则表示该元素不受任何特定表面的限制. ",
  "List of surface properties on which this element is not valid. If empty element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素不可使用的表面属性列表. 若列表为空, 则表示该元素不受任何特定表面的限制. ",
  "Filter: Surface Properties": "筛选条件: 表面属性",
  "Allows the parent element to be conditionally evaluated based on surface properties.": "允许根据表面属性有条件地对父元素进行求值. ",
  "List of material attributes on which this element is valid. If empty, the element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素适用的材质属性列表. 若为空, 则表示该元素不受任何特定表面的限制. ",
  "List of material attributes on which this element is not valid. If empty, the element is not restricted to any specific surfaces.": "此元素不可应用于的材质属性列表. 若列表为空, 则表示该元素不受任何特定材质的限制. ",
  "Filter: Material Attributes": "筛选器: 材质属性",
  "Allows the parent element to be conditionally evaluated based on attributes assigned to the surface material.": "允许根据表面材质的属性有条件地对父元素进行评估. ",
