  "Resource File": "资源文件",
  "Note: This is the list of currently-resident sound events, and may differ set of events available during a running game.": "注意: 此列表显示了当前已加载的音效事件, 实际运行游戏时可用的事件列表可能与此有所不同. ",
  "WARNING: You have tools audio muted. Sounds will not be audible in tools outside this dialog.": "警告: 您的工具音频已被静音. 在此对话框之外的工具中将听不到任何声音. ",
  "Pick Sound Event": "选择声音事件",
  "Pick VSound": "选择 VSound",
  "Note: The soundevent you've selected is not in this games mod. You'll need to copy it into this mod at some point.": "注意: 您选择的音效事件并不存在于该游戏的模组里. 您需要在后续将其复制到该模组中. ",
  "Duplicate or Reference selected soundevent": "复制或引用所选的声音事件",
  "Reference": "参考",
  "Copy Sound Event": "复制音效事件",
  "Unable to fine manifest \"soundevents/soundevents_manifest.vrman\" which is required, please investigate!": "无法找到必需的清单文件'soundevents/soundevents_manifest.vrman', 请查究原因! ",
  "Create New Sound Event": "创建新的声音事件",
  "Collapse from multi-value / range to single": "从多值/范围折叠为单个值",
  "Expand to multi-value / range": "扩展为多值/范围",
  "This value is locked from editing by default. Click to unlock and manually edit.": "此值默认处于锁定状态, 无法编辑. 点击即可解锁并手动编辑. ",
  "Game Tool Images (*.png;*.ico;*.jpg)": "游戏工具图片 (*.png;*.ico;*.jpg)",
  "AnimGraph enum '%s'": "动画图枚举值'%s'",
  "Hitbox Set": "碰撞区域设置",
  "Breakpiece": "断裂件",
  "AnimGraph Tag": "动画图标签",
  "Specifies the number of props placed per square foot.": "指定每平方英尺内放置的道具数量. ",
  "Detail Prop Type": "详细属性类型",
  "Model to be displayed.": "待显示的模型. ",
  "Material group (skin) to assign to use with the model.": "要分配给模型使用的材质组(表皮). ",
  "A weight determining the frequency at which this model is placed relative to other models within the detail type. The weights of all models are summed and the probability of selecting this model is its weight divided by the sum weight.": "该权重用于决定在当前详情类型中, 此模型被选中的频率. 所有模型的权重相加后, 选中此模型的概率即为其权重除以总权重. ",
  "Start fade out size": "起始淡出大小",
  "Screen space size [ 0, 1 ] (where 1 is the whole screen) at which the model will begin to to fade out. Anything larger will be fully visible, anything smaller will start to fade out.": "模型开始逐渐淡出的屏幕空间尺寸范围: [0, 1](其中 1 表示整块屏幕). 超出此范围的值对应的模型将完全可见, 小于此范围的值则开始淡出. ",
  "Complete fade out size": "完成淡出效果的大小",
  "Screen space size [ 0, 1 ] (where 1 is the whole screen) at which the model will be completely faded out. Anything smaller than this size will not be visible, anything larger will start fading in.": "模型完全淡出时的屏幕空间尺寸范围在 [0, 1] 之间(其中 1 代表整个屏幕). 低于此尺寸时模型将不可见, 高于此尺寸时则会逐渐显现. ",
  "Use World Space Up": "使用世界空间上方向",
  "If enabled, the up direction will be evaluated in world space, such that the object orientation does not affect the surface slope filtering. Additionally if Orient To Surface is 0, then and world space up is enabled, then the object orientation will not affect the rotation of detail model.": "启用后, 上方向将在世界空间中进行计算, 这样对象的方向便不会影响表面斜率过滤. 此外, 若'朝向表面'设置为0且'世界空间上方向'也已启用, 则对象的方向也不会影响细节模型的旋转. ",
  "Value indicating if the model's up direction should be matched to the surface. Value should be in the [ 0, 1 ] range, where 0 means that the model up will be model (or object space) up and will ignore the surface direction, and 1 indicates that the model up will exactly match the surface normal.": "该值用于指示是否将模型的上方向与曲面方向对齐. 该值的有效范围为 [0, 1]: 其中 0 表示使用模型自身的上方向(即对象空间中的上方向), 此时忽略曲面方向; 1 则表示模型的上方向需与曲面法线完全一致. ",
  "Minimum slope on which the target will be placed. Slope is a [ 0, 180 ] value based on the surface normal where horizontal surface (floor) is 0, vertical surface (wall) is 90, and a horizontal upside down surface (ceiling) is 180.": "目标可放置区域的最小倾斜角度. 该角度的取值范围为 [0, 180], 以表面法线为基准: 水平表面(地面)为 0, 垂直表面(墙面)为 90, 倒置的水平表面(天花板)则为 180. ",
  "Minimum range of random offset to apply along the model's local up direction": "沿模型局部向上方向应用的随机偏移的最小范围",
  "Maximum range of random offset to apply along the model's local up direction": "沿模型自身向上方向应用的随机偏移的最大范围",
  "Minimum range of the random rotation to apply the model. Random rotation is applied in the local space of the model. Rotation values are ordered pitch, yaw, roll.": "应用于模型的随机旋转的最小范围. 随机旋转是在模型的局部空间中进行的. 旋转值依次为俯仰角、偏航角和滚转角. ",
  "Maximum range of the random rotation to apply the model.": "应用于模型的随机旋转的最大范围. ",
  "Minimum random scale value to apply to the model.": "应用于模型的最小随机缩放值. ",
  "Maximum random scale value to apply to the model.": "可应用于模型的随机缩放值上限. ",
  "Density Scale": "密度比例",
  "Minimum scale to apply to the model based the painted detail prop density. The minimum of the detail and blend weight scale values is multiplied with the random scale value to determine the final scale.": "根据绘制的细节道具密度来设定模型的最小缩放比例. 最终缩放值由'细节缩放值'与'混合权重缩放值'中的较小值, 再乘以随机缩放值后得到. ",
  "Blend Weight Scale": "混合权重比例",
  "Min Blend Weight": "最小混合权重",
  "Minimum blend weight value for which the model will be placed. If the blend weight value is less than this value, the model will not be placed.": "模型被放置所需的最低混合权重值. 若实际混合权重值低于此数值, 则模型将不会被放置. ",
  "Max Blend Weight": "最大混合权重",
  "Maximum blend weight value for which the model will be placed. If the blend weight value is more than this value, the model will not be placed.": "模型可被放置时所允许的最大混合权重值. 若实际混合权重值超过此数值, 则模型将无法被放置. ",
  "Full Density Blend Weight": "完全密度混合权重",
  "Blend weight at which the model will be at full density. Must be between the minimum and maximum blend weight values. The density of this model placement will increase with the blend weight value up to this value at which point it will be at full density.": "模型达到最大密度时所对应的混合权重值. 该值必须介于最小与最大混合权重值之间. 随着混合权重值的提升, 该模型出现的密度也会随之增加, 直至达到此数值时才呈现最大密度. ",
  "Should instances of this model generate shadows in the lightmap. Note that shadows in the light map will persist even after the model fades out.": "是否让该模型的实例在光照贴图中生成阴影. 请注意, 即便模型已不可见, 其阴影仍会保留在光照贴图中. ",
  "Filter Part": "筛选部件",
  "Search:": "搜索: ",
  "Select a part to add to the filter": "选择要添加到过滤器的部件",
  "Matches part of a name": "匹配姓名的一部分",
  "Name Contains": "名称包含",
  "A compound list that requires all its parts to match": "一个复合列表, 要求其中所有组成部分都必须匹配",
  "AND List": "与运算列表",
  "A compound list that matches if any parts matches": "一个复合列表, 只要其中任意部分匹配即视为匹配",
  "OR List": "或列表",
  "= (During)": "=(期间) (During)",
  "!= (Not During)": "!=(不在指定时段内) (Not During)",
  "< (Before)": "<(之前) (Before)",
  "> (After)": "> (之后) (After)",
  "<= (Before)": "<=(之前) (Before)",
  ">= (After)": "大于等于(之后) (After)",
  "Enable date range": "启用日期范围",
  "Add another filter criteria": "添加另一个筛选条件",
  "Completer Settings": "完成器设置",
  "Never": "从不",
  "Values Only": "仅显示值",
  "Always": "始终",
  "Show All Keys": "显示所有密钥",
  "Automatic Popup": "自动弹出",
  "UpdateCompleterDataModelstime: %.4fms": "更新Completer数据模型耗时: %.4f毫秒",
  "Reveal in Surface Property Editor": "在表面属性编辑器中显示",
  "Click to browse choices": "点击以浏览选项",
  "The VData file to read": "待读取的 VData 文件",
  "The key whose value must match the asset name (ie. something like 'm_Model' if you want to apply this tag to .vmdl assets that are referenced by the vdata file)": "该键的值必须与资源名称完全匹配(例如: 若需将此标签应用于 vdata 文件所引用的 .vmdl 资源, 则键值应设为 'm_Model')",
  "Optional second key to check": "可选的第二个待验证密钥",
  "User-facing tag name": "面向用户的标签名称",
  "User-facing description of the tag": "面向用户的标签说明",
  "Icon associated with the tag": "与标签关联的图标",
  "ToolImage( 16 )": "工具图标( 16 )",
  "Color for the tag badge": "标签徽章的颜色",
  "Alternate strings this tag will match when searching for assets by name.": "此标签在按名称搜索资源时可匹配的其他字符串. ",
  "If set, draw this as an overlay image on the asset preview": "若勾选此选项, 则会将该图像作为覆盖层绘制在资源预览上",
  "ToolImage( 64 )": "工具图标( 64 )",
  "If set, the presence of this tag will cause the tools to suppress or dissuade use in several ways (and draw a red X over the asset preview)": "若设置了此标签, 则工具会以多种方式阻止或劝诫用户使用该资源(并会在资源预览图上标注红色叉号) (and draw a red X over the asset preview)",
  "If set, the presence of this tag will cause the tools to hide the asset from users by default. NOTE: This means if an asset gets tagged with this it might 'dissapear' from the UI!": "若设置了此标签, 工具便会默认对用户隐藏该资源. 注意: 这意味着一旦资源被标记为此标签, 它可能会在用户界面上'消失'! ",
  "+Auto Tags": "+自动标签",
  "Required for any auto-tag. Restricts the auto-application of this tag to a specific asset type (string from assettypes_common.txt like 'material_asset' or 'model_asset')": "此设置对于任何自动标记功能都是必需的. 它能将该标记的自动应用范围限定为特定的资源类型(即 assettypes_common.txt 中定义的类型, 如 'material_asset' 或 'model_asset')",
  "Set this to automatically apply this tag based on an asset filter string. (NOTE: Auto tag names MUST start with an '@' character!)": "将其设为自动模式, 即可根据资源过滤字符串自动应用该标签. (注意: 自动标签的名称必须以'@'字符开头! )",
  "Set this to automatically apply this tag to assets based on references from a VData file. (NOTE: Auto tag names MUST start with an '@' character!)": "将此选项设为启用后, 系统会根据 VData 文件中的引用信息自动为该资源添加标签. (注意: 自动标签的名称必须以'@'字符开头! )",
  "Skipping disallowed entity class: %s": "正在跳过不允许使用的实体类: %s",
  "Skipping disallowed VMF: %s": "正在跳过不允许使用的 VMF: %s",
  "Found 3D Skybox reference VMF: %s, adding skybox_reference to main map and fixing up.": "找到 3D 天空盒引用文件 VMF: %s, 正在将 skybox_reference 添加到主地图并进行修正. ",
  "RelativePathToFullPath failed for %s": "对 %s 执行 RelativePathToFullPath 时失败",
  "Failed to construct map document from provided vmf data.": "无法根据提供的 VMF 数据构建地图文档. ",
  "CVMFtoVMAP: Missing a required top-level key.": "CVMFtoVMAP: 缺少必需的顶层键. ",
  "Missing value %s under key %s": "缺少键  下的值 %s",
  "Value %s under key %s contains the wrong number of numbers": "键 %s 对应的值 %s 中包含的数字数量不正确",
  "Warning: Didn't rename entity key '%s' to '%s' because the new key was already present (class '%s')": "警告: 未能将实体键'%s'重命名为'%s', 因为新键已存在(类名为'%s')",
  "Negated": "已取反",
  "Allow entities that match criteria": "允许符合条件的实体",
  "Error unable to find studio model \"%s\" in \"SOURCE_1_EXPORT_CONTENT_PATH_ID\" referred to by %s!": "错误: 无法在 %s 引用的 'SOURCE_1_EXPORT_CONTENT_PATH_ID' 中找到工作室模型 '%s'! ",
  "Error loading studio model \"%s\" referred to by %s!": "加载由 %s 引用的工作室模型 '%s' 时发生错误! ",
  "Source1 env_tonemap_controller input \"BlendTonemapScale\" does not map to a Source2 input": "源1中 env_tonemap_controller 的输入项'BlendTonemapScale'无法对应到源2中的任何输入项",
  "-%d -%d -%d": "-%d -%d -%d",
  "Source1 env_fog_controller input \"%s\" does not map to a Source2 input": "源1中的 env_fog_controller 输入值'%s'无法对应到源2中的任何输入项",
  "file": "文件",
  "Unable to find instance map file %s": "无法找到实例映射文件 %s",
  "Already processed master color_correction entity, ignoring additional master color_correction entity.": "主颜色校正实体已处理过, 现忽略后续出现的相同实体. ",
  "Unable to load Source1 colorcorrection RAW image %s": "无法加载 Source1 色彩校正用 RAW 图像 %s",
  "Serialization failure: %s": "序列化失败: %s",
  "More than one env_tonemap_controller found, ignoring this one and assuming first one found is the master.": "发现多个 env_tonemap_controller, 将忽略当前这个, 并使用第一个找到的作为主控制器. ",
  "Conversion of entity I/O \"%s( %s )\" for entity target classes \"%s\" and \"%s\" sharing target name \"%s\" did not agree on the conversion result": "实体 I/O '%s( %s )'针对目标实体类 '%s' 和 '%s'(二者具有相同的目标名称 '%s')的转换结果不一致",
