  "Warning: Add import support? P4CopyFile of file not in leafiest mod %s": "警告: 是否添加导入支持?试图复制不属于最底层模组 %s 的文件 P4CopyFile",
  "File %s will not get added to p4": "文件 %s 将无法添加到 p4 中",
  "This can occur if the case of the file or directory was changed in p4 after the initial source 1 sync in the clientspec.": "这种情况可能发生在: 在客户端配置中初次执行源码同步后, 又在 Perforce 中更改了文件或目录的名称大小写. ",
  "The file you have in source 1 has the old (mixed?) case path and is still on your disk.": "您在源位置1中的文件仍使用旧版的大小写混用路径, 且该文件仍存在于您的磁盘上. ",
  "Recommend delete and force sync the offending dirs/files to correct the path case.": "建议删除并强制同步出现问题的目录/文件, 以修正路径大小写问题. ",
  "Can't copy to target path with files already open": "无法将文件复制到目标路径, 因为有文件仍处于打开状态",
  "Cmd: g_pP4->OpenFileForCopy( \"%s\", \"%s\" )!": "命令: g_pP4->OpenFileForCopy( \"%s\", \"%s\" )! ",
  "P4 WARNING calling g_pP4->OpenFileForCopy( \"%s\", \"%s\" )!": "P4 警告: 调用 g_pP4->OpenFileForCopy( \"%s\", \"%s\" ) 时出现问题! ",
  "P4 WARNING: %s": "P4 警告: %s",
  "+- Wrote file %s (Copied from %s)": "+- 已写入文件 %s(复制自 %s)",
  "Adding Search Path %s %s": "正在添加搜索路径 %s %s",
  "Unable to load source 1 mod gameinfo.txt! %s": "无法加载源1的mod游戏信息文件! %s",
  "Unable to find 'FileSystem' key in source 1 mod gaminfo.txt!": "无法在源文件1的gaminfo.txt中找到'FileSystem'键! ",
  "Unable to find mod searchpaths in source 1 mod gaminfo.txt!": "无法在源1的mod gaminfo.txt文件中找到mod搜索路径! ",
  "Failed to map from %s to game-path. Note this is ok for the dota localization import.": "无法将 %s 映射为游戏路径. 请注意, 对于 Dota 本地化导入而言这是可以接受的. ",
  "CheckIfIdenticalFileIsHigherInPath: need absolute path for file %s": "CheckIfIdenticalFileIsHigherInPath: 需要文件 %s 的绝对路径",
  "CheckIfIdenticalFileIsInHigherPath: found imported file \"%s\" in the imported dir that does not match the file %s. If this happens there is a bug!": "检查较高路径中是否存在相同文件时: 在导入目录中发现了导入文件'%s', 但该文件与文件 %s 并不匹配. 出现这种情况说明存在程序错误! ",
  "Warning found identical imported file \"%s\" at different location %s. But it is not in perforce! You should remove this file.": "警告: 发现相同的导入文件'%s'出现在不同位置 %s. 但该文件在 Perforce 中并不存在! 您应当删除此文件. ",
  "Warning found identical imported file \"%s\" at different location %s. Opening for delete.": "警告: 发现相同的导入文件'%s'出现在不同的位置 %s. 现正打开以供删除. ",
  "GenerateSource2Filename: requires source and dest paths to convert absolute path for source 1 filename!": "生成Source2文件名: 需要提供源路径与目标路径, 才能转换源文件名的绝对路径! ",
  "GenerateDestFileNameAndMakeDir: requires absolute path for source 1 filename!": "GenerateDestFileNameAndMakeDir: 必须为源文件1提供绝对路径! ",
