  "Path Length": "路径长度",
  "Speed": "速度",
  "The time value at which the camera frustum will be drawn when the camera path is selected. Adjusting this will update the path parameter.": "当选中相机路径后, 用于确定相机视锥体绘制时间的数值. 调整此值将同步更新路径参数. ",
  "Field of view. Edit on the path nodes. This previews the current FOV as computed from the path nodes and the current preview parameter.": "视角范围. 可在路径节点上进行编辑. 此预览会显示根据路径节点及当前预览参数计算得出的视角范围. ",
  "A 0 to 1 parameter value of the path at which the camera frustum will be drawn when the camera path is selected. Adjusting this will update the time.": "当选中相机路径后, 此参数值用于设定绘制相机视锥体的路径位置, 取值范围为 0 到 1. 调整该值会相应更新时间. ",
  "Time": "时间",
  "Automatically advance Preview Time until the end of the path is reached. Disabling will pause. If the end of the path has been reached, enabling will reset time to 0.": "自动将预览时间向前推进直至到达路径终点. 禁用后则会暂停. 若已到达路径终点, 重新启用后会将时间重置为0. ",
  "Path Parameter": "路径参数",
  "Shows the current actual duration of the path.  For a constant speed path it is equal to Duration.  For a non-constant speed path, it is computed from all of the speed and ease in/out values on the individual nodes.": "显示当前路径的实际持续时间. 对于速度恒定的路径, 该值与'持续时间'相等; 对于速度非恒定的路径, 该值则是根据各个节点上的速度及缓入/缓出数值计算得出. ",
