  "Joint must be aligned along X axis with the line of the joint chain, old ropes cannot handle misaligned chains. %s misaligned by %.1f degrees off of %s. Please use twist_relax in the whole system.": "关节必须沿 X 轴与关节链的直线对齐, 旧版绳索无法适应未对齐的关节链. %s 的位置偏离了 %s 所在直线, 偏差角度为 %.1f 度. 请在整个系统中使用 twist_relax 功能. ",
  "Forward axis may be x,y,z or empty (default is X). No other values are permitted.": "前向轴可设置为 x、y、z 或留空(默认值为 X). 其他值均不被允许. ",
