  "+Import Options": "+导入选项",
  "Specify the import start frame (0 or a negative value means use the first frame in the authored animation)": "请指定导入的起始帧(输入0或负值则表示使用原动画中的第一帧) (0 or a negative value means use the first frame in the authored animation)",
  "Specify the import end frame (0 or a negative value means use the last frame in the authored animation)": "请指定导入的结束帧(输入0或负值则表示使用原动画中的最后一帧) (0 or a negative value means use the last frame in the authored animation)",
  "Override the final duration of this clip in seconds (0 or a negative value means use the authored duration)": "可手动指定此片段的最终时长(单位: 秒). 若设置为0或负值, 则使用原始设定的时长.  (0 or a negative value means use the authored duration)",
  "The source file to use as the base of the additive": "用作叠加操作基准的源文件",
  "The frame to use when generating an additive, if you are generating relative to another animation and this is set to -1, we will extract each frame from it's corresponding frame in the base anim": "生成叠加帧时所使用的帧序列; 若您是基于另一动画进行生成且此值设为 -1, 系统会从基础动画中对应帧的位置提取各帧",
