  "On FBX export, specify the units to export in or specify a custom scale factor.": "在导出 FBX 文件时, 请指定要使用的导出单位或自定义比例因子. ",
  "Exclude bones and their children from export if they have exactly the specified bone flags with no other flags set. Skeleton Only export.": "如果骨骼及其子级仅设置了指定的骨骼标志且未设置其他标志, 则将其从导出内容中排除. 仅导出骨架. ",
  "Exports in a binary format if true, otherwise exports in a text format if possible.": "设为 true 则以二进制格式导出, 否则在可能的情况下以文本格式导出. ",
  "Exclude bones and their children from export if they have the specified bone flags.  Other flags may be set.  Skeleton Only export.": "如果骨骼具有指定的标志, 则将其及其子骨骼排除在导出范围之外. 也可设置其他标志. 仅导出骨架. ",
