  "Find": "搜索",
  "Value to search for in string attributes, can be a regular expression if specified below.": "要在字符串属性中搜索的值, 若下方已指定则可使用正则表达式. ",
  "The first match of the find string will be replaced with this.  No regular expression match syntax, just a string.": "查找字符串首次出现的位置将被此处的内容替换. 不支持正则表达式语法, 只需输入普通字符串即可. ",
