  "Delete Selected Items From Find List": "从查找列表中删除选中的项目",
  "Find and preview the changes, must be run before any Replace can be done.": "查找并预览所有更改, 此操作必须在执行任何替换操作之前运行. ",
  "Replace all of the matches shown above.  Changes are undoable via the normal ModelDoc undo system.": "替换上述所有匹配项. 这些更改可通过 ModelDoc 的常规撤销功能予以撤销. ",
