  "Set the physics joint anchor transform to match that of the child body (in the parent body frame)": "将物理关节的锚点变换设置为与子刚体的锚点变换一致(以父刚体坐标系为基准) (in the parent body frame)",
  "Set Joint Anchor to Child": "设置关节锚点为子对象",
  "Flip parent and child bodies of this physics joint (without affecting the anchor.)": "翻转此物理关节的父物体与子物体(不会改变锚点位置)",
