  "New Parent Body": "新建父主体",
  "Pick new parent body for the joint:": "为关节选择新的父身体: ",
  "Change joint parent while maintaining anchor absolute transform.": "在保持锚点绝对变换不变的前提下更改关节的父级. ",
  "Reparent Joint Maintaining Anchor": "重新设置关节父级并保持锚点不变",
  "Align the revolute physics joint to bone alignment down +X if VALVe aligned skeleton": "若使用 VALVe 对齐方式的骨骼系统, 请将旋转物理关节沿 +X 轴方向与骨骼对齐",
