  "Pick new parent bone for the attachment:": "为附着点选择新的父骨骼: ",
  "Change attachment parent while maintaining current absolute transform.": "在保持当前绝对变换属性的前提下更改附件的父级. ",
  "Reparent Attachment": "重新设置附件的父级",
  "Change hitbox parent while maintaining current absolute hitbox for sphere and capsule hitboxes.": "在保持球体与胶囊体碰撞体的当前绝对尺寸不变的前提下, 更改其父级碰撞体. ",
  "Reparent Hitbox": "重新设置碰撞盒父级",
  "Pick new parent bone for the hitbox:": "请选择用于碰撞体的新父骨骼: ",
  "Shift the selected anim events by a specific number of frames": "将选定的动画事件按指定帧数进行偏移",
  "Frame Shift:": "帧偏移: ",
  "Shift AnimEvents": "切换动画事件",
  "Stop Selected Cloth Effect": "停止选中的布料效果",
  "Stop Cloth Effect": "停止布料效果",
  "Allow Hits on Frame One": "允许在第一帧触发命中检测",
  "Allow hits to be detected on the first frame. By default hits are not detected on the first frame. The default is for standing and standing starts. This is used for loops with hits on frame one.": "允许在第一帧检测命中. 默认情况下, 第一帧不会检测命中. 此设置适用于站立及起始站立状态. 它主要用于那些在第一帧就需要检测命中的循环动作. ",
  "Remove Existing Events": "移除现有事件",
  "Removes any existing animevents from the animation that are of the same class (eg. AE_FOOTSTEP) of the new events we create": "移除动画中那些与我们新创建的事件属于同一类(例如 AE_FOOTSTEP)的所有现有动画事件",
  "Debug Draw": "调试绘制",
  "Whether to draw a 3d debug visualization of analysis (debug draw persists until next invocation of this wizard)": "是否绘制分析的 3D 调试可视化效果(调试绘制内容会一直保留, 直至下次调用此向导) (debug draw persists until next invocation of this wizard)",
  "Missing ankle bone '%s' in animation data": "动画数据中缺少脚踝骨骼'%s'",
  "Not enough frames for analysis: %d": "可用于分析的帧数不足: %d",
  "%4s %5s [ Frame %4d ] - Lin = %8.2f Ang = %8.2f": "%4s %5s [ 帧 %4d ] - 线长 = %8.2f 角度 = %8.2f",
  "Motion Analysis": "运动分析",
  "Perform an analysis of the current compiled data for the selected animation(s) and auto-create footstep events": "对所选动画的当前编译数据进行分析, 并自动创建脚步事件",
  "No file: %1": "无文件: %1",
  "Bad Settings": "设置有误",
  "No entries in file: %1": "文件中无任何条目: %1",
  "Analysis Settings": "分析设置",
  "Select analysis settings:": "选择分析设置: ",
  "Reveal Settings in VDATA Editor": "在 VDATA 编辑器中显示设置",
  "Sensitivity:": "灵敏度: ",
  "How sensitive the setting thresholds for 'stationary' should be - a value of 1 means use the vdata settings directly.": "'静止状态'判定阈值的灵敏程度 - 值为1表示直接使用vdata设置. ",
  "Frame Window:": "框架窗口: ",
  "How many contiguous 'stationary' frames are required to be considered a foot-plant (1 is good for fast humanoid motion, 2-3 is good for slower)": "需要多少个连续的'静止'帧才能被判定为一次脚部着地呢?(对于快速移动的类人角色, 设为1即可; 对于动作较慢的角色, 设为2-3较为合适)",
  "Frame Offset:": "帧偏移量: ",
  "Frame offset added to all resulting animevent frame number. (floor and ceiling respected)": "该帧偏移值将被添加到所有生成的动画事件帧编号中. (向下取整与向上取整均会遵循) (floor and ceiling respected)",
  "<font color='green'>Foot '%s' recognized bone '%s' and attachment '%s'</font><br>": "<font color='green'>脚部 '%s' 识别出了骨骼 '%s' 以及附着点 '%s'</font><br>",
  "<font color='green'>Foot '%s' recognized bone '%s' (no attachment specified in foot settings - sounds will play localized to the entity)</font><br>": "<font color='green'>足部'%s'识别出骨骼'%s'(未在足部设置中指定附件 - 音效将针对相应实体进行本地化播放)</font><br>",
  "<font color='yellow'>Foot '%s' recognized bone '%s' but did not find attachment (eg. '%s') - sounds will play localized to the entity.</font><br>": "<font color='yellow'>脚部'%s'识别出了骨骼'%s', 但未找到附加物(如'%s') - 音效将针对该实体进行本地化播放. </font><br>",
  "<font color='red'>Foot '%s' had no recognized bone in the model</font><br>": "<font color='red'>脚部 '%s' 在模型中未找到对应的骨骼</font><br>",
  "WARNING: Failed to load %s: %s": "警告: 无法加载 %s: %s",
  "Value to set the 'foot' key (if nonempty)": "用于设置'foot'键的值(若不为空) (if nonempty)",
  "Threshold for 'nearly stopped' linear velocity (inches/second)": "'几乎停止'状态对应的线速度阈值(英寸/秒)",
  "Threshold for 'fully stopped' linear velocity (inches/second)": "'完全停止'状态对应的线速度阈值(英寸/秒)",
  "Threshold for 'nearly stopped' angular velocity (degrees/second)": "'几乎停止'状态所对应的角速度阈值(度/秒)",
  "Threshold for 'fully stopped' angular velocity (degrees/second)": "'完全停止'状态对应的角速度阈值(度/秒)",
  "Bone name(s) that represent the 'ankle' for this foot. Used for motion analysis. If multiple specified, use the first one found in the skeleton.": "表示该脚部'踝关节'的骨骼名称. 该信息用于动作分析. 若指定了多个名称, 则使用在骨骼结构中最先匹配到的那个. ",
  "Attachment point(s) generated footstep events should have their 'attachment' key set. If multiple specified, use the first one found in the model.": "生成了脚步事件的附着点必须设置'attachment'键值. 若指定了多个附着点, 则使用模型中第一个被找到的附着点. ",
  "Type of anim event": "动画事件类型",
  "Error - no model data.": "错误: 没有模型数据. ",
