  "Swap Left/Right Parent Bones": "交换左右父骨骼",
  "Swap parent bones if a bone ends in a known left/right suffix, i.e. _L, _left, etc... and there's a correspondingly named bones.  Works best for bone relative mirroring in Y, i.e. across the XZ plane, left/right.": "如果某块骨骼的名称以常见的左右后缀结尾, 比如 _L、_left 等, 且存在名称对应的左右对称骨骼, 则可交换这对父骨骼. 此功能在沿 Y 轴进行骨骼镜像操作时效果最佳, 即沿 XZ 平面实现左右对称. ",
