  "After the node completes its work and the original cursor is killed, a new cursor will be created here.": "节点完成工作且原有游标被终止后, 系统会在此处创建一个新的游标. ",
  "While Active": "激活状态",
  "When this node yields, a new cursor will be created here. After the node is complete or canceled, this other cursor will be canceled as well.": "当此节点执行完毕后, 系统会在此处创建一个新的光标. 待该节点执行完成或被取消后, 此光标也会随之被取消. ",
  "No-default-outflow must be the last child": "'无默认流出路径'必须是最后一个子项",
  "No-default-inflow must be the first child": "'无默认流入'必须是第一个子项",
  "Immediately": "立即",
  "Followed by the primary cursor without waiting for this node to complete.": "无需等待此节点完成, 主光标随即继续移动. ",
  "A block of steps that will execute in sequence": "一系列将按顺序执行的步骤",
  "Missing library func '%s'": "缺少库函数 '%s'",
  "'%s' cannot read from link to '%s'. You need to change your graph to guarantee that the source happens before the destination!": "'%s' 无法从指向 '%s' 的链接中读取数据. 您需要调整图表结构, 以确保源节点确实先于目标节点出现! ",
  "Compiler error: Inparam was not already visited": "编译错误: 输入参数尚未被访问过",
  "Invalid type for port '%s'": "端口'%s'的类型无效",
  "Unspecified type for port '%s'": "端口'%s'的类型未指定",
  "Cannot convert from %s to %s": "无法将 %s 转换为 %s",
