  "Cannot generate literal for Variant directly - choose a specific type": "无法直接为 Variant 生成字面量, 请选择具体的类型",
  "Malformed bool literal '%s'": "布尔值字面量 '%s' 格式错误",
  "Malformed int literal '%s'": "整数字面量'%s'格式不正确",
  "Malformed float literal '%s'": "浮点数格式错误: '%s'",
  "Need a refined array element type.": "需要一个更精确的数组元素类型. ",
  "Can only assign an empty string literal to Entity Handles - no other values.": "只能将空字符串字面量赋值给实体句柄, 其他任何值均不可用. ",
  "Can only assign an empty string literal to Entity Names - no other values.": "只能将空字符串赋值给实体名称, 其他任何值均不可使用. ",
  "Can only assign literal empty (invalid) - no other Panel Handle values.": "只能指定空值(无效值) - 不能指定其他面板句柄值. ",
  "Need a refined enum type.": "需要一个经过优化的枚举类型. ",
  "Unknown domain scope for enum constant": "无法识别枚举常量所对应的域范围",
  "Unable to allocate register for inparam: %s": "无法为输入参数分配寄存器: %s",
  "Cannot call an untracked function in an observable scope. %s '%s' is not a PULSE_VALUE_PURE nor take a IPulseHost_EntityObservable context!": "无法在可观察作用域中调用未受跟踪的函数. %s'%s'既非 PULSE_VALUE_PURE 类型, 也不接受 IPulseHost_EntityObservable 上下文参数! ",
  "Internal Error WriteLibraryCall(%s): expected %d arg(s)": "内部错误: WriteLibraryCall(%s): 预期参数个数为 %d个(s)",
