  "Writes a new value to a graph-wide variable.": "将新值写入到整个图表中使用的变量. ",
  "Array Index Dimension": "数组索引维度",
  "Do Not Notify Listeners": "请勿通知监听者",
  "Do not notify listeners when this variable changes.": "在此变量发生变更时, 请勿通知监听器. ",
  "New Value": "新值",
  "Internal compiler error - FindVar failed": "内部编译器错误 - FindVar 执行失败",
  "Too many dimensions of array index": "数组索引的维度过多",
  "Failed to compile value": "编译数值时失败",
  "Higher-dimension arrays not suppported yet": "目前尚不支持高维数组",
  "Setting a temporary variable is currently unsupported! Talk to Tom Bui.": "目前尚不支持设置临时变量! 请联系 Tom Bui. ",
  "No target variable": "未指定目标变量",
  "Internal compiler error - Could not register blackboard reference": "内部编译器错误 - 无法注册黑板引用",
  "Blackboard arrays not suppported yet": "目前尚不支持黑板数组",
  "Set & Notify": "设置并通知",
  "Entry point that can be invoked from other parts of the graph, or be exposed to the public and called from outside the graph. Formerly called a 'method'": "可从图表的其他部分调用的入口点, 也可对外公开并供图表外部调用. 旧称'方法'",
  "Return Type": "返回类型",
  "Arguments": "参数",
  "Is Public": "是否公开",
  "Connection Anchor Point": "连接锚点",
  "An anchor point for a connection": "连接的锚点",
  "Param Connection": "参数连接",
  "A link that specifies where data comes from": "一个用于指明数据来源的链接",
  "Inparam connection not a child of a node": "输入参数'connection'并非某个节点的子项",
  "Dest param '%s' doesn't exist on parent %s": "目标参数'%s'在父级 %s 中不存在",
  "Destination %s: Inparam source node not found: %d": "目标 %s: 未找到输入参数源节点: %d",
  "Destination %s: Outparam '%s' doesn't exist on source %s": "目标 %s: 源 %s 中不存在输出参数'%s'",
  "Outflow Connection": "流出连接",
  "A link from one block to another": "一个区块指向另一个区块的链接",
  "Outflow connection not a child of a flow node": "流出连接并非流节点的子节点",
  "Source outflow '%s' doesn't exist on parent %s": "源流出 '%s' 在父级 %s 中不存在",
  "Connection on %s: Outflow destination node not found: %d": "连接时间: %s; 未找到流出目标节点: %d",
  "Connection originating out of %s: Destination inflow '%s' doesn't exist on destination %s": "连接发起自 %s: 目标端的流入项'%s'在目标 %s 中不存在",
  "Variable Definition": "变量定义",
  "Defines a variable that can be read and written anywhere within the graph.": "用于定义一个可在图表任意位置读取和写入的变量. ",
  "Keys Source": "密钥来源",
  "Where the initial value of this variable can be specified by users of the graph. (Eg. if VMAP, it will be visible in the Hammer property editor)": "用户可在图表中自行设置该变量的初始值. (例如: 若该变量类型为 VMAP, 则它会在 Hammer 属性编辑器中显示出来)",
  "Suppress Expression": "隐藏表达式",
  "Editor Properties": "编辑器属性",
  "Will be placed in a group with other properties that share the same group name.": "该属性将与其他具有相同组名的属性被归入同一组中. ",
  "Assigns a friendly name to be displayed in the editor": "为编辑器中显示的名称指定一个便于识别的昵称",
  "If set, this variable is visible to other non-blackboard graphs.": "若已设置, 此变量将对其他非黑板图表可见. ",
  "Public Output": "公开输出",
  "Defines a signal that this graph can emit (for entities, creates an output that can be linked to other entities via the I/O system)": "定义此图表可发出的信号(对于实体而言, 会生成一个可通过 I/O 系统与其他实体相连接的输出端口)",
  "Out Default": "输出默认值",
  "In Default": "默认设置",
  "Constant Definition": "常量定义",
  "Defines a constant unchanging value that can be referenced anywhere in the graph.": "定义一个恒定不变的值, 该值可在图表中的任意位置被引用. ",
  "Entity Output": "实体输出",
  "An entry point that will automatically listen for an Output from the referenced Entity in the Parent Map.": "一个入口点, 可自动监听父级地图中所引用实体的输出内容. ",
  "Source Entity": "源实体",
  "Entity I/O Output Parameter": "实体 I/O 输出参数",
  "Activator": "激活器",
  "Caller": "呼叫方",
  "Legacy node name '%s' on node %d, discarding": "节点 %d上的旧版节点名称'%s'已废弃, 正在忽略处理",
  "'%s' is not a known output": "'%s' 不是已知的输出格式",
  "Sleep": "休眠",
  "Pauses a cursor by putting it to sleep until an unrelated event wakes it. Keywords: wait, yield.": "使光标进入休眠状态直至某个无关事件将其唤醒. 关键词: 等待、让出. ",
  "Causes the cursor to sleep at this node until a later time.": "使光标在此节点处暂停, 直到指定时间. ",
  "On Variable Change": "变量发生变化时",
  "Entry point for when a variable's value has changed.": "当变量值发生变更时触发的入口点. ",
  "Previous Value": "之前的值",
  "The previous value of the variable": "变量的先前值",
  "Current Value": "当前值",
  "The current value of the variable": "当前变量的值",
  "No variable specified!": "未指定任何变量! ",
  "On Variable Changed %s": "变量值发生变化时 %s",
  "Exit taken if the switch value doesn't match any cases": "若开关值与任何情况均不匹配, 则退出",
  "case [%d] is an invalid case!": "用例 [%d] 是一个无效的用例! ",
  "Switch:": "切换: ",
  "Ordered": "已下单",
  "Outputs selected in order": "按顺序输出所选内容",
  "Outputs at random without repicking (until all have been visited)": "随机输出, 不再重新选择(直到所有项均被选中一次) (until all have been visited)",
  "Outputs at random, repeats allowed": "随机输出, 允许重复",
  "Cyclic Branch": "循环分支",
  "Directs each subsequent cursor to a different path. The order can be sequential, shuffled, or totally random. Keywords: cycle, exit.": "可将后续的光标分别引导至不同的路径上. 顺序既可以是连续的、随机打乱的, 也可以是完全随机的. 关键词: 循环、退出. ",
  "Cycle Mode": "循环模式",
  "Cycle Exit (%s)": "循环退出 (%s)",
  "Num Branches": "分支数量",
  "Branch %d": "分支 %d",
  "Conditional Branch": "条件分支",
  "Directs the cursor to different paths depending on a boolean condition. Equivalent to an if-else statement in code. Keywords: exit, continue.": "根据布尔条件将光标导向不同的路径, 相当于代码中的 if-else 语句. 关键词: exit、continue. ",
  "Invert Condition": "反转条件",
  "Change the input condition to its opposite before evaluating. Equivalent to an expression Not or '!' node": "在求值前将输入条件取反. 相当于使用 Not 表达式或 '!' 节点",
  "Condition to check": "待检查的条件",
  "Exit taken if the condition is true": "条件为真时退出",
  "Exit taken if the condition is false": "若条件为假则退出",
  "Continue If Not": "否则继续",
  "Continue If": "继续 若",
  "Switch Branch ( int )": "切换分支(整数) ( int )",
  "Directs the cursor to the path matching the passed in value.<br>(or the default path if the value doesn't match any user-defined paths). Keywords: exit": "将光标定位到与输入值相匹配的路径上<br>(若该值不匹配任何用户自定义路径, 则定位到默认路径). 关键词: exit",
  "Cases": "案例",
  "Value to match": "待匹配的值",
  "Case: %s": "用例: %s",
  "Actor": "演员",
  "Target Attachment": "目标附件",
  "Optional target attachment name for IK and look-ats": "IK及注视目标的可选目标附件名称",
  "Play Scene": "播放场景",
  "Start playing the referenced scene.": "开始播放所引用的场景. ",
  "Followed when the VCD is finished without interruption.": "在VCD无中断地执行完成后执行. ",
  "Play VCD (Dynamic File)": "播放 VCD(动态文件) (Dynamic File)",
  "Plays a VCD that's specified externally": "播放在外部指定的 VCD 文件",
  "VCD File Name Param": "VCD文件名参数",
  "Play VCD": "播放VCD",
  "Plays a VCD and calls each of the trigger outflows when the corresponding trigger event fires.": "播放 VCD 文件, 并在相应的触发事件发生时调用各个触发输出. ",
  "Resume Playback": "继续播放",
  "If the VCD is paused, resumes playback": "如果VCD处于暂停状态, 则恢复播放",
  "On Paused": "已暂停",
  "Followed when a VCD is paused": "VCD暂停后的操作",
  "On Resumed": "恢复时",
  "Followed when a paused VCD is resumed": "当暂停的VCD恢复播放时触发",
  "Missing VCD file '%s'": "缺少 VCD 文件'%s'",
  "VCD: %s": "VCD: %s",
  "Stop playback at the next interrupt point, then proceed to the next node.": "在下个中断点停止播放, 随后进入下一个节点. ",
  "Stop playback at the next interrupt point, then kill the primary cursor.": "在下个中断点停止播放, 随后关闭主光标. ",
  "Actor: %s": "演员: %s",
  "Trigger: %s": "触发条件: %s",
  "Anchor: %s": "锚点: %s",
