  "Clip: %s": "剪辑: %s",
  "Clip Looping: %s": "剪辑循环模式: %s",
  "Sequence: %s": "序列号: %s",
  "Target Override: %s": "目标覆盖值: %s",
  "%s: '%s'": "%s: '%s'",
  "Play Sequence on NPC/Prop Dynamic": "在 NPC/道具上播放动态序列",
  "Plays a Sequence on an actor/prop_dynamic and calls each of the trigger outflows when a corresponding anim event is fired.": "在演员或动态道具上播放动画序列, 并在相应的动画事件触发时调用各个触发输出. ",
  "Example model": "示例模型",
  "Used only to find the animation sequences": "仅用于查找动画序列",
  "Sequence '%s'": "序列'%s'",
  "Could not find sequence!": "未找到对应序列! ",
  "Looping Sequence!": "循环序列! ",
  "Cursor will wait here until canceled or a new cursor enters for the same actor.": "光标将在此处等待, 直至被取消或有新的光标为同一角色输入. ",
  "Sequences with no duration not supported!": "不支持没有持续时间的序列! ",
  "Be careful with looping animations!": "使用循环动画时要小心哦! ",
  "!!! %s !!!": "! ! !  %s ! ",
  "Sequence has 0 duration!": "序列的时长为零! ",
  "Play Scripted Sequence on NPC": "在NPC上播放预设序列",
  "Grabs an NPC and makes them play a specified set of animations, optionally with any number of additional NPCs.": "抓取一个NPC并令其播放指定的动画序列, 也可选择添加任意数量的额外NPC. ",
  "Pre Action Idle Animation": "前置动作闲置动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play before the action animation if the NPC must wait for the script to be triggered.": "当 NPC 需要等待脚本触发时, 用于在动作动画前播放的动画序列名称(例如 'idle01'). ",
  "Entry Animation": "入口动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'reload02') to play when the sequence starts, before transitioning to play the main action sequence.": "序列的名称(例如 'reload02'), 用于在主动作序列开始播放前触发并播放该序列. ",
  "Action Animation": "动作动画",
  "The name of the main sequence (such as 'reload02') to play.": "要播放的主序列名称(例如 'reload02'). ",
  "Post Action Idle Animation": "执行后闲置动画",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play after the action animation.": "动作动画播放完毕后要播放的序列名称(例如'idle01'). ",
  "Loop Pre Idle Animation?": "是否循环播放预空闲动画?",
  "Loop Action Animation?": "是否循环播放动作动画?",
  "Loop Post Idle Animation?": "是否循环播放闲置动画?",
  "Ignore Look At?": "忽略'注视'设置?",
  "Move To Behavior": "移动到行为",
  "Movement Gait": "移动步态",
  "Held Weapon Behavior": "持握武器的行为表现",
  "Sync Group": "同步组",
  "Optional sync group if there is more than one scripted sequence in the Pulse graph that you want to sync with. Leave blank to have this automatically generated.": "如需将此序列与其他多个在 Pulse 图表中定义的脚本序列同步, 可在此指定同步组. 若留空, 系统将自动生成同步组. ",
  "Ensure on Nav Mesh On Finish": "在导航网格上: 完成后确保生效",
  "When finishing the sequence, if the NPC uses the navmesh, ensure the NPC is on a valid location on the navmesh.": "序列执行完毕后, 如果NPC使用了导航网格, 请确保NPC位于导航网格上的有效位置. ",
  "Don't Teleport NPC On End": "结束时勿传送NPC",
  "Don't fixup end position with a teleport when the SS is finished.": "在SS结束后, 切勿使用传送功能来修正结束位置. ",
  "No Interruptions": "无中断, 持续运行",
  "Disallow interrupts.": "禁止中断. ",
  "Main Actor Animations": "主角动画",
  "Additional Actors": "其他演员",
  "Begin Sequence": "开始序列",
  "If any actor has a pre-idle, the scripted sequence will wait until this inflow is invoked. Note that this will start the sequence for any scripted sequence waiting on this node.": "如果有任何角色处于预闲置状态, 脚本序列将会等待该状态触发后才继续执行. 请注意, 此举也会启动所有正在该节点处等待执行的脚本序列. ",
  "Main Actor": "主要演员",
  "No action animation specified for main actor!": "未为主角色指定任何动作动画! ",
  "No action animation specified for additional actor %u!": "未为附加角色 %u 指定任何动作动画! ",
  "Scripted Sequence '%s'": "脚本序列'%s'",
  "No action animation specified!": "未指定任何动作动画! ",
  "Additional Actor %u": "额外的演员 %u",
  "%s => %s": "%s => %s",
  "Terminates an Input or Hook and returns the provided value to the caller. (Only needed for Inputs that specify a return value, or Hooks that expect one.)": "用于终止某个输入操作或 Hook, 并将指定的值返回给调用者. (仅当输入操作需要返回值, 或 Hook 期望接收到返回值时才需使用. )",
  "Return:": "返回: ",
  "Failed to compile return": "编译返回结果失败",
  "End <unbound>": "结束 <未绑定>",
  "No originating Input found!": "未找到源输入内容! ",
  "End (multiple)": "结束(多项) (multiple)",
  "End %s": "结束 %s",
  "Switch Branch ( schema enum )": "切换分支(模式枚举) ( schema enum )",
  "Sequential Branch": "顺序分支",
  "Executes all outflows each time the node is visited. The incoming cursor visits each branch in turn. Keywords: simultaneous, exit.": "每次访问该节点时都会执行所有流出路径. 传入的指针会依次遍历每个分支. 关键词: 同步、退出. ",
  "Switch Branch ( string )": "切换分支(字符串) ( string )",
  "Exit taken once the condition is false (if the condition is false when the cursor arrives, this exit is immediately taken.)": "当条件不再满足时即执行退出操作(若光标到达时条件已不满足, 则立即执行退出. )",
  "Exit taken repeatedly as long as the condition is true (if the condition is false when the cursor arrives, this exit is never taken.)": "只要条件为真, 便会反复执行该退出操作(若光标到达时条件已为假, 则永远不会执行此退出操作)",
  "Loop While": "循环执行条件",
  "Equivalent to an while-statement in code.": "相当于代码中的 while 语句. ",
  "While": "此时",
  "Condition to check before each execution of the loop body": "每次执行循环体前需检查的条件",
  "Loop For Each": "循环遍历",
  "Loops over the elements in an array, optionally also provides the index.": "遍历数组中的每个元素, 也可选择获取其索引. ",
  "Loop Over Array": "遍历数组",
  "The array to loop over": "需要遍历的数组",
  "Element": "元素",
  "Takes the value of each element in the array": "提取数组中每个元素的值",
  "The index of the current element": "当前元素的索引",
  "Could not determine type of result": "无法确定结果的类型",
  "Cannot handle array element value type.": "无法处理数组元素的值类型. ",
  "Inparam is no longer an array!": "Inparam 不再是数组了! ",
  "This will be the first value emitted.": "这将是第一个输出的数值. ",
  "This will be the last value emitted.": "这将是最后发出的一个值. ",
  "Step Count": "步数统计",
  "How many emitted values there should be, including start and stop.": "应包含的输出值数量, 包括起始值与结束值. ",
  "The value of this iteration of the loop": "本次循环迭代的值",
  "Step Size": "步长",
  "The spacing of each value in the output range.": "输出范围内各值之间的间距. ",
  "Loop Range (Float)": "循环范围(浮点数) (Float)",
  "Loop from a start to an end value, including ('through') that end value, divided into a fixed number of steps.": "从起始值循环至结束值, 包含该结束值本身, 且过程被划分为固定数量的步数. ",
  "(end - start) / (count - 1)": "(end - start) / (count - 1)",
  "Loop From %s Through %s%s": "循环范围: 从 %s 到 %s%s",
  "Loop Through Float Range": "在浮点数范围内循环",
  "From": "发件人",
  "This will be the first value emitted (start)": "这将是输出的第一个值(起始值) (start)",
  "Increment Value by this amount each time through the loop": "每次循环时, 将值增加此数值",
  "Loop Range (Integer)": "循环范围(整数) (Integer)",
  "Loop from a start to an end value, optionally including ('through') or excluding ('until') that end value. Equivalent to a for() loop in code.": "从起始值循环到结束值, 可选择是否包含结束值本身. 这与代码中的 for() 循环作用相同. ",
  "Include End Value": "包含结束值",
  "Do we include the last value as an emitted value ('through') or do we stop without emitting that value ('until')?<br><br>Examples:<br>'1 until 5': [ 1, 2, 3, 4 ]<br>'1 through 5': [ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 ]": "我们是否将最后一个值也作为输出值包含在内('through'), 还是说在到达该值时就停止而不输出('until')?<br><br>示例: <br>'1 until 5': [ 1, 2, 3, 4 ]<br>'1 through 5':  [ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 ]",
  "Loop Through Integer Range": "在整数范围内循环",
  "Loop From %s Until %s%s": "循环范围: 从 %s 到 %s%s",
  "Loop Until Integer Range": "循环直到数值处于指定范围",
  "Through (included)": "包含于/涵盖 (included)",
  "Until (not included)": "截至(不含该日期) (not included)",
  "This will be the last value emitted (stop)": "这将是最后输出的数值(停止) (stop)",
  "This will be ONE BEFORE the last value emitted (stop)": "这将是最后发送的值的前一个值(停止) (stop)",
  "Fires a series of child cursors at the specified times.": "在指定时间点触发一系列子光标. ",
  "Wait for Children": "等待子进程",
  "This node will always wait for the last event time. Should we also wait for the completion child cursors before running the 'Completed' outflow, or should it ignore them?": "该节点将始终以最后一个事件的时间作为参考. 在执行'已完成'流出路径前, 我们是否应等待所有子游标完成操作?还是直接忽略它们?",
  "The time in seconds measured from the end of the prior section.": "从上一个段落结束起计算的秒数. ",
  "Optional for display only.": "仅用于显示, 可选填. ",
  "Followed when the Timeline is finished without interruption.": "在时间线顺利完成且无中断时执行. ",
  "%s @ %0.1fs": "%s, 耗时 %0.1f秒",
  "Event @ %0.1fs": "事件 @ %0.1fs",
  "Time From Start": "从开始计时的时长",
  "Time From Previous": "距上一次的时间",
  "Call External Graph Input": "调用外部图表输入",
  "Calls an Input in an instance of another graph.": "调用另一图实例中的输入项. ",
  "NOTE: Only applies when the target Input yields.": "注意: 仅当目标输入值生成时才适用. ",
  "External Input": "外部输入",
  "Game Blackboard": "游戏公告板",
  "Instead of calling an Input on an Entity, call it on the associated Game Blackboard.": "请勿对实体调用 Input, 而应对其关联的游戏黑板调用该接口. ",
  "Target Graph": "目标图表",
  "Target entity (pulse graph) to have this Input invoked": "要调用此输入的目标实体(脉冲图表)",
  "No Blackboard (Use Entity)": "不使用黑板(使用实体) (Use Entity)",
  "Failed to load compiled asset for '%s'. Possible compile failure.": "无法加载'%s'的编译后资源. 可能是编译过程出现了问题. ",
  "This domain (%s) and external domain (%s) mismatch": "此域名 (%s) 与外部域名 (%s) 不匹配",
  "Unknown Input '%s'": "未知的输入值 '%s'",
  "Call Input": "通话输入",
  "Invoke an Input within this graph.": "在此图中调用一个输入项. ",
  "NOTE: Only applies when the target Input doesn't complete immediately.": "注意: 仅在目标输入操作无法立即完成时适用. ",
  "Call <unbound>": "呼叫 <unbound>",
  "Call %s": "呼叫 %s",
  "Fire %s": "发射 %s",
  "%s<br><br><b>%s:</b> %s": "%s<br><br><b>%s: </b> %s",
  "Create Temporary Variable": "创建临时变量",
  "Creates a new temporary variable that is scoped to this flow of execution. Any node after this one should be able to access this variable. To use in an expression, prefix with '@'.": "创建一个新的临时变量, 其作用域限定在此执行流程内. 在此之后的任何节点均可访问该变量. 在表达式中使用时, 需在变量名前加上'@'符号. ",
  "Temporary variable name is empty": "临时变量名称为空",
  "Duplicate name '%s'. Please choose a different name. See node properties for links to the prior name source.": "名称'%s'已被使用. 请选择其他名称. 可查看节点属性以获取该名称的原始来源信息. ",
  "Duplicate Name!": "名称重复! ",
  "Debug log message": "调试日志信息",
  "Debug Log": "调试日志",
  "For printing debug info": "用于打印调试信息",
  "Broadcast by Entity Name": "按实体名称广播",
  "Fire at all entities with the desired name (standard Hammer behavior).": "向所有名称符合指定条件的实体开火(这是 Hammer 的默认行为). ",
  "Single Entity Handle": "单个实体句柄",
  "Fire at a specific entity referenced by the given handle.": "向由指定句柄所引用的特定实体开火. ",
  "Entity I/O Input Parameter": "实体 I/O 输入参数",
  "Fire Entity Input": "火焰实体输入",
  "Trigger an Entity I/O input on a particular entity or all entities of a given name.": "触发指定实体或所有同名实体的 Entity I/O 输入事件. ",
  "Fire Mode": "开火模式",
  "Controls the method of dispatch. Options are:<br><br><b>Broadcast by Entity Name</b>: Fire at all entities with the desired name (standard Hammer behavior).<br><br><b>Single Entity Handle</b>: Fire at a specific entity referenced by the given handle.": "用于控制派发方式. 可选选项如下: <br><br><b>按实体名称广播</b>: 向所有名称匹配的实体发送指令(即 Hammer 的标准行为). <br><br><b>指定实体句柄</b>: 仅向由指定句柄所引用的特定实体发送指令. ",
  "Fire '%s'": "触发'%s'",
  "'%s' is not a known input": "'%s' 不是已知的输入值",
  "%s =>": "%s =>",
  "Using a 'Parent Map Entity' Target with 'Single Entity Handle' Fire Mode will only find ONE Entity!": "在'单一实体处理'触发模式下, 使用'父级地图实体'目标类型只能找到一个实体! ",
  "%s<br><br><b>%s:</b> %s (<i>%s</i>)": "%s<br><br><b>%s: </b> %s (<i>%s</i>)",
  "Fire Public Output": "公开输出结果",
  "Signal an output event that this graph publishes to the outside world.": "发出一个输出事件, 表明此图表向外部世界发布数据. ",
  "Output Name": "输出名称",
  "Fire Output: %s": "火焰输出: %s",
  "Fire Output: <unbound>": "火焰输出: <未绑定>",
  "Entity Parent": "实体父级",
  "Follow Entity (Merge)": "跟随实体(合并) (Merge)",
  "Bone merges this entity to a parent entity. Call again passing nothing to end the bone merge.": "骨骼功能可将当前实体合并到父级实体中. 如需终止合并操作, 再次调用该函数且不传入任何参数即可. ",
  "Bone or Attachment Point Name (Parent)": "骨骼或附着点名称(父级) (Parent)",
  "Bone or Attachment Point Name (Child)": "骨骼或附着点名称(子级) (Child)",
  "If set and the attachment point is found in the child, use the attachment point's offset & angles": "若已设置且在子项中找到了附着点, 则使用该附着点的偏移量与角度",
  "Follow Entity Merge @ '%s'": "跟随实体合并操作 @ '%s'",
  "Follow Entity Merge": "跟随实体合并",
  "On Entity": "在实体上",
  "With Value": "含数值",
  "Symbol": "符号",
  "Set Animgraph Param '%s'": "设置动画图参数'%s'",
  "Prop Dynamic - Set Animgraph Param": "属性动态 - 设置动画图参数",
  "Set an animgraph parameter on a prop_dynamic entity.": "设置 prop_dynamic 实体上的动画图参数. ",
  "Editor Only Model": "仅编辑器模式",
  "Param Name": "参数名称",
  "Prop Dynamic - Set Animgraph Param '%s'": "属性动态 - 设置动画图参数'%s'",
  "%s (unreferenced)": "%s(未被引用) (unreferenced)",
  "The array to read from": "待读取的数组",
  "Index in the array (first element is 0)": "数组中的索引值(第一个元素的索引为0) (first element is 0)",
  "Access a particular element of an array by index": "通过索引访问数组中的特定元素",
  "Must be an Array type.": "必须是数组类型. ",
  "Could not compile inparam array": "无法编译输入参数数组",
  "Failed to compile inparam index": "编译输入参数索引失败",
  "Make Array": "生成数组",
  "Assemble an array": "组装数组",
  "Element Type": "元素类型",
  "Bad type for MakeArray!": "MakeArray的类型不正确! ",
  "Element Type not specified in MakeArray!": "未在 MakeArray 中指定元素类型! ",
  "error!": "错误! ",
  "Add Element": "添加元素",
  "Remove %s": "删除 %s",
  "Switch Value": "切换值",
  "Input value which will be compared to the cases below.": "请输入待对比的值, 该值将与下方的示例进行对比. ",
  "Default Output": "默认输出",
  "If no other cases are matched, this is the Output that will be used.": "若无其他匹配项, 则将使用此输出结果. ",
  "Select a value by matching the input to a fixed set of options. Keywords: choose, choice, selector": "请从预设的选项列表中选择一个值. 相关关键词: 选择、选项、选择器",
  "Output Type": "输出类型",
  "Could not determine type for input value": "无法确定输入值的类型",
  "Input type '%s' not supported": "不支持输入类型'%s'",
  "Match Value": "匹配值",
  "The case data is tested against the Input. If it matches, the corresponding Value will be returned as the Output.": "测试用例数据会与输入值进行比对. 若匹配成功, 相应的数值便会作为输出值返回. ",
  "Add Case": "添加案例",
  "First Value": "第一个值",
  "Second": "秒",
  "Second Value": "第二个数值",
  "Condition that determines which value is picked": "用于决定选取哪个值的条件",
  "Value picked if the condition is true": "条件为真时选取的值",
  "Value picked if the condition is false": "条件不成立时所选取的值",
  "Property Owner": "物业所有者",
  "Unrecognized property '%s'": "无法识别的属性'%s'",
  "(no args)": "(无需参数)(no args)",
  "No version of '%s' accepts provided argument types %s": "没有任何版本的'%s'能够接受所提供的参数类型 %s",
  "Unrecognized function '%s'": "无法识别的函数'%s'",
  "Failed to assign %s '%s' onto '%s'": "无法将 %s'%s'分配到'%s'上",
  "Internal error: no linked port (source)": "内部错误: 未找到关联的端口(源) (source)",
  "Internal error: no linked port (connection)": "内部错误: 没有已关联的端口(连接) (connection)",
  "Internal error: Missing linked node.": "内部错误: 缺少链接的节点. ",
  "Internal error: Result node %d is not a child of expression outer.": "内部错误: 结果节点 %d 并非表达式外层节点的子节点. ",
  "Internal error: Result node %d is not an value.": "内部错误: 结果节点 %d 并非有效的数值. ",
  "Failed to resolve variable to name (%s)": "无法将变量解析为名称 (%s)",
  "Cannot handle non-identifier variable names yet (%s)": "目前尚无法处理非标识符格式的变量名 (%s)",
  "Failed to resolve blackboard reference to name (%s)": "无法解析名为 (%s) 的黑板引用",
  "Cannot handle non-identifier blackboard variable names yet (%s)": "目前尚无法处理不符合标识符规范的黑板变量名 (%s)",
  "Expr function not found: '%s'": "未找到表达式函数: '%s'",
  "Expr alias not found: '%s'": "未找到表达式别名: '%s'",
  "No port for '%s' arg '%s'": "没有适用于参数'%s'值'%s'的端口",
  "Mirrored port does not have '$' prefix (%s)": "镜像端口缺少 '$' 前缀 (%s)",
  "Mirrored port name contains disallowed characters (%s)": "镜像端口名称包含不允许使用的字符 (%s)",
  "CPulseDoc_Value_Expression internal error: no port found for '%s'": "CPulseDoc_Value_Expression 内部错误: 未找到与 '%s' 对应的端口",
  "No graph variable named '%s'": "不存在名为'%s'的图表变量",
  "Value for expression variable '%s'": "表达式变量'%s'的值",
  "Visit_Unary Internal Error: %d": "访问时出现内部错误: %d",
  "Visit_Binary Internal Error: %d": "访问二进制数据时发生内部错误: %d",
  "Expected bool-convertible condition for ternary ?: expression": "三元运算符 ?: 的表达式需要具备可转换为布尔值的条件",
  "Unknown object type": "未知的对象类型",
  "Could not compile Property source": "无法编译属性源",
  "Failed to compile Property: %s": "编译属性失败: %s",
  "Property Name": "属性名称",
  "Internal error: Resolved call to '%s' with wrong number of args (%d != %d)": "内部错误: 对 '%s' 的调用参数数量不正确(%d 不等于 %d)",
  "Internal error: No port for '%s' arg '%s'": "内部错误: 找不到用于'%s'参数'%s'的端口",
  "Internal error: No retval for '%s' (%s)": "内部错误: 找不到 '%s' (%s) 的返回值",
  "Unknown type for first argument": "第一个参数的类型未知",
  "Unknown type for second argument": "第二个参数的类型未知",
  "This operator not supported for argument types (%s,%s)": "此运算符不支持参数类型 (%s,%s)",
  "Invalid register for arg: %s": "参数注册无效: %s",
  "Unknown type for argument": "参数类型未知",
  "Logical Not !": "逻辑非运算 ! ",
  "Boolean inverse - true converts to false and false converts to true.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>!VALUE</tt>": "布尔值取反 - true会变为false, false则会变为true. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>!VALUE</tt>",
  "Negative -": "负值 -",
  "Arithmetic negative of a number.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>-VALUE</tt>": "数字的算术相反数. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>-VALUE</tt>",
  "Add +": "添加 +",
  "Add two numbers together, or concatenate (join) two strings. If one input is a string, will convert the other to a string.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 + VALUE2</tt>": "将两个数字相加, 或者将两个字符串连接起来. 如果其中一个输入为字符串, 则会将另一个输入也转换为字符串. <br>在表达式中可表示为 <tt>VALUE1 + VALUE2</tt>",
  "Subtract -": "减法",
  "Subtract two numbers.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 - VALUE2</tt>": "计算两个数的差值. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>数值1 - 数值2</tt>",
  "Multiply *": "乘法 *",
  "Multiply two numbers.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 * VALUE2</tt>": "将两个数字相乘. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>数值1 * 数值2</tt>",
  "Divide /": "分割 /",
  "Divide one number by another.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 / VALUE2</tt>": "将一个数字除以另一个数字. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>数值1 / 数值2</tt>",
  "Modulo %": "取模运算 %",
  "The remainder when the first number is divided by the second, also called mod or modulus.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 % VALUE2</tt>": "第一个数除以第二个数后得到的余数, 也被称为模或取模运算. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>VALUE1 %VALUE2</tt>",
  "Less Than <": "小于 <",
  "True if the first number is less than the second.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 < VALUE2</tt>": "当第一个数字小于第二个数字时返回True. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>VALUE1 < VALUE2</tt>",
  "Less Or Equal <=": "小于等于 <=",
  "True if the first number is less than or equal to the second.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 <= VALUE2</tt>": "当第一个数值小于或等于第二个数值时返回True. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>VALUE1 <= VALUE2</tt>",
  "Greater Than >": "大于 >",
  "True if the first number is greater than the second.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 > VALUE2</tt>": "当第一个数字大于第二个数字时返回True<br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>VALUE1 > VALUE2</tt>",
  "Greater Or Equal >=": "大于或等于 >=",
  "True if the first number is greater than or equal to the second.<br>Represented in expressions as VALUE1 >= VALUE2</tt>": "当第一个数值大于或等于第二个数值时返回真. <br>在表达式中表示为 VALUE1 >= VALUE2",
  "Equal ==": "相等 ==",
  "True if the two values are equal.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 == VALUE2</tt>": "当两个值相等时返回True. <br>在表达式中可表示为 <tt>VALUE1 == VALUE2</tt>",
  "Not Equal !=": "不等于 !=",
  "True if the two values are not equal.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 != VALUE2</tt>": "当两个值不相等时返回 True. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>VALUE1 != VALUE2</tt>",
  "Logical And &&": "逻辑与 &&",
  "True only if both values are true.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 && VALUE2</tt>": "仅当两个值均为真时结果才为真. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>VALUE1 && VALUE2</tt>",
  "Logical Or ||": "逻辑或 ||",
  "True if either value is true.<br>Represented in expressions as <tt>VALUE1 || VALUE2</tt>": "当两个值中任意一个为真时即返回真. <br>在表达式中表示为 <tt>VALUE1 || VALUE2</tt>",
  "Ternary Conditional": "三元条件运算",
  "No expr alias for '%s'": "不存在 '%s' 对应的表达式别名",
  "Copy a value without modification": "复制值但不做任何修改",
  "Cannot handle argument type '%s' in '%s'": "无法处理参数类型'%s', 出现在'%s'中",
  "Cannot handle argument types '%s' and '%s' in '%s'": "无法处理 '%s' 和 '%s' 这两种参数类型, 出现在 '%s' 中",
  "Note": "备注",
  "An independent note with no influence on other nodes.": "一条独立的注释, 不会对其他节点产生任何影响. ",
  "Outline": "概要",
  "A note with a border to be placed around other nodes. Fully surrounded nodes will stick to the note.": "带有边框的便签, 可放置在其他节点周围. 被完全包围的节点会吸附到该便签上. ",
  "Write comments on the canvas and optionally annotate regions of related nodes. Keywords: sticky, block, note.": "在画布上撰写注释, 还可选择性地为相关节点区域添加标记. 关键词: 便签、区块、注释. ",
  "Object to cast": "待转换的对象",
  "Cast Result": "投射结果",
  "Object of the appropriate type, if valid.": "如果有效, 则为类型匹配的对象. ",
  "Cast": "施法",
  "Test if an object is of the required type. If so, use that result as an object of the required type. Keywords: coerce, reinterpret.": "测试某个对象是否属于所需类型. 如果符合, 则将其作为所需类型的对象来使用. 关键词: 强制转换、重新解释. ",
  "Destination Type": "目标类型",
  "Could not determine type of outparam Result": "无法确定输出参数 Result 的类型",
  "Could not compile inparam Source": "无法编译输入参数'Source'",
  "Cast to %s": "发送至 %s",
  "Fire Child Cursors": "火焰儿童光标",
  "Fires multiple child cursors simultaneously, and optionally waits for completion. Similar to Timeline or Parallel Branch. This will split execution into many simultaneous branches.": "可同时触发多个子光标, 并可选是否等待它们执行完毕. 其功能类似于时间轴或并行分支. 此操作会将执行流程拆分为多个同时运行的分支. ",
  "Wait for Child Cursors": "等待子游标响应",
  "This call mode applies to all child cursors.": "此呼叫模式适用于所有子光标. ",
  "Num Child Cursors": "子光标数量",
  "Count of child cursors to spawn.": "要生成的子游标数量. ",
  "Wakes this node and ignores any child cursors which are still executing.": "唤醒此节点, 并忽略仍在执行中的任何子游标. ",
