  "Stagger": "错开/错位",
  "Steady": "稳定",
  "Ramp": "斜坡",
  "Default: Blend each control towards that control's default/neutral value": "默认: 将每个控件的值混合为其各自的默认/中性值",
  "Zero: Blend each control towards 0.0": "零: 将每个控制值混合为 0.0",
  "Half: Blend each control towards 0.5": "中等: 将每个控制值混合至 0.5",
  "One: Blend each control towards 1.0": "1. 将每个控制值逐步混合至 1.0",
  "Playhead: Blend each control towards that control's current value": "播放头: 将每个控制项的值逐渐混合至其当前值",
  "In: Blend each control towards that control's value at the start of the time selection": "方式: 将每个控件的值混合为时间选择起始点处该控件所对应的数值",
  "Out: Blend each control towards that control's value at the end of the time selection": "输出: 将每个控制项的值混合为时间选择区间终点的对应值",
  "Paste: Blend each control towards the values previously copied into the clipboard": "粘贴: 将每个控件的值混合为之前复制到剪贴板中的数值",
  "Drop: Blend each control towards that control's values prior to starting the floating modification layer": "操作说明: 在启用浮动修改层之前, 先将各控件的数值混合为该控件的初始值",
  "Jitter: Blend each control towards a copy of the control's values that have had noise added to them": "抖动效果: 将每个控件的值与添加了随机噪声后的值进行混合",
  "Smooth: Blend each control towards a smoothed copy of the control's values": "平滑处理: 将每个控件的值混合到其平滑后的副本中",
  "Stagger: Retime each control by a random amount, to offset them from each other": "交错效果: 为每个控件随机设置延时时间, 使其彼此错开",
  "Hold: Retime each control by shifting any animation in the falloff towards the hold region": "保持: 通过将衰减区域内的任意动画片段向保持区域移动, 来重新调整各控件的时序",
  "Release: Retime each control by shifting any animation in the falloff away from the hold region": "功能说明: 通过将衰减区域内的动画片段向远离保持区域的方向移动, 可重新调整各控件的时序",
  "Steady: Retime each control's animation towards having a constant velocity": "平稳模式: 重新调整每个控件的动画时间, 使其速度保持恒定",
  "Ramp: Blend each control towards a linear falloff between the start and end of the time selection's hold region": "渐变: 使各个控制参数以线性方式从时间选择区域内起始点过渡到结束点",
  "Spline: Blend each control towards a spline fitted through the control's values at the bookmarked times": "样条曲线: 将每个控制点的值混合为一条样条曲线, 该曲线穿过各书签时间点上的控制点",
  "Round: Blend each control towards a spline fitted through the four time selection times": "模式: 将各个控制点混合处理, 使其形成一条经过四个选定时间点的样条曲线",
