  "You can't manipulate a camera or light through the viewport when the head is outside the selected animation shot. Please select the current shot in the timeline to manipulate this camera or light.": "当头部位置位于所选动画片段之外时, 您无法通过视口来操控摄像机或灯光. 请在时间轴上选中当前片段, 方可对该摄像机或灯光进行操控. ",
